Ready to go?"Sure thing, sleepy head."Gimmick strat, go!"!The Empty Stone? Not likely."3I mean, it's good at keeping my lunch chilled."'And it's nice to look at, I guess."OBut, when I give it to one of my Pokémon, it seems to just wear them out."JI'm gonna keep it for now, see if I can't figure out the trick later."7Either way, it won't be showing up in this battle."0Never thought I'd get to try out that team."#Always seemed like a fun idea!"\I wasn't gonna enter the tournament with it, cause I figured the chances weren't great."'It's also just not as fun in 1v1s."&Thanks for humoring me, but uh..."4What're <i>your</i> feelings on the tournament?";Yeah, definitely! Kinda part of why I'm sore about it."2I'm hoping I'll be able to catch your rounds."I'll be cheering for you."NMaybe get some vicarious joy when you inevitably get the guy who beat me.";Just kidding! Holding grudges like that is exhausting."7You sure didn't say that like it was a good thing."5I guess I never asked about your family, before."9Whatever it is, I hope things turn out well for you."]Gonna go straight through this league and tournament and onto even greater glories, huh?"?If anyone could ride that momentum it’d probably be you."SJust remember to slow down long enough for me to catch you at your coronation."=Yeah, definitely! Kinda part of why I’m sore about it."*I cheered for you during your rounds."CGot some vicarious joy watching you beat your asshole brother."3Getting a bad vibe from the way you said that."-I guess I never asked about your family."5I saw a lot of tension during that grand finale."EWell, whatever happened between you two... hope things work out."%You felt that earthquake, right?":Heard some rumors that it might have been manmade...?"BSounds like something a Champion should look into. Wink wink."7I know you’re destined for even greater glories."2So... back to my memorial tour of the region."AFor our next stop I was thinking the <imp>Split Peaks.</imp>"MDown at the south end of the mountain, where it connects to the estuary.".Oh, almost forgot, I found this mushroom."I bequeath it to you."See ya!"?I saw a band of troubadours in that cave beyond the fence."%Do you know anything about them?"/I heard boisterous exclamations of wonder.".It's ever so compelling, don't you agree?":Maybe they're up to something...something suspicious?"No"Yes"Gimme 5 minutes."	Yup!"Using that item again?"Seems fun!"It's family business."I have bigger concerns."It was fun!"It was family business.Iu;␀/@[[�"Hey there. Miss me?"�I finally got here – all thanks to you. I have to say, you don’t look a mite worse for wear considering how much wilderness you trekked through."FI can’t cope as well as you can – I need a hot bath and soon."KThis is the place to be if one’s looking for avatars, or so I heard."_I must have heard right, because I’ve already found more than I can count on both hands."Are you in a rush?"WAll business and no pleasure might not make you dull, but it does make you a bore."XSo come on – we’re young and free. You can take a few minutes off, can’t you?"RSkyler, at your service. We met back in the grassland, between a few avatars."BThe sun and moon were smiling on us, you came to my rescue…"AI could exaggerate further but the truth is striking enough."VBut enough about the two of us. Let’s talk about the specters roaming the town.":They’re so… arrogant. Have you ever noticed that?"�They just don’t care about us fleshy creatures – human or Pokémon. All they seem to notice is the land, each other, and a few very specific objects."II know this asking a lot, but… can I borrow a Moon Stone from you?"IThe avatars seem to notice the incredible power inside those stones."cUnless you’re asking me why a Moon Stone, in which case, well, I decided apropos of nothing."ZThat’s not entirely true – I don’t want to offend them with a clashing element."AFire, Water, Sun, the like. And Moon just fits the ambience."mSafe bet, hmm? So if you have one to spare, please let me know. I’ll pay you back with interest later."bAh, fair. I am bringing business into pleasure again, aren’t I? I’m horribly bad at this.">Well, if you change your mind, you know where to find me.">I assure you, I’ll pay you back eventually, plus extra."iWell that was quick. Honestly, you shouldn’t be so generous! Someone could take advantage of that."fI’ve never turned down someone’s hospitality, especially someone like you, but take a minute."RThink about it. I’ll make sure to pay you back, but don’t rush into this."(So, care to part with a Moon Stone?"UJust come to see me, then? I appreciate it – and I appreciate seeing you, too."aYou’ll have to teach me how you stay so composed in places like this. Sometime later, hmm?""You hand over the Moon Stone."eThank you very much. I understand these are valuable, even leaving evolution out of the picture."PIf one of your Pokémon passed up evolution for this, give them my regards."JI’ll be sure to tell you the results of this offering next we meet."fAnd repay you, of course! What do you say to dinner? There’s a place in <imp>Prizca East</imp>."iWell, you can think on it – I need to track down an avatar, and you need to beat some gym leaders."Until we meet again."CI hate to be a spoilsport, but, uh, that isn’t a Moon Stone."tI appreciate the effort, trust me – you’re very generous. I just can’t work with it, though. You keep it."-Avatars seem to care about these stones."GI want to see if I can’t make an offering. Perhaps placate them?"OAnd a Moon Stone seems the least likely to offend the ones here in Velenz."pSomething like a Fire or Sun Stone would clash, and a Leaf or Dusk Stone is more of what they already have."#I promise it’s a good cause."ZMy cousin and I like to hang out here. Take in the cool atmosphere and the night sky.":We still battle people, but like... in a chill way..."0I'm gonna leave now. Don't like your vibes."ACan you feel the energy given off by those evolution stones?"&It's doing wonders for my stress."ZIs life worth living if you can't take time to be transfixed by the beauty of nature?"SA notice about the Makyan Regional Tournament has been hastily scribbled over."6A note added below reads "Not Taking Challengers""Velenz Gym"Leader: Rafael"..."hIt seems like the Gym Leader was supposed to write a title here, but the space has been left blank."9Improper planning ruined this place. I just know it."4Founding a town over a cave system? In a swamp?"BNo, no... I would anticipate such troubles. That's what I do."lI've even prepared a way to win battles: A very powerful move that deals damage after a two turn delay."`I'd like to teach one of your Pokemon this technique. I'm sure you can see the value in it."All according to plan."'Hm, I didn't expect you to say no."-The math... I must have miscalculated..."$Temporary Velenz Ranger Outpost""Velenz, proud home of-""7Claw marks on the sign render the text unreadable."=Don't tell the others, but I'm getting bored of waiting.">Well, might as well battle you before <i>they</i> arrive."BI saw a light come down from the sky and land west of Velenz."[I was hoping these stones would draw the aliens out, but it's been a week and nothing.":Since that failed, you can just take them. Good luck.")Losing? Now that's an alien feeling."TThat mansion near the menagerie must have something to do with the light I saw."TMy cousin says I'm paranoid, but I definitely saw the place glowing last night."3I thought this place was supposed to be scary."Just seems peaceful to me."$Eek! You're the scary one here!"(I'm afraid of bugs, but not ghosts."4To be honest, this town hasn't been that scary.";I'm having a good time, so I'll hang out here for now.",Got some rare things on sale, stranger!"Come back anytime."East: Repora Forest"South: Barren Crater",No earthlings allowed: that's the rule."7By the power of the Moon Stone, I will punish you!"%What? Friendship wasn't enough!?"<You're really gonna invade our special space like this?">I haven't been a real sailor since they scuttled my ship."I just like the clothes."	Shh."You want the stuff?"Forget you saw me."XFighting me's better than fighting any of those Avatars, I'd wager. Prove me right?"Understood."+I'll be here until you wish to battle."	Boo!"%I bow to thee, oh masterful one."'Eh, that was pretty good, I guess."(Heal up your party, get back to me."2Some rangers set up a rest spot to the south."TYou unlocked Rafael's front door?! That sure saves me the time and frustration."0Much appreciated, fellow trainer! Off I go!"|Rafael may have a layer of earth protecting him from the surface, but it doesn't protect him from my astral projection."bI've been watching his battles with some fervor. I wish to grasp the essence of his strategy."'It is, at its core, about dancing."WHis Oricorio and Alolan Marowak both gain power from dancing done by their allies."JIf one was feeling particularly devilish, one could aquire a Hattrem."OThat witch has a special ability which damages Pokémon who utilize dance."^There's supposed to be a gym leader around here, but he's not keen on taking challengers."6He lives <imp>underground</imp> like some hermit."8Even locked himself up to make it harder to get in."NApparently the <imp>lock combination code</imp> is somewhere in the town."JThis is all a bit too mental for me right now, so I'm taking a break."PA small handmade sign. It lists an eight-digit code in a big, blocky style."ooooooOOOOOooooooooo..."(OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOooooooooooooooooo..."4I’m being silly to distract myself from fear."?Anyway, let’s get a round of applause for Vanya and \PN!"<We’ve both been collecting badges at lightning speed."LPlus, I’m perfecting every gym leader, without even using held items!"?I’d say “not to brag”, but I am absolutely bragging.";To be fair, I <i>do</i> have the home field advantage."4I may not look it, but I was born in Novo Town."lMom and I traveled all over Makya—though she always left me at home when it was time to visit Velenz."-Told me to stay far, far away from here."DAnd that was <i>before</i> an avatar took over the PokéCenter."BSpeaking of, the best place to rest is <imp>down south</imp>."9A gaggle of grunts set up a <imp>healing spot</imp>."NIf you need me, I’ll be around, ready to battle at a moment’s notice!"HOh, by the way, don't worry about pronouns for me—I like 'em all."JWell, they <i>can</i> get a bit stale after a while, so... mix it up!"Why are you here?"Is this going somewhere?"Who are you?"	Why?"No way."
