ow it."4Founding a town over a cave system? In a swamp?"BNo, no... I would anticipate such troubles. That's what I do."lI've even prepared a way to win battles: A very powerful move that deals damage after a two turn delay."`I'd like to teach one of your Pokemon this technique. I'm sure you can see the value in it."All according to plan."'Hm, I didn't expect you to say no."-The math... I must have miscalculated..."$Temporary Velenz Ranger Outpost""Velenz, proud home of-""7Claw marks on the sign render the text unreadable."=Don't tell the others, but I'm getting bored of waiting.">Well, might as well battle you before <i>they</i> arrive."BI saw a light come down from the sky and land west of Velenz."[I was hoping these stones would draw the aliens out, but it's been a week and nothing.":Since that failed, you can just take them. Good luck.")Losing? Now that's an alien feeling."TThat mansion near the menagerie must have something to do with the light I saw."TMy cousin says I'm paranoid, but I definitely saw the place glowing last night."3I thought this place was supposed to be scary."Just seems peaceful to me."$Eek! You're the scary one here!"(I'm afraid of bugs, but not ghosts."4To be honest, this town hasn't been that scary.";I'm having a good time, so I'll hang out here for now.",Got some rare things on sale, stranger!"Come back anytime."East: Repora Forest"South: Barren Crater",No earthlings allowed: that's the rule."7By the power of the Moon Stone, I will punish you!"%What? Friendship wasn't enough!?"<You're really gonna invade our special space like this?">I haven't been a real sailor since they scuttled my ship."I just like the clothes."	Shh."You want the stuff?"Forget you saw me."XFighting me's better than fighting any of those Avatars, I'd wager. Prove me right?"Understood."+I'll be here until you wish to battle."	Boo!"%I bow to thee, oh masterful one."'Eh, that was pretty good, I guess."(Heal up your party, get back to me."2Some rangers set up a rest spot to the south."TYou unlocked Rafael's front door?! That sure saves me the time and frustration."0Much appreciated, fellow trainer! Off I go!"|Rafael may have a layer of earth protecting him from the surface, but it doesn't protect him from my astral projection."bI've been watching his battles with some fervor. I wish to grasp the essence of his strategy."'It is, at its core, about dancing."WHis Oricorio and Alolan Marowak both gain power from dancing done by their allies."JIf one was feeling particularly devilish, one could aquire a Hattrem."OThat witch has a special ability which damages Pokémon who utilize dance."^There's supposed to be a gym leader around here, but he's not keen on taking challengers."6He lives <imp>underground</imp> like some hermit."8Even locked himself up to make it harder to get in."NApparently the <imp>lock combination code</imp> is somewhere in the town."JThis is all a bit too mental for me right now, so I'm taking a break."PA small handmade sign. It lists an eight-digit code in a big, blocky style."ooooooOOOOOooooooooo..."(OOOOOOOOOOOOOOOooooooooooooooooo..."4I’m being silly to distract myself from fear."?Anyway, let’s get a round of applause for Vanya and \PN!"<We’ve both been collecting badges at lightning speed."LPlus, I’m perfecting every gym leader, without even using held items!"?I’d say “not to brag”, but I am absolutely bragging.";To be fair, I <i>do</i> have the home field advantage."4I may not look it, but I was born in Novo Town."lMom and I traveled all over Makya—though she always left me at home when it was time to visit Velenz."-Told me to stay far, far away from here."DAnd that was <i>before</i> an avatar took over the PokéCenter."BSpeaking of, the best place to rest is <imp>down south</imp>."9A gaggle of grunts set up a <imp>healing spot</imp>."NIf you need me, I’ll be around, ready to battle at a moment’s notice!"HOh, by the way, don't worry about pronouns for me—I like 'em all."JWell, they <i>can</i> get a bit stale after a while, so... mix it up!"Why are you here?"Is this going somewhere?"Who are you?"	Why?"No way."
Sure."Not yet."Here you go."Why do you want it?"Yes"No"	Yes?"No?"Maybe later."Sure, let's go.Iu;␀�[["STAY AWAY FROM MY PLANTS!",I give up. My plants are doomed to die."_To be honest, they're not even my plants. I just wanted to make a nice bouquet for Lainie."&I just want to protect my plants."OTo be honest, they're not even my plants. I don't know who left them here."_I was looking around the sinkhole for the Gym Leader, but he wasn't anywhere around there.["STAY AWAY FROM MY PLANTS!",I give up. My plants are doomed to die."_To be honest, they're not even my plants. I just wanted to make a nice bouquet for Lainie."&I just want to protect my plants."OTo be honest, they're not even my plants. I don't know who left them here."_I was looking around the sinkhole for the Gym Leader, but he wasn't anywhere around there.;["STAY AWAY FROM MY PLANTS!",I give up. My plants are doomed to die."_To be honest, they're not even my plants. I just wanted to make a nice bouquet for Lainie."&I just want to protect my plants."OTo be honest, they're not even my plants. I don't know who left them here."_I was looking around the sinkhole for the Gym Leader, but he wasn't anywhere around there.Iu;␀�[["6I'm training for my doctorate in Pokemon Biology."Q"Do some field work!", they said. "It'll look great on your CV!', they said."RNow here I am, battling the Raikou down there every day to prevent a rampage."-Can't say I'm learning nothing though..."KPhew... Glad that's over. I've had enough battling to last a lifetime."\Time to transfer all my notes to PDF format. Hope the scanners aren't reserved today..."KNovo College sends us a daily batch of healing items to keep us going."[It's useful, but I don't think my team appreciates getting revived four times a day..."7Sheesh, felt the shockwaves all the way back here.".Must have been rough. Glad you showed up."\The only thing that's kept Novo safe from this Avatar is us members of the Battle Club."^The regular folks sure are lucky so many skilled trainers decided to concentrate there...""Wowie, now that was a battle!"2The club's gonna love to hear about this one."2You should totally come give a talk sometime.["6I'm training for my doctorate in Pokemon Biology."Q"Do some field work!", they said. "It'll look great on your CV!', they said."RNow here I am, battling the Raikou down there every day to prevent a rampage."-Can't say I'm learning nothing though..."KPhew... Glad that's over. I've had enough battling to last a lifetime."\Time to transfer all my notes to PDF format. Hope the scanners aren't reserved today..."KNovo College sends us a daily batch of healing items to keep us going."[It's useful, but I don't think my team appreciates getting revived four times a day..."7Sheesh, felt the shockwaves all the way back here.".Must have been rough. Glad you showed up."\The only thing that's kept Novo safe from this Avatar is us members of the Battle Club."^The regular folks sure are lucky so many skilled trainers decided to concentrate there...""Wowie, now that was a battle!"2The club's gonna love to hear about this one."2You should totally come give a talk sometime.;["6I'm training for my doctorate in Pokemon Biology."Q"Do some field work!", they said. "It'll look great on your CV!', they said."RNow here I am, battling the Raikou down there every day to prevent a rampage."-Can't say I'm learning nothing though..."KPhew... Glad that's over. I've had enough battling to last a lifetime."\Time to transfer all my notes to PDF format. Hope the scanners aren't reserved today..."KNovo College sends us a daily batch of healing items to keep us going."[It's useful, but I don't think my team appreciates getting revived four times a day..."7Sheesh, felt the shockwaves all the way back here.".Must have been rough. Glad you showed up."\The only thing that's kept Novo safe from this Avatar is us members of the Battle Club."^The regular folks sure are lucky so many skilled trainers decided to concentrate there...""Wowie, now that was a battle!"2The club's gonna love to hear about this one."2You should totally come give a talk sometime.Iu;␀�![[P" The berry plant is growing."oSince the Eleig River is in the halfway point of Makya, it's become quite the gathering spot for Trainers."QThe trainers on the long stretch of river to the East are relatively casual.":That is, until you reach the desert research station."hThe trainers to the west are a bit more serious, especially as one approaches the Cave of Hatching."Hey, yo. Remember me?"3Eifion – guy with the Phione? How you doing?"*Awesome. You doing the gym challenge?"0Ah, what am I asking – of course you are."QNobody hauls around a killer team like that just for fun. Good luck on that."SSure, sure. Don’t mean to pry or anything. Happy to see you’re holding up."LYeah, I get that. I’ve been, uh, yeah, through the wringer, y’know?"*But you just gotta keep your head up."&Anyways, how about a quick match?"MPhione here hasn’t been slacking, and I want to show it a proper duel."You down?"cOh, yeah, take your time. I think I might need a few minutes to get Phione psyched up anyways."'Thanks. Don’t go easy on me, OK?"Whoa. We actually did it."GNot without some scrapes here and there – wait, let me heal you.".Figure I might as well pay you back, huh?"^Uh, kinda? I’ve trained worse, but, uh, this little fella isn’t exactly a juggernaut.">I wouldn’t be quaking in my boots if I had to face one."7OK, I think Phione’s good to go. Ready to fight?"3Good fight, good fight! Phione, you did great."OI mean, \PN, you obviously did way better, but, hey, that’s how it goes."wI used to do a lot better than this. Was pretty good, if I do say so myself, but, eh, it wasn’t really worth it."pYou ever run into someone yelling at his Pokémon after he loses and just think, like, who raised this guy?"DLike, yeah, you get results, but it’s not really sustainable."UThey have to feel like living, feeling beings first, and tools of battle second."Or, like, fifth."&You get what I’m saying, right?"fFigured as much. Look at me talking at you as if you aren’t obviously a better trainer than me."rI’m OK, but I make a lot of sloppy mistakes. Still trying to learn that whole positive reinforcement thing."LYou just gotta make them feel loved, and then they’ll try their best."RPushing them hard wrings potential out of them faster, but it burns them out."CEventually they’ll snap back, or just give up. Or leave you."iWell, sure, but they’re more than tools. They’re alive, and they have their own wants and needs."XAnd if you kinda lean into that, it works so much better than ordering them around."\Or… maybe not. Obviously you know what you’re doing. I’m not gonna preach to you."RI’ve talked enough. Probably should be listening more, but, uh, I gotta go."LMakya’s a big place, and Phione and I are gonna tour the whole thing."FAnd the rest of us, of course. So, uh, see you. And thanks again."xLi'l bit of havoc going down around here, just like the good ol' days! I'll show ya why we used to be the top dogs!"OBeaten by another freakishly-talented kid? Deja vu, that's what that is..."TAh, you ain't nothing. I could beat you any day of the week. Just not... today."!I totally lost my surfboard!"At least I can swim."Prizca Bridge"%Prizca Sewers Auxiliary Entrance"hA line which might have read "Authorized Personnel Only" has been crisscrossed with crude graffiti."YI was thinking of bringing my toddlers to see the bridge. Guess that plan is ruined."Field trip's cancelled!";I'll look on my phone for anything interesting nearby."(Maybe I schedule a trip to the Gym?"North: Prizca West"South: County Park"West: Frostflow Farms"East: Eleig Stretch"YWhy'd they send a waitress to keep watch when an avatar's on the prowl? This is why!"}So, uh, when I said "this is why!" I was supposed to then beat you, and that, uh, didn't happen. So... I'm just gonna go now."dWell, uh... I guess you're gonna have to cover my shift, 'cause I gotta go hit the Pokécenter."aNow that the bridge is gone, I can swim in peace. Or I could if it wasn't for kids like you!"7Wow, you're just as annoying as the cars. I'm out."ECool surfing kid, but don't put me in the splash zone next time."DNo one else comes here, so I guess we're just a little strange."Great."
