ead. That something is about to happen."7That a few words could cause something to wake up."AStop! The law states clearly that this is an illegal action!"QA ranger station is above us, in Grouz. I know that because I saw it myself."7I will go there to report your illegal activities."TAs an agent of the law, I am dissapointed that I was not able to overpower you.":I'm sure there'll be some rare Pokémon to find here!"MEarly Chasm reports talk about a metallic giant lurking among the trees."JSomething they didn't expect to see here, so, I don't mean Registeel."0Maybe you'll be able to find it. Good luck."5Collecting a loss like that wasn't on my agenda.Iu;␀�[[D"EOne moment – there we go. I’m going to take notes this time."bI’ll admit it: I’m curious. What do you bring to the table that no other challenger does?"`No matter what praise Tamarind or the others heap upon you, don’t let it go to your head."/I’m rather more rigorous in my analyses."Let’s begin."?All of that work to get here and now you test my patience?"-Ugh. Go. I can work while you’re gone."*I reared Team Chasm from its infancy."<I turned this place from wilderness to a modern region."%I am the beating heart of Makya."HFine! One of us needs to be humbled. Show me which one of us it is."QDon’t expect this to be easy simply because I work from behind the scenes.")I made this region what it is today."]Show me what you can do – or are you just what you’ve inherited from Mavis? Show me!"SNo! I can’t – how? Eight years and I still can’t beat an arrogant child!">No, no, you and your Pokémon deserve the Patience Badge."8No, no, you and your Pokémon deserve that victory."sJust do me a favor and beat Tamarind just as badly someday. You’re not the only one with a childish rivalry."^Although – and you may know where I’m going with this – there is one other thing..."@My decision to not employ gym trainers is paying dividends."2Now there’s no one to watch me keep losing."5Your victory was unexpected, but not undeserved."/You’re not the child I thought you were."(I’m happy to give you this badge."dOh, and I would be very interested in another duel – there’s more for me to learn from you."MI’ll make the time, whenever you want to give me yours. Good day, \PN."FA screensaver image of a Luxray bounces lazily around the screen."Yo, champ in the making!"*Helena runs a tight ship around here."=Even I can't get away with just standing around all day!"oHelena understands that efficiency comes from information, and information from the flow of communication."RThat's why she's focused her gym around Electric-type and Water-type Pokemon!"=They're a strong pair in battles, sharing no weaknesses."Firstly, Grass-type Pokemon are your best bet against her, since they're strong against Water- types, and resist Electric."JSecondarily, Dragon-type Pokemon will resist both Water and Electric."UFinally, mirroring her with Electric-type Pokemon of your own can work well too."=They're strong against Water-types, and resist Electric."Hope that helps!"5You out-maneuvered Team Chasm's best strategist!":Congratulations, I hope you feel good about that one!"gWe were initially hesitant to partake in constructing gyms, but we chose to do so for two reasons."%Firstly, it provided legitimacy."KSecondly, it allowed us to find exceptional trainers such as yourself."~I would like you to take this key, with the understanding that through the door it unlocks is a particularly dangerous avatar."4Obliterate it. Show me that our search is over."QYou'll find the problem at the north wall of Team Chasm HQ. Well, former HQ."uThe avatar still exists. I’m patient, but I would be lying if I said I didn’t yearn for the day it was gone."+It is my most-despised responsibility.",Search the north wall of Team Chasm HQ."It’s gone?"~I never thought I’d share Andris’s joy in seeing a problem -- how would he put it? -- deep-sixed, but this does feel good."[Thank you. That’s a weight off of my shoulders, not to mention proof