d – a prison for an avatar that’s been locked up for years."|I was told that if I ever grew strong enough -- or found someone strong enough -- it was my duty to destroy that thing."(Well, I think I’ve found someone."Take it."\Someday you’ll understand why this is happening, but it ain’t my place to tell you."uMake sure you've got a full team. You'll need three fighters to even attempt it, since it's a legendary Pokemon."XI'll wait here until you've defeated the thing. Not much else as important as this."KEven the avatar of Zeraora couldn't stop you. You continue to impress!"\PN! Good to see you."jYou know, I might have some questions to ask you. I’m thinking of taking on a gym challenge myself."qNot Makya’s, of course. Somewhere distant. I’ve spent enough time shadowboxing. I want a real challenge!"eAh, well. I’ve still got work here to do. Some day I’ll ask you about how being Champion is."Some day.Iu;␀R[["$Empty bottles of seltzer water.["'Garrafas vazias de água com gás.;["$Empty bottles of seltzer water.0Iu;␀V[[U"3I found some of these token things in my room."ONow I'm foreign to Makya, but I can tell when I've got something valuable."dTell ya what. Give me a bit of cash, and I might find it in my heart to part with one o' these.""5000 sound like a good price?";Alright, don't tell me I didn't give you a sweet deal."<Alrightie then, which one of these do ya like the most?"\PN hands over $5000."?You're just giving me this money to safekeep or something?":Alright then, talk to me when you've made a decision."Here ya go."Have a good one."TIt seems you're flat broke. Maybe check you're wallet before making a purchase."$You ready to pick one of these?"(Did ya find any use for that token?")Aromatic flowers from other regions."7Photobooks of some of the greatest views in Makya."2The one on the cover is near Whitebloom Town."�A news program is airing which claims to prove that the Avatar crisis was only possible because of slipping education standards."0You don't really understand the connection.")Hiking in Makya has a certain charm."BThe region's development is new--not too new, but new enough."@There's many spots of beautiful wilderness left to explore.",You shouldn't be talking to a door now."HYou grab a book on the history of Prizca and open to a random page."�"The Defenestration of Prizca is a well-known event where a politician was shoved through a second floor window of Prizca Castle.""o"The lesser-known Refenestration of Prizca was when his partner Pokémon used Bounce to send him back in.""%My parents are going to kill me."?I brought back a non-native Pokemon from my trip to Unova."IIt's a Heatmor, and it always looks like it wants to burn something."*I'm honestly worried about my health."^Having a Dark-type is something I can also brag about, maybe with less burning potential.".If you've got one, I'll trade you for it.":Guess I'll have to talk to a different stranger then."Dang, you have nothing?"'I thought you'd have one for sure."#Whoa! That Pokemon looks sick!"4Definitely gonna take a few photos of this guy."BEveryone I know is going wild over the Pokemon you traded me."1I've got a whole 83 likes on my latest post."SAn atlas of Makya sits on top of brochures for river cruises in other regions."5Only registered guests can go beyond this point."UYou'll either have to make a reservation, or have a current guest invite you in."TDuring my illustrious sailing career, I conquered every sea of this wide world.";With no challenges ahead of me, I began to grow bored."SI was suddenly struck by an idea--an ambitious journey through Makya's canals!"NI wasn't able to uh... complete my voyage, but I don't regret it one bit!"M"Rapidash, Zebstrika, and Mudsdale: Equine Symbolism and the First King"")Over half of this book is footnotes."XBetween you and me, working as a Team Chasm grunt was so much better than this job."HHere I have to smile all the time and deal with stuck-up customers."HBack then, I could just sic