e.Iu;␀�[[:"rA male and female TV host are all smiles as they take a walkthrough of a historic Prizca East house for sale."\Cyndaquil is entertaining itself by repeatedly extinguishing and reigniting the candle."FOh, you must be that kid I’ve heard so much about! How are you?"3Of course! \PN, right? I hear a lot of things.";Haha! You mean you don’t see the family resemblance?"UOh, well that’s good. I hope my daughter doesn’t cause you too much trouble."?Hah! Yeah, she’ll do that to ya if you aren’t careful."&I’m Yezera’s mom, by the way."eI don’t see her much at all these days, but I find out what she’s up to. One way or another."YI know there’s a lot going on around these parts. And that’s all I care to know."YIf Yezera wants to traipse around with masked ne’er-do-wells, that’s her choice.".She’ll let me know if it’s important."8Another one? Whatever happened to that Alessa girl?"eSeems like she up and disappeared just about when Yezera did. Sweet girl... ah, don’t mind me."+Reminiscing about the good ol’ days."POh, you’re so sweet. She, uh, she doesn’t have many friends. Never has."sAnd that’s OK – I just know she wishes she had someone to talk to. I hope you two take care of each other."BShe’s that kind of gal. Don’t be too hard on her, though."\She’s been through a lot. Besides, if you hurt her I’d have to kick your ass, 'kay?"LHah, well, don’t mind me. You’ve got things to do and places to be."7I do too, if I can be honest with ya for a moment."[But if you want to ask any questions about Yezera, just about nobody knows her better."#OK. Well, best of luck to you."{Go easy on Yezera, but don’t go easy on her, if you know what I mean? I’ll be waiting to see how it all goes down."Goodbye!"5Oh, that? Don’t you believe what anybody says.":She was born that way – trust me! I was there! Heh."rPeople make a big deal out of it, but it wasn’t anything special. Never wanted to use a prosthetic, either."8She’d much rather have her Pokémon help her out.";Very well-trained. Helped out around the house plenty."^She got Artemisia as a Togepi when she was young. Her starter, if you wanna call it that."gShe spent all her free time down in the caves, and one day she was trailing a li’l Larvitar too."YThat little bastard grew up to be Autochthon. The others she caught who knows where.">Oh, that. Yezera never did get along with humans so well."kCould barely handle going to school. It wasn’t until she started adventuring that she made a friend."2Alessa – maybe you’ve seen her? Good kid."YYezera always did disappear when she got stressed, though. Nowadays is no different."\Wish she could talk to me... but I’m no different than every other human, I s’pose."Any more questions?"(A small book, with a creased spine."6it appears to be some sort of political thriller."You know me?"Who are you?"
