rity to stop you, I would ask you refrain from entering the area to the west."aNovo College has sent me to study the curious ecological conditions of the shipwrecks there."[We have a unique opportunity to study deep water Pokémon dredged up around the ships!"-However, the shipwrecks are dangerous..."a...but you're going to go in anyways, aren't you? Well, I warned you, so my hands are clean."Hey, you!"Yeah, you, get over here!"mI picked up this bike in Novo Town. The people up there are crazy for bikes, so it was easy to find one."UFor the same reason, though, everyone already got one, so I wasn't able to sell.":Seems like the whole job was a bust, so just take it."BYou never saw me, and I didn't cause you any problems. Peace." The berry plant is growing."3It looks excited to take on the next shipment!"North: Shipping Lane"7These docks may look small, but they're important."REvery week a shipment comes of groceries and other necessities for Novo Town."PThey get some stuff from the big city, but can't rely on it for everything."eMt. Kilna makes it harder to get stuff in between, even with Gigalith's Guts cutting through it."Not right now."
