ouse in the Shipping Lane! Destroy it, and rid me of the damnable thing for good!"hOh? Have you sent the avatar back from whence it came?! Excellent! Your talents are second-to-none!")I thought this gym would be a cinch."EA whole team of fish couldn't possibly lose to a Fire- type gym!":I totally forgot that Poison is strong against Water."TWhat, do you miss the lick of flames and bite of acid? Shall we duel once more?"$Congratulations on reaching me!"TAnd congratulations to all your Pokémon! Especially the ones that are on fire!"XShow us what you’re made of and push through that pain! Just a little longer now!"(Are you ready for the grand finale?"ZGo on, then! Take a minute! Get your Pokémon some antidotes, or a fire extinguisher!"PVery well, challenger! I present to you the fullest onslaught I can muster!"3Every other gym leader is a coward, but not I!"II know that there is only way to test someone: Over! Whelming! PAIN!"Now overcome it, or fall!"ILovely! Make no mistake: my panoply of agony takes no half measures."7I’ll test you with fire and acid, claw and fang!",Unyielding! Devastating! Indefatigable!"@Let me tend to the Pokémon while you bask in your victory.",Not to mention: the Perseverance Badge!"aIf you can overcome my gym in such blazing style, I can surely expect great things from you."APerhaps... there is something we absolutely must talk about!"YI’ve got a mission for you, challenger! Something worthy of your skill, I promise."7Good! Good! Never let that fire within you go out!"-Your victory was delightfully explosive!"+I could use more challengers like you!"3Wow! I’m feeling the burn – how about you?"%I’ll get your Pokémon healed."=That for them, and this for you: the Perseverance Badge!"ZI yearn for the day I might challenge you again! Either here, or in the Championship!"So long!"CBruh... this waiting room doesn't have any places to sit down."3No pain, no gain? Must be what Eko's thinking."nThis is not a lab! It is a gym! In labs we have safety precautions. Here, unsafe conditions are the goal!"LOh-ho? So you want safe passage? Very well. You've earned the shortcut."iThe wild reaches of Makya won't have safety guidelines. If you can endure this, you can endure them."5White text flies by on a dark purple background."Yo, champ in the making!"EEko is the gym leader here, and they love pain in all its forms."@Therefore they picked Fire and Poison as their specialties."LAll battles, against Eko or the gym trainers, are 2v2! Double the pain!"gGround-types, especially with moves that hit both opposing Pokemon, are rather strong in this gym."=Psychic-types and Rock-types are none too shabby either.">The final piece to this gym's puzzle are the teleporters."_See those blue pads? The ones the trainers are protecting will teleport you past the maze."IIf you don't unlock them, you'll find yourself walking a harsh path!"'Grats on beating the gym!"+You pushed through the pain just fine."@Sorry for blocking the way, but I'm desperately dehydrated.">You have a <imp>Fresh Water</imp>! I'll be taking that..."/The man takes a Fresh Water from your bag."(Ahhhh.... that helps a lot. Thanks." Consider the lockdown over."�The scientists keep offering me liquids in beakers, but I've had too many close calls with caustic chemicals to just trust 'em on the contents."MI can't leave my post, so blocking the gym entrance is my only leverage."_I'm plopping down here until a challenger like yourself grabs me a <imp>Fresh Water</imp>."SThere are <imp>vending machines</imp> in all PokéCenters and Ranger Stations."`I hope you won't find this cruel. The suffering I'm about to inflict is strictly necessary."...Noted. Please avail yourself of this teleporter. Taking the long way may subject any afflicted Pokemon to undue injury."lThank you for your participation. Step carefully, now! Wouldn't want any lingering side effects... heh."JA 3-D model displays the the chemical makeup of Makyan Tangela venom.")Our glorious Champion! Good evening!"c