o work at the ice rink for my summer job."1Escape the heat! Make some cash! Great idea!"AAnd it would have been, had none of the customers showed up."BI hate it here. Can't wait for school to start so I can quit."MThis job is rough. We're working nine hours a shift, five shifts a week."SGot an offer from an insurance company in Prizca. Cushy job. Way lower stress."ABut I'd feel bad taking my Seel with me to some city office.":I've always loved Bug-types. Trade me a Bug for Seel?"FI guess I can work here a little longer. Just for my little Seel."%Why'd you fake me out like that?"%Give her a good home, won't you?"-And now to put in my two weeks notice...""I love my bugs. Big or small."<Hopefully they'll love Aegis Insurance as much as I do!"No"Yes["JI thought it would be cool to work at the ice rink for my summer job."1Escape the heat! Make some cash! Great idea!"AAnd it would have been, had none of the customers showed up."BI hate it here. Can't wait for school to start so I can quit."MThis job is rough. We're working nine hours a shift, five shifts a week."SGot an offer from an insurance company in Prizca. Cushy job. Way lower stress."ABut I'd feel bad taking my Seel with me to some city office.":I've always loved Bug-types. Trade me a Bug for Seel?"FI guess I can work here a little longer. Just for my little Seel."%Why'd you fake me out like that?"%Give her a good home, won't you?"-And now to put in my two weeks notice...""I love my bugs. Big or small."<Hopefully they'll love Aegis Insurance as much as I do!"No"Yes;["JI thought it would be cool to work at the ice rink for my summer job."1Escape the heat! Make some cash! Great idea!"AAnd it would have been, had none of the customers showed up."BI hate it here. Can't wait for school to start so I can quit."MThis job is rough. We're working nine hours a shift, five shifts a week."SGot an offer from an insurance company in Prizca. Cushy job. Way lower stress."ABut I'd feel bad taking my Seel with me to some cit