el and see our true identities in the fractures."cNot without me you don’t! I’d rather you hex me than try and perform a reading without me!"2The both of us, against our beloved traveler!"AFine… I’ll hold my horses. But don’t leave us waiting."FGood! Quail before my inner fire, and reveal your soul to my eye!")…You battle with shocking clarity.")Unbowed, even before the both of us."Fascinating…"9These hairline fractures… the ice shrapnel… hmm."%It portends nonsense. Gibberish."?That both of us are dead already, and the same regardless."AAnd look at the scarring around our oh-so-helpful ritualist?"So your name is \PN."[And, what, you will walk backwards? You are a bridge that opposes heroes and villains?"ESomething about nostalgia, but I think you stepped on that part."gNothing of use, then. Not to us, at least. I hope our makeshift augury at least did you some good."aIf not, forgive this flight of fancy wasting your time. Remember: SHE came up with the idea."IHmm… maybe this trip was worth more than that changeling imagines."ZIf you ever find yourself in the <imp>urban expanse</imp> with naught to do, find me."dI’ll be in the <imp>business sector</imp>, like as not. I have plans involving you and yours."Whoa! Is all well?"[Here – I suppose I can spare some supplies. Let us get your team in shape, shall we?"0Go find out if my… companion… is ready.".She requires far more preparation than I."Have you made ready?"iIf you ever find yourself in the <imp>urban expanse</imp> of Prizca West with naught to do, find me."iI’ll be mourning near <imp>Bogdan Cement</imp>, like as not. I have plans involving you and yours."Why are you here?"Can I help?"...What?"Hold up."Let's go.[1"hEntão és tu novamente. Presumo que o amuleto de minha impostora está lhe mantendo em segurança?"7Meu nome – nosso nome – é <imp>Imogene</imp>."AA Ditto deve estar por perto, imagino. Não posso perdê-la."QEstávamos vagando por Kalos antes de decidirmos voltar para casa, em Makya."ZSe formos capazes de resolver esta questão de identidade em algum lugar, será aqui."7E, quanto a esta caverna, tenho um pedido a fazer."?De fato, podes. Não escolhi esta estéril caverna à toa."_É um lugar poderoso, e pretendo provar que sou a Imogene verdadeira de uma vez por todas."*suspiro*"uSou a verdadeira Imogene. A outra mulher – parecida comigo – é minha sósia Ditto, e afirma o exato oposto."1E desejo prová-la como errada aqui e agora."wOssos rachados pelo fogo podem ser lidos para prever o futuro. O gelo forma um espelho que reflete quem o observa."rCombinemos ambos – abramos crateras neste gelo com um duelo e, nas fraturas, vislumbremos nossa identidade."hNada disso, não sem mim! Preferiria que me amaldiçoasse a que tentasse fazer uma leitura sem mim!".Nós duas, contra nosso querido viajante!"BTudo bem… vou segurar a onda. Mas não deixe-nos esperando."SÓtimo! Trema ao ver meu fogo interior queimar e revele tua alma ao meu olhar!"'…Batalhas com espantosa clareza."*Inabalável, mesmo perante nós duas."Fascinante…":Essas microfissuras… os estilhaços de gelo… hmm."3Agouram somente bobagens. Não há nexo algum."CDizem que ambas estamos mortas, e, mesmo assim, somos uma só."ME, tu, podes analisar as marcas ao redor de nosso cooperante ritualista?"Então… teu nome é \PN."_E – quê? – Andarás contra multidões? És uma ponte que interpõe heróis e vilões?"=Algo sobre nostalgia, mas creio que pisaste nesta parte."uNada crucial, então. Ao menos, não para nós. Espero que nossa improvisada augúria lhe tenha feito algum bem."jCaso contrário, perdoe este devaneio que lhe custou teu tempo. Lembra-te: foi ELA quem teve a ideia."XHmm… talvez esta viagem tenha valido mais a pena do que aquele metamorfo imagina."bSe tu, por acaso, te encontrares na <imp>extensão urbana</imp> com nada a fazer, me procure."bEstarei no <imp>setor empresarial</imp>, provavelmente. Tenho planos envolvendo tu e os teus."Opa! Estás bem?"YAqui – suponho que eu possa ceder alguns suprimentos. Curarei tua equipe, que tal?";Vá perguntar se minha… companheira… está pronta."6Ela precisa de muito mais preparação do que eu."Preparaste-te?"vSe tu, por acaso, te encontrares na <imp>extensão urbana</imp> da Prizca Ocidental com nada a fazer, me procure."kEstarei lamentando na <imp>Bogdan Cimentos</imp>, provavelmente. Tenho planos envolvendo tu e os teus."Por que você está aqui?"Posso ajudar?"...Quê?"Espera um pouco."Vamos.;[1"OSo it’s you again. I presume my impostor’s amulet is keeping you safe?"4My name – our name – is <imp>Imogene</imp>."LThe Ditto is around here somewhere, I imagine. I can’t ever lose her."CWe were wandering Kalos before deciding to come home to Makya."HIf we can settle this matter of identity anywhere, it will be here.",And as for this cave, I have a request."AIndeed you can. I did not choose this barren cave at random."\It is a place of power, and I intend to prove myself the real Imogene once and for all."*sigh*"vI am the real Imogene. The other woman that looks like me is my Ditto doppelganger, who claims just the opposite."3And I would like prove her wrong here and now."cFire-cracked bones can be read to divine the future. Ice forms a mirror that reflects oneself."iLet us combine the two – crater this ice with a duel and see our true identities in the fractures."cNot without me you don’t! I’d rather you hex me than try and perform a reading without me!"2The both of us, against our beloved traveler!"AFine… I’ll hold my horses. But don’t leave us waiting."FGood! Quail before my inner fire, and reveal your soul to my eye!")…You battle with shocking clarity.")Unbowed, even before the both of us."Fascinating…"9These hairline fractures… the ice shrapnel… hmm."%It portends nonsense. Gibberish."?That both of us are dead already, and the same regardless."AAnd look at the scarring around our oh-so-helpful ritualist?"So your name is \PN."[And, what, you will walk backwards? You are a bridge that opposes heroes and villains?"ESomething about nostalgia, but I think you stepped on that part."gNothing of use, then. Not to us, at least. I hope our makeshift augury at least did you some good."aIf not, forgive this flight of fancy wasting your time. Remember: SHE came up with the idea."IHmm… maybe this trip was worth more than that changeling imagines."ZIf you ever find yourself in the <imp>urban expanse</imp> with naught to do, find me."dI’ll be in the <imp>business sector</imp>, like as not. I have plans involving you and yours."Whoa! Is all well?"[Here – I suppose I can spare some supplies. Let us get your team in shape, shall we?"0Go find out if my… companion… is ready.".She requires far more preparation than I."Have you made ready?"iIf you ever find yourself in the <imp>urban expanse</imp> of Prizca West with naught to do, find me."iI’ll be mourning near <imp>Bogdan Cement</imp>, like as not. I have plans involving you and yours."Why are you here?"Can I help?"...What?"Hold up."Let's go.0Iu;␀�[[
