"IShe got other lackeys, good on her, but I ain't gonna be one of 'em."1Go ruin her day, kid. I’ll see you around."fHey, next time I see ya, drinks are on me. Call it my way of making up to you. Heh. So long, kid."X\PN, go ruin her day. I wish I was good enough to do it myself, but I just ain’t."RYou understand her well enough. She’ll listen to you, one way or the other."~And, uh, sorry. For makin’ this all ‘bout her. If things were any different, I’d love to chat ‘bout other things."<Maybe some day, yeah? I’ll see you around, I promise."nYou come back and there’s still bars left in the world, drinks are on me, y’hear? See ya around, kid."3A booklet emblazoned with the Team Chasm logo."...Your phone is ringing."2It’s... your mother. It’s Mavis. Pick up?"8Hey, \PN? I’ve been trying to call you for hours!"�Congratulations! You decimated Zain in the tournament, and my boots on the ground are telling me that you’ve done some extracurriculars."[Saved the region, I hear? Very impressive, \PN. You shattered my wildest expectations."�Now, I haven’t been able to get in contact with Zain, but to be honest, after that showing...? I’m not sure we have much to talk about right now."sIgnore him, though. He’s just moping because he couldn’t beat you. To be honest, I never thought he could."�Today’s about you. Aww, honey, you did so well! I can get a private flight scheduled to get you back home ASAP. I’ve got big plans for you."�You are my number one asset right now, and I want to show you the vacation you deserve. Business can wait – but there will be business."qWith your skills and my influence, I’ll secure you an exceedingly comfortable position within the company.".So, what date works for you to come home?"bTomorrow morning? Or do you want to sleep in? We’ll make it tomorrow evening, just in case."YYou – you what? Excuse me? Is there some kind of arrangement I don’t know about?"_Are you – are you eloping? Have you been offered a job there? You do understand what –"FOh, good. I’ll start making plans for our vacation immediately."#You’ve worked so hard and..."AMavis continues on for a few minutes before she lets you go."JShe says she loves you, and goodbye, and she’ll see you again soon."MYou’ll tell her that a certain someone said hi when you meet her next.":You’ll be her second-in-command and second-to-last."0...You thought it’d make you feel warmer."9You’ve never not picked up for your mother before."&It’s Mavis. You have to answer."...No, you don’t.",Thanks for completing Pokemon Tectonic!"UPlease consider filling out the Playtest Survey that is linked on the main menu."?Your feedback helps a lot to continue to improve the game."2You? I... I remember... outside of Novo Town.">You aren’t – I mean, you are – it doesn’t matter."OYou’re here. I’m here. I have more Pokémon to train. A duel? Doubles.":W-well, I could ask you the same thing. Can we start?"?Then go! Don’t bother me and then not even – whatever."5But you’re not getting past me without a duel."-Good. OK. No more talking. Just... this."9That was -- you’re... yeah, you are, aren’t you?"fIf you’re looking deeper in the caves, then I -- I mean, if you don’t mind, may I come along?"�I have healing items for the both of us. It’s dangerous and we -- I’d like to talk. And that’s...  that’s not very common for me."ASo? I’m not moving until I get a double battle out of you.",I need to... oh, just fight me already!":That was – you’re... yeah, you are, aren’t you?"gIf you’re looking deeper in the caves, then I – I mean, if you don’t mind, may I come along?";Ah, you’re back. I, uh, don’t have much to do yet.".And we still haven’t finished our talk."2Some loose paper displaying the LuxTech logo."LLeaving through -- oh. You -- you’re looking for something down here."2Come back and, uh, I’ll still be... around." So you lead with \pfp, hmm?".Tell me – would you tell me about them?"-Good, good. You seem to be good friends."hMy Togekiss, Artemisia, has been mine since I was – oh, sorry. I shouldn’t... let’s continue.".Oh, is that so? Well, maybe it’ll grow."bMy Togekiss, Artemisia, used to be a liability, but she became my most trusted – excuse me.":I’m – why am I – whatever. Let’s keep moving."%I’m glad you found them, then."bThe only reason I have Artemisia, my Togekiss, is a story about a Togekiss from my childhood."MI’ve loved – sorry. I’m getting carried away – let’s continue."*Hah, well, I know what that’s like."QI rarely get to use my true team – my, uh, friends give me teams to train."mMy Togekiss, Artemisia, gets used more for flying than – oh, I’m – excuse me. Let’s keep moving."RAnother avatar... so strange. They aren’t spirits – not like Ghost-types."cI’ve never found an avatar of a man-made Pokémon, but there are avatars of fossil Pokémon."Almost as if... hmm." What do you think they are?"AOh – uh, I’m sorry, I’m not used to getting responses."I mostly talk to Pokémon."HPlease excuse my rambling, I – but you’re right.  Nobody knows."COh – I suppose – sorry, I’m used to talking to Pokémon."AI’m not used to my rambling being – I mean, I’m sorry."/You said illusions? And yet they... hmm..."VOh – you – I’m sorry, excuse my ramblings. I usually talk to, um, Pokémon."/And they don’t – I mean – ignore me."?But you have a good hypothesis, I think. Except...  hmm..."mOh – I didn’t – sorry. Excuse me, I forgot that you – I mean, I’m used to talking to Pokémon."EI’m – I’m not used to… whatever. Forget I said anything.":Were you down here for this – whatever all this is?"'That Linoone dragged it down here."8Even if you weren’t… it’s valuable. Trust me."3Barter and blackmail are Makya’s currencies."SAnd this <imp>Chasm keycard</imp> – I haven’t – it’s been a long time."<Take it. I don’t need it, and Helena won’t miss it.";It’ll get you into some <imp>dangerous places</imp>."I used to – oh."XOh. Oh, I just – I – I’m sorry. I shouldn’t be imposing upon you like this."KI’ve been stalking you – I just – my name’s <imp>Yezera</imp>."Yours?"0Well, \PN, 