ou... you’re easy to talk to."VAlmost like a Pokémon, and I just – I’ve never found someone… I’m sorry.";I just keep talking and – I should go. I need to go."eOh – I mean, yes, that’s... I’m sorry. I’m a stranger, I shouldn’t’ve – I’ll go."But thank you."�I – I haven’t talked to someone in... a little while, and you’re… I don’t know why but you’re easy to – I’m sorry."I should go."I know."So now what?"You like me?"
