-in-a- lifetime experience."Down: Gigalith's Guts"I want to talk."Not why I'm here."All I need is you."More gifts?"Let me prepare."Very well."...No?"You need help."Go to hell."Last bit's a dealbreaker."Yes. Let me be yours."Take Jirachi."Refuse Jirachi forever."Catch Jirachi."Release Jirachi forever.Iu;␀�![[R"North: Sewer Junction"8North-East: Exit to Eleig Stretch Sewer Maintenance"&South: Exit to LuxTech Rec Center""South: Exit to LuxTech Campus"5How d’ya do? Can’t beat the stench out here."USinuses ain’t stung this bad since that shot of Reuniclus liquid came back up."XAh, I don’t get paid to complain, though. This Trubbish is bein’ real stubborn."5Mind lendin’ a hand? The way folks like us do?"=I’m a trainer. Real trainer, too – I train, y’see."]Train people’s Pokémon for money. We had a scuffle back in Novo Town… which ya won."RIf ya wanna know more than that, shame. We got a business relationship, yeah?"Now give me that rematch."Tch. Cold."iWelp, I’ll just park my ass here till this sack o’ trash works up the nerve to get its feet wet."'Get that toxin pumpin’, ya know?"AYou’re one of them reliable sorts, ain’tcha? Disgusting."KAh, I kid, I kid! Nice to see a little innocence ‘round these parts.",Now c’mon, show me your vicious side."<Got a bin liner to train and nobody to keep me company."Mind lendin’ a hand?"IAh, I kid, I kid! Nice to see a little innocence 'round these parts."-Ya see that? I knew you had a mean side."XDownright sadistic. Always good to have a bit o’ your inner psychopath available."EReal ace up your sleeve kinda deal, y’see what I’m sayin’?"@Babyface like you got plenty of room to blindside somebody."<Love to see it happen, love to see ya take it to heart."'You’re a hero. Look at yourself."GBut don’t get pinned down by the role – have some fun with it."+Play the rival a bit, yeah? Be a heel."VAh, nevermind me. Maybe you’re better at playing the hero, through and through."@Me? I’m a rival. I ain’t your rival, but I was a rival."YI wasn’t ever meant for big things, ya know? But I help keep heroes on their toes."MAnd, hell, maybe I have some fun along the way. Make some friends, yeah?"BThose days are behind me, but ya can’t teach me new tricks."9Fightin’ you feels like old times. I 'preciate it."/The name’s <imp>Alessa</imp>, by the by."I'Fraid I can’t chat any longer, though. I’m off to the big city."ASome bigshot CEO’s kid needs his reserves trained up ASAP."7Speakin' of trainin', ya should have one of these."QI'm sure it'll come in handy, if ya keep roughin' it in sewers and the like."9Anywho, see ya 'round. Don’tcha keep me waitin’."CIt is always important to give back from where you have taken!"uMy friend and I have been feeding the Munchlax down here as thanks for providing us with important battle items."jWe've done our part, but perhaps you would like to join us? The Pokemon down here love Big Malasadas."dIf you could get a batch of ten from the LuxTech food vendor, we could do a little bit of good."DThat is alright Trainer, my friend and I have more than enough."LBut consider my offer! It is not about wealth, it is about reciprocity."?Fantastic! The Pokemon here will appreciate your kindness!"GI don't see enough for a batch, Trainer. Perhaps you are mistaken."`Big Malasadas are sold at the LuxTech Campus. You should be able to purchase a batch there."MIt would be foolish of me to talk about reciprocity and not reciprocate!"5Here, Trainer. It is not much, but it is a gift."KEnjoy the world, Trainer. It is there for us, and we are there for it."@These Pokemon are happy as a direct result of your actions."BNot every Pokemon will have a grand adventure with a Trainer."IIt is important to remember that those Pokemon matter just the same."aYou know, I feel a little bad about stealing all those Nuggets from the Pokemon down here..."KIt reeks down here, but the Pokemon in this place are pretty friendly."VThey're more used to human contact than most, given how these are sewers and all.",You're a LuxTech employee, aren't you?!"I'm gonna steal your TMs!".Silver Ninjask isn't going to be happy...";Now this job's gone completely sideways. Thanks a lot."bYou better watch your back when you walk away or I might snatch those TMs from you after all.",I don't think I'm at the right river..."AI guess I'm gonna go for a swim... Please close your eyes..."3This place doesn't look fun to swim through..."!Can I borrow your surfboard?"No? Ok..."Who are you?"	Nah."
