est. Lemme show you."'*hiss* Don’t tell me what to do."|But, yeah, alright. I’ll run support for you if you’re gonna give me such an arrogant target. You ain’t her, kid."9*hiss* We were trained by the first Makyan champion."OWe’re gonna kick the crap out of you. But, hmph, I guess it’ll be fun."$Man, facing you gets me PUMPED!"1You’re too good for this place. Seriously."!Good work. Great work, even."<I didn’t pull any punches, and, oof, neither did you.">It’s my honor to present you with the Solidarity Badge."WAnd, uh, if you ever see Yezera, tell her to come back. Would you do that? Thanks."+I don’t deal with that kind of crap.";If Zoé wants to get in trouble, that’s HER problem."I’ll hold down the fort."You did it? Great!"3That’s one less thing I have to worry about."4Two, if you count Zoé getting arrested, AGAIN."3Speaking of which… have you seen her around?"*Ah, it’s nothing. She’ll turn up."$She always does. Unfortunately!"GThis place is pretty empty, so I'm able to rally against the wall."(I think I'm gonna go hit the court."+Well, back to my little wallball game."0Can you move, you're in the way of my game."7You wonder briefly which leader scores more hoops."(Then, you wonder where the ball is."8Might be a good idea to get out from under the net."1A rigorous training regimen is pencilled in."ZIt's unclear if the "rock climbing" notes are part of the training or just for Bence."2Man, I kinda wanna go for a jog on a rooftop."!Maybe I'll go scale a cliff."My legs are getting numb."I need an energy drink."HSurprisingly well-maintained, given the haphazard state of the gym."`Since the gym can't hire six whole Trainers, some of us employees have to pull double duty."#Whew, I can't stand up to you."HI get paid a nice bonus for the overtime, so I don't mind too much."CI'll be collecting a nice check at the end of the month, hoho!"*It's set nearly fifteen minutes fast."+Hah. I knew I’d see your face again."*hiss* A challenger?"hIgnore the poser and let’s cut to the chase: this is gonna be a double battle. Us two versus you."FDon’t ask why; it’s complicated and don’t change the facts."4You want the badge. I want to style on someone."[And because of… circumstances… we’ve got to include the clout chaser in the mix."XSo, you down? Think you’re tough enough to take on me and Bence at the same time?"/*hiss* Fine. You’ll be back soon enough."Y-you will be back, right?"A*hiss* You remind me of a girl I once knew. You ain’t her."eI’d tell you to stop pretending, but how ‘bout Bence and I just teach an object lesson, huh?"=*hiss* We were trained by the girl who swept Team Chasm."HNow I’m ‘bout to sweep you. Don’t take it personally, ‘kay?"Oh, you got Zoé riled up?"2You are NOT gonna like how this goes, friend."nWe don’t agree on much, but if you think you’re like our teacher, we’re gonna humble you REAL fast."'Time for the grand two versus one?"*Oh, you are NOT going to regret this!"HDo whatever it is you do for luck, ‘cause you’re gonna need it!"/*hiss* Clear as day. You’re just better."fHumility isn’t my strong suit, but I’m not stupid. Least, not as stupid as Bence thinks I am."*hiss* Damn.",Well, you won. Flying colors. A+ grade."bAlways good to see someone that can keep pace with me. And isn’t as smug about it as Bence."Take our badge."hAnd since a little bird told me you’ve got friends in high places, put in a good word for me, eh?"P*hiss* Bence is too much of a square to get involved with anything illegal."And this is. Probably."NOur mentor walked out one day out of the blue. Left us to manage the gym."�But she left behind instructions: if we find someone as good as her, give them this key, tell them to go through the door, and stand back."That’s you."Do it."(Meet me at the shed near the river.">This gym is a mess! How am I expected to battle properly?"DThis whole situation is a disgrace! I'm going to help clean up."-One day they might agree on something..."&I wish I still worked for Helena."Locked."/Zoé’s left several emails open at once."hOne’s from Bence, saying that he’s going to go on a journey of self-discovery better than hers."fAnother is from a perfume company inquiring about hiring her for Ceruledge-themed advertisements."�The third is her sending pictures of Ceruledge to several people, asking if they knew about the Pokémon. She seems extremely impressed by it."Yo, champ in the making!"=We have two Gym Leaders here on the West side of Prizca."8Bence and Zoé are Rock-type and Flying-type users."eThere isn't a magic typing here that I could recommend you. These types are a pretty good combo.""Steel might be your best bet."'Water and Rock are a close second."dThere are two paths that each challenger can take, though you can switch between them whenever."PTry to pick and choose which Trainers are the easiest for you to take down."!Nice one, you took 'em down!""Keep at it and you'll go far."3I'm not a full time Trainer, I just work here."QI thought I'd try a hand at battlin', but I guess I need to be a bit better."1Oooh that was fun, maybe I'll do that again."I really just work here..."fA few bottles of nail polish and a much more nondescript jacket than the one Zoé is wearing now."4Welcome to West Prizca's Gym, how tough are ya?"Go right ahead.""Yeah, so what if you beat me?"How tough am I?"Good question kid."A crumpled up paper note."Read it?"You uncrumple the note."0"What are you, a cop? Get out of my trash.""0You decide not to fish around in the trash.",*hiss* So that’s that. Bit of a mess."YBut you’ve got a real knack for handling chaos, huh? You remind me of… whatever."9Zoé! Show some respect to the future champion, huh?"3Take the badge, my friend: you’ve earned it."+You were UNTOUCHABLE; just incredible!"6And Zoé’s wrong. We don’t need to watch you."+You’re the one we were told to find."iUh, as much as I hate to say it, I’ve gotta let Zoé take care of this one. She knows what to say."Not right now."Hell yeah."Give me a sec."Yeah, I do."Yes"No[�"5Hey, I’m down for a rematch ANY time. Anytime."aHey! Great job on making it through the gym – I know things are a little hectic right now."VAnd probably will for a few more months until we get this whole thing sorted out."QTurns out you’re gonna have to face down BOTH of us if you want the badge."XTechnicalities and all that. Trust me, I’m not any happier about it than you are!"8So, you ready for a showdown against the two of us?"bAight. Just do me a solid and don’t try and win Zoé over. It’ll go straight to her head.">Wait, you – you think you’re as good as she was, huh?"OZoé! Get your ass over here! We’ve got a challenger to put in the DIRT!"1Aw, I knew you’d be a good sport about it."sOh, and don’t think this is gonna be easy. Our gym may be disorganized, but I’ve been keeping in practice."/I was trained by the best. Lemme show you."'*hiss* Don’t tell me what to do."|But, yeah, alright. I’ll run support for you if you’re gonna give me such an arrogant target. You ain’t her, kid."9*hiss* We were trained by the first Makyan champion."OWe’re gonna kick the crap out of you. But, hmph, I guess it’ll be fun."$Man, facing you gets me PUMPED!"1You’re too good for this place. Seriously."!Good work. Great work, even."<I didn’t pull any punches, and, oof, neither did you.">It’s my honor to present you with the Solidarity Badge."WAnd, uh, if you ever see Yezera, tell her to come back. Would you do that? Thanks."+I don’t deal with that kind of crap.";If Zoé wants to get in trouble, that’s HER problem."I’ll hold down the fort."You did it? Great!"3That’s one less thing I have to worry about."4Two, if you count Zoé getting arrested, AGAIN."3Speaking of which… have you seen her around?"*Ah, it’s nothing. She’ll turn up."$She always does. Unfortunately!"GThis place is pretty empty, so I'm able to rally against the wall."(I think I'm gonna go hit the court."+Well, back to my little wallball game."0Can you move, you're in the way of my game."7You wonder briefly which leader scores mor