ent."Lambert's House"DHey, kiddo. What’s goin’ on? I heard you’re following me."aWell, go right ahead. Not gonna get a Beedrill in my bonnet over some kid toddling after me."UBy the time you find me, I’ll be Champion, and mom will have her mind made up."7Yeah, sure, make it sound like a real competition."QWhat? Persian got your tongue? Whatever -- I didn’t call to hear you talk.""Tsk, tsk. Feisty little runt."hYou’re at the gym in that villa, right? Real gaudy place. I remember the gym -- want some advice?"dToo bad. If you can’t beat that gym, you don’t deserve to even be in this competition. Bye!"PYou’ve always needed my help. Fine -- prove me wrong. We’ll talk again."%I've summered here for 20 years."MI must say it really went to the dogs once Team Chasm started moving in."@I especially don't like the gym leader they stationed here."OBefore all this, he was a bartender at some establishment for roustabouts."-"Casaba Villa, Makya's #1 Vacation Spot""2I volunteer at the PokeCenter here sometimes."ISo many trainers come in with Numbed Pokemon after battling Lambert."|Apparently a lot of new trainers struggle with that status, as it halves the Pokemon's speed and reduces the damage they do."OBeyond elemental types, Pokémon species are defined by a second affinity."*These are known as <imp>tribes</imp>."CUnlike types, a Pokémon's tribes have no effect on their own."]But if you choose your Pokémon carefully, bringing together those that share a tribe...",They'll do fascinating things together!"XBack in my youth, I couldn't choose which Pokémon to use. It was too overwhelming."2My wife said "Pick a tribe, and stick to it!""KSo I restricted myself to Warriors, my favorite tribe. Problem solved!";It's <i>usually</i> best to listen to her, I've found."3Each Pokemon has their own Personality Traits."aBonding with a Pokemon, and discovering what makes them unique, can be such a source of joy."hDon't worry about your battles. No matter the personality, any Pokemon can be an 