umanity? Or is this a fake, too? With the untamed merely putting on a charade?"'Do you believe I’m the real one?"1Thank you. I merely wish to prove it to her."nIt would be a mercy, really – she is living a lie, quite literally. She deserves to be true to herself."
Hmph."I suppose I can’t blame you. My assumption that my counterpart is a Ditto is founded purely on it being the only explanation."JHardly convincing, but I know I am real, and therefore she cannot be."…Ah."\I suggest you simply make up your mind, one way or another. In indecision lies madness."*In truth… sometimes I doubt myself."II remember being a child. I remember living years under my old home."dAnd yet, I cannot remember when she began following me. No more than I can remember being born."Does that make me…"'But nevermind that. I have a gift."WSomething destroyed by its transformation. And yet, it has found strength in that."WI am unsure of what that may imply about my situation, and so I pass it on to you."~Imogene passes you a Poké Ball. Inside is a Galarian Corsola. It seems happy to see you… as much as it can seem happy."XAnother arrow in your quiver. Or perhaps another companion for the long road ahead."4In either case, may it prosper under your care."gSo long, traveler. I will head south, to home. You’re a welcome guest if ever you should arrive."Oh? Very well."�If you find it unsuitable or untenable to take it, I will find someone else. Perhaps the local Pokécenter will take it in the interim.""In any case, I take my leave."gI will head south, to home. You’re a welcome guest if ever you should arrive. So long, traveler."Makyan Air Travel Agency"East: Battle Plaza" South: Eleig River Crossing"'\PN. Good to see you looking well."1I've heard a lot about your recent exploits."EYour performance in the gym challenge has been quite impressive."zI spent some time as a gym trainer under Victoire, so believe me when I say it's rare to see someone of your caliber."*sigh*"..."*You must think I’m so full of shit."GThey told me to impress you, so that’s what I’ve been doing…"!I just don’t care anymore."5You’re more than a rich jerk with connections."AYou're actually good at this stuff. At battling. At Pokemon."?This one can be used to swap Pokemon into alternate forms."9Despite the name, it doesn’t apply to all Pokemon."[Just ones that can change outside of battle. Rotom, Deerling, Burmy,... some others..."WI hope you enjoyed it, because that’s the last spiel you’re gonna get from me."iThere’s a job that needs doing in the world’s weirdest cave… and I’m the person for the job."I have to be."QThat being said... where has Michi gone off to? She was here a moment ago..."7There you are! Come on Michi, we have a job to do.";Aquatopia offers ocean fishing trips and competitions."2They're the best fishing experience in Makya!"@Local legend has it that these stone pillars are quite old."mBence claims that they were here before plans to construct Prizca West, let alone specifically this gym."SMakya does have its fair share of strange rock formations, I'll give you that."{But Chasm members could talk about Pikachu being an Electric-type and I'd still pull out my MasterDex to double check."Hey! \PN!"Over here!"5Candy grabs you and pulls you towards the bench."'\PN! I need some help, like, ASAP.";I’ve – wow, I’m out of breath, give me a second."Damn. OK, I’m good."I mean, I’m not good."5I’ve got, like, a total manhunt going on here."pYou’re, like, super-awesome at dueling, right? So – wait, total lightbulb moment. Genius plan incoming."[OK c’mon you really definitely gotta help me out like I’ll give you half the loot?"8You wouldn’t leave me out here, right? By myself?"HNah, you’re cool. You’re a cool person. You’re gonna help me."'I maybe sorta committed a robbery."And breaking and entering."And arson."But it was an accident!"kOK, just the arson was accidental. But I swear I didn’t rob anyone that didn’t totally deserve it." So shut up and help me, OK?";What I’m gonna need you to do is give me some cover."9Duel me? Like, so they just see a fight and move on?"PY’know, like in a movie when they kiss so the bad guys get all flustered?"pI figured you’d be more into, like, fighting me than kissing me. Especially if I, like, healed your team."Y’know. No offense!".Yeah! I knew you’d come through for me!"DReady to see what a real hero fights like? Lead us off, Jeanne!"Wow. I guess that worked."_And you – you’re, like, yep. Totally A+. S+, if you want to be, y’know, kinda extra." Which I am. Kinda cringe…"
Wait!"ZDon’t just scurry off. I’ve got, like, WAY too many Potions, so lemme fix you up."dSeriously, do you always just, like, bolt when you lose? You looked about ready to black out…"So! Yeah! That worked!"4Honestly, like, totally better than I expected."Here: I got you something."eI needed one to evolve Jeanne, 'cause she’s always been more of a Gallade kinda gal, y’know?"mBut it turns out they’ve got, like, industrial amounts of stones in town. So I liberated a few extras.";And, uh, yeah, you helped, so you get a share. Thanks!"XI gotta skedaddle, but if you wanna meet up, I'll be in <imp>Whitebloom Town</imp>.""You draw Candy in for a kiss."8The people chasing her pass by you, paying no mind."Uh… huh."Welp, that worked!"mI’m gonna take that win and not think about this further, because, uh… yeah. Moving kinda fast, heh."K…You’re a bastard. You’re just gonna leave me hanging like that?"=I’m literally being hunted! I’ve committed felonies!"FFine – I, like, don’t have all day here, y’know! I’m out!"Aegis Insurance"uNow that there's no cars on the road, there's nobody gonna stop me from tearing it up wherever the hell I want!!"1"Prizca, where the future is made concrete.""Gym Sector"&Pokemon Tectonic Development Team"Full Blast Records"Pssst...."aI know I just look like a jogger, but I'm really a detective working with the Makya Rangers."^We received a tip that the folks over at Aegis Insurance were running protection rackets."AI need someone who can bust in and grab the evidence I need."-I'd do it myself, but they know my face."|I left a forged ID card in the patch of grass near the eastern gatehouse. Just root around for a bit and you should find it."pIt'll let you get in. Be ready for a real tough fight, they probably got a team of minions ready to battle."=If you get the evidence, I'll make sure you're rewarded."UAny luck? Did you get the ID card in the grass? It's near the eastern gatehouse."[Once you've got it, you should be able to go upstairs in the Aegis Insurance building."WThey'll probably have the good stuff up there, behind a group of minions no doubt."BMake sure you and your Pokemon are ready for a massive scrap."6This is it! This is exactly what I'm looking for."QYou've done a great service. We'll make sure everyone is brought to justice."DHere, as a reward. A wonderful Pokemon for a wonderful Trainer."/Farewell Trainer, the Rangers owe you one."Any luck?"Nothing? Nothing?!"7What did she do? How could there be nothing there?"2Damn. Months of investigation down the drain."CGuess I have to report this. The case will probably be closed."Thanks anyways."PHave you heard of the Black Market, located in the sewers beneath the city?";Once I find it, I'll be sure to dish out some justice."+Those ruffians give Prizca a bad name!"Poké Ball Depot"&Stone pillars tower over the gym."@They almost look like fingers, reaching through the ground."Prizca Traffic Control"\I'm following a list I found online: "Prizca West's Best Sights for Intrepid Tourists.""BThe agenda for today includes a visit to a... cement company."/Maybe it'll be less boring than it sounds."LClosed while Bence....participate in the Makya Championship Tournament."IHeavy graffiti covers a part that you think may have said "and Zoé""BPoor Bence and Zoé, the two can't seem to agree on anything."PIf they took working together more seriously, the Gym might be much harder!"5Zoé has a penchant for more supportive Pokemon."9Bence is the opposite. He mainly focuses on offense."_On the surface, the ideals seem conflicting, but they'd actually work together quite well."3So you've got the Solidarity Badge. Well done!"4You're well on your way to becoming a champion."FI bet the Trainers at the Battle Plaza are itching to battle you."Prizca's West Gym"Leaders: Bence, Zoé"Two birds for every stone."*Bence and Zoé.... Zence.... Boé...."lOh, forgive me, the thought of taking on two gym leaders at the same time is stressing me out a little."SI hope my current team will work well against them, but I can't know for sure."IHelp me out, pal, by being my test dummy? I'll wait for your answer."?The choice to battle me is an easy one. Got a round in ye?"Understood."+I'll be here until you wish to battle."No regrets!"DHmm.... should I go make a different team? Agh, I'm not sure..."KIf only I had chosen different moves. Maybe I could have won that one."IRestoring my Pokemon to full health, though, ain't much of a choice."3Give me the chance, and we can face off again."jYour victory over the Prizca West Gym... it leaves me with no choice but to follow in your footsteps."Wish me luck!"TI'm on break. Nothing much to do until the rock shipment's done being unloaded.";What's that? You wanna know where the rocks come from?"KThere's a big quarry to the north, near one of the mountains up there."hIt's not part of Makya anymore, but there's a lot of historic ties, so business relations are good."You’re so inconsiderate."9You’re in town, and you didn’t even let me know?"Because I saw you." Oh, don’t make that face."9You talk a big game for someone in dueling distance."<Surprise! I’m here, in the city I said I would be in."Let’s cut to the chase."UI don’t know how you’ve gotten here so quickly, but I’m going to find out."Fight me."Wow, so rude."OI can’t believe you wouldn’t want to talk to your own flesh and blood."Right here, right now."*Oh, sure. Take all the time you need."]But you’re not getting any farther until you show me what dirty tricks you’re using."_Oh good. I’ve been looking forward to curbstomping your team since you picked a starter.""Ready to learn some humility?""Alright. OK. Sure, of course."bWhy wouldn’t you annihilate a team without a scratch on yours? How could I not expect this?"SWhy would I think my work would count for ANYTHING? Ugh. You’re infuriating."...I can’t believe it."jI spend MONTHS out here, grinding my ass off to get this far, and you traipse in like it’s nothing."3Why are you better? Why are you always better?"6Fine! I guess I’ll see you in the championship."'Watch your back out there, though."9I will get better, and then I’m going to find you."@Zain ever so graciously spared supplies from his Aid Kit..."That was… real close."Such a good try."JBut since I won, I guess that makes you a pretty good place to train."C’mon. One more bout."You’re joking."$You’re not even going to try?"0I can’t believe you’d even consider it."!You -- I can’t believe it."-You really are an asshole, aren’t you?"NYou just want an opportunity to be smugly superior, like you always have."TFigures. The only reason you’re doing this is to get more attention from mom."5Well, go on. See how far that attitude gets you."I’m leaving."Business Sector"0I finally got my hands on some Fire Stones!"'I got 'em at the Evolution Market."WIn case you're wondering -- it's a building in the very north of the Battle Plaza.":Right next to the entrance to the Tournament Grounds."The door is boarded up."OHello! Would you be interested in signing a petition to demolish the road?"oThis road currently has no financial benefit to the city ever since the bridge to the south was destroyed."?It's quite an eyesore, and it disrupts pedestrian traffic."Every signature counts.".Are you sure? Prizca only stands to gain!">Thank you so much! You've contributed to Prizca's future."Ah, you again.".Have you changed your mind about signing?"SEventually, we'll get enough signatures that the city's council has to listen."6The city will be much better off for pedestrians."Look at the shiny bird!"AI wanna go up there to talk to it, but my dads never let me."/When I grow up, I wanna be a shiny bird..."There you are. Ready now?"5You’re insufferable some times, you know that?"%That last one was… real close."A Shiny Corviknight!"3It's too busy watching the city to notice you."1It's weird seeing the streets here so empty."\It's a combination of the road closure, and the Battle Festival happening right nearby."The Grand Hotel:"#Makya's first five-star hotel!"Bence's House"4It doesn't look like this has moved in a while."I'm a bit of a Striker."HI got all sorts of tools that I can use to put the ball in the net."This one's my favorite."6You would not believe the mix-ups I do with this."4I might be the best to ever do it, just saying.")Whooo-ee, look at them water towers!"VAlways surprises me how much is needed for concrete and other such manufacturin'."0And I thought growin' crops needed a lot..."Tourism Sector"Bogdan Cement Company"What are you doing here?"Which one are you?"Oh no. Not this again."It's not so bad."Pokémon live here too."Humans need nests too."I agree."	Yes."No."I don't know."Accept the Corsola."Refuse the Corsola."What can I do?"I'm not getting involved."...Why?"Duel her."Kiss her." Refuse to duel or kiss her."Maybe later."Sure, let's go."How did you know?"Sorry."No, I didn't."Give me a minute."Alright. Let's go."Just give me a minute."
Fine."No. I don't care."Not interested."
Sure."One moment."Yeah. Let's go.[,"Aquatopia"Oh. \PN."Seeking truth, as ever."LI cannot tolerate introspection, so extrospection will have to suffice."MThe real one! The one that snaps at you if you say something so uncouth."cThe fake Imogene tries to ingratiate herself through saccharine kindness. Such as that amulet."AAh! Assist me – tolerate me – a while longer, would you?"uYou’re already in my grasp, and I am not afraid to bribe you to keep you there. I come bearing gifts, you see."QBut, to reach something resembling a point, I am here to reach a revelation."uLook at this city: a sprawling blight. How many habitats, nests, spawning grounds were all stamped out for this?"0A concrete atrocity, paving over the world."<…Perhaps. Pokémon have made their warrens here, too."WThe old died out that the new might live. Not so much erasure, then, but rather…"oIndeed they do. Life has not been extinguished like a match ground underfoot. It has simply undergone a…"ZI lived a great many years in a single-story nest of wood. It was comfortable enough."KAnd yet everywhere I wander I find more wilderness gone. A creeping…"Agree with what?"lWith me? I am not so sure I agree with myself. After all, life thrives here, albeit in different forms."*Evolution? Devolution? Certainly a…"Transformation."TAnd so I find myself here. The wild and untamed has shapeshifted into humanity."2That is what a city is, yes? The human biome?"�So what can I learn from all this? Is this what I am?  An expression of humanity? Or is this a fake, too?  With the untamed merely putting on a charade?"'Do you believe I’m the real one?"1Thank you. I merely wish to prove it to her."nIt would be a mercy, really – she is living a lie, quite literally. She deserves to be true to herself."
Hmph."I suppose I can’t blame you. My assumption that my counterpart is a Ditto is founded purely on it being the only explanation."JHardly convincing, but I know I am real, and therefore she cannot be."…Ah."\I suggest you simply make up your mind, one way or another. In indecision lies madness."*In truth… sometimes I doubt myself."II remember being a child. I remember living years under my old home."dAnd yet, I cannot remember when she began following me. No more than I can remember being born."Does that make me…"'But nevermind that. I have a gift."WSomething destroyed by its transformation. And yet, it has found strength in that."WI am unsure of what that may imply about my situation, and so I pass it on to you."~Imogene passes you a Poké Ball. Inside is a Galarian Corsola. It seems happy to see you… as much as it can seem happy."XAnother arrow in your quiver. Or perhaps another companion for the long road ahead."4In either case, may it prosper under your care."gSo long, traveler. I will head south, to home. You’re a welcome guest if ever you should arrive."Oh? Very well."� If you find it unsuitable or untenable to take it, I will find someone else. Perhaps the local Pokécenter will take it in the interim.""In any case, I take my leave."gI will head south, to home. You’re a welcome guest if ever you should arrive. So long, traveler."Makyan Air Travel Agency"East: Battle Plaza" South: Eleig River Crossing"'\PN. Good to see you looking well."1I've heard a lot about your recent exploits."EYour performance in the gym challenge has been quite impressive."zI spent some time as a gym trainer under Victoire, so believe me when I say it's rare to see someone of your caliber."*sigh*"..."*You must think I’m so full of shit."GThey told me to impress you, so that’s what I’ve been doing…"!I just don’t care anymore."5You’re more than a rich jerk with connections."AYou're actually good at this stuff. At battling. At Pokemon."?This one can be used to swap Pokemon into alternate forms."9Despite the name, it doesn’t apply to all Pokemon."[Just ones that can change outside of battle. Rotom, Deerling, Burmy,... some others..."WI hope you enjoyed it, because that’s the last spiel you’re gonna get from me."iThere’s a job that needs doing in the world’s weirdest cave… and I’m the person for the job."I have to be."QThat being said... where has Michi gone off to? She was here a moment ago..."7There you are! Come on Michi, we have a job to do.";Aquatopia offers ocean fishing trips and competitions."2They're the best fishing experience in Makya!"@Local legend has it that these stone pillars are quite old."mBence claims that they were here before plans to construct Prizca West, let alone specifically this gym."SMakya does have its fair share of strange rock formations, I'll give you that."{But Chasm members could talk about Pikachu being an Electric-type and I'd still pull out my MasterDex to double check."Hey! \PN!"Over here!"5Candy grabs you and pulls you towards the bench."'\PN! I need some help, like, ASAP.";I’ve – wow, I’m out of breath, give me a second."Damn. OK, I’m good."I mean, I’m not good."5I’ve got, like, a total manhunt going on here."pYou’re, like, super-awesome at dueling, right? So – wait, total lightbulb moment. Genius plan incoming."[OK c’mon you really definitely gotta help me out like I’ll give you half the loot?"8You wouldn’t leave me out here, right? By myself?"HNah, you’re cool. You’re a cool person. You’re gonna help me."'I maybe sorta committed a robbery."And breaking and entering."And arson."But it was an accident!"kOK, just the arson was accidental. But I swear I didn’t rob anyone that didn’t totally deserve it." So shut up and help me, OK?";What I’m gonna need you to do is give me some cover."9Duel me? Like, so they just see a fight and move on?"PY’know, like in a movie when they kiss so the bad guys get all flustered?"pI figured you’d be more into, like, fighting me than kissing me. Especially if I, like, healed your team."Y’know. No offense!".Yeah! I knew you’d come through for me!"DReady to see what a real hero fights like? Lead us off, Jeanne!"Wow. I guess that worked."_And you – you’re, like, yep. Totally A+. S+, if you want to be, y’know, kinda extra." Which I am. Kinda cringe…"
Wait!"ZDon’t just scurry off. I’ve got, like, WAY too many Potions, so lemme fix you up."dSeriously, do you always just, like, bolt when you lose? You looked about ready to black out…"So! Yeah! That worked!"4Honestly, like, totally better than I expected."Here: I got you something."eI needed one to evolve Jeanne, 'cause she’s always been more of a Gallade kinda gal, y’know?"mBut it turns out they’ve got, like, industrial amounts of stones in town. So I liberated a few extras."<And, uh, yeah, you helped, so you get a share.  Thanks!"XI gotta skedaddle, but if you wanna meet up, I'll be in <imp>Whitebloom Town</imp>.""You draw Candy in for a kiss."8The people chasing her pass by you, paying no mind."Uh… huh."Welp, that worked!"mI’m gonna take that win and not think about this further, because, uh… yeah. Moving kinda fast, heh."K…You’re a bastard. You’re just gonna leave me hanging like that?"=I’m literally being hunted! I’ve committed felonies!"FFine – I, like, don’t have all day here, y’know! I’m out!"Aegis Insurance"uNow that there's no cars on the road, there's nobody gonna stop me from tearing it up wherever the hell I want!!"1"Prizca, where the future is made concrete.""Gym Sector"&Pokemon Tectonic Development Team"Full Blast Records"Pssst...."aI know I just look like a jogger, but I'm really a detective working with the Makya Rangers."^We received a tip that the folks over at Aegis Insurance were running protection rackets."AI need someone who can bust in and grab the evidence I need."-I'd do it myself, but they know my face."|I left a forged ID card in the patch of grass near the eastern gatehouse. Just root around for a bit and you should find it."pIt'll let you get in. Be ready for a real tough fight, they probably got a team of minions ready to battle."=If you get the evidence, I'll make sure you're rewarded."UAny luck? Did you get the ID card in the grass? It's near the eastern gatehouse."[Once you've got it, you should be able to go upstairs in the Aegis Insurance building."WThey'll probably have the good stuff up there, behind a group of minions no doubt."BMake sure you and your Pokemon are ready for a massive scrap."6This is it! This is exactly what I'm looking for."QYou've done a great service. We'll make sure everyone is brought to justice."DHere, as a reward. A wonderful Pokemon for a wonderful Trainer."/Farewell Trainer, the Rangers owe you one."Any luck?"Nothing? Nothing?!"7What did she do? How could there be nothing there?"2Damn. Months of investigation down the drain."CGuess I have to report this. The case will probably be closed."Thanks anyways."PHave you heard of the Black Market, located in the sewers beneath the city?";Once I find it, I'll be sure to dish out some justice."+Those ruffians give Prizca a bad name!"Poké Ball Depot"&Stone pillars tower over the gym."@They almost look like fingers, reaching through the ground."Prizca Traffic Control"\I'm following a list I found online: "Prizca West's Best Sights for Intrepid Tourists.""BThe agenda for today includes a visit to a... cement company."/Maybe it'll be less boring than it sounds."LClosed while Bence....participate in the Makya Championship Tournament."IHeavy graffiti covers a part that you think may have said "and Zoé""BPoor Bence and Zoé, the two can't seem to agree on anything."PIf they took working together more seriously, the Gym might be much harder!"5Zoé has a penchant for more supportive Pokemon."9Bence is the opposite. He mainly focuses on offense."_On the surface, the ideals seem conflicting, but they'd actually work together quite well."3So you've got the Solidarity Badge. Well done!"4You're well on your way to becoming a champion."FI bet the Trainers at the Battle Plaza are itching to battle you."Prizca's West Gym"Leaders: Bence, Zoé"Two birds for every stone."*Bence and Zoé.... Zence.... Boé...."lOh, forgive me, the thought of taking on two gym leaders at the same time is stressing me out a little."SI hope my current team will work well against them, but I can't know for sure."IHelp me out, pal, by being my test dummy? I'll wait for your answer."?The choice to battle me is an easy one. Got a round in ye?"Understood."+I'll be here until you wish to battle."No regrets!"DHmm.... should I go make a different team? Agh, I'm not sure..."KIf only I had chosen different moves. Maybe I could have won that one."IRestoring my Pokemon to full health, though, ain't much of a choice."3Give me the chance, and we can face off again."jYour victory over the Prizca West Gym... it leaves me with no choice but to follow in your footsteps."Wish me luck!"TI'm on break. Nothing much to do until the rock shipment's done being unloaded.";What's that? You wanna know where the rocks come from?"KThere's a big quarry to the north, near one of the mountains up there."hIt's not part of Makya anymore, but there's a lot of historic ties, so business relations are good."You’re so inconsiderate."9You’re in town, and you didn’t even let me know?"Because I saw you." Oh, don’t make that face."9You talk a big game for someone in dueling distance."<Surprise! I’m here, in the city I said I would be in."Let’s cut to the chase."UI don’t know how you’ve gotten here so quickly, but I’m going to find out."Fight me."Wow, so rude."OI can’t believe you wouldn’t want to talk to your own flesh and blood."Right here, right now."*Oh, sure. Take all the time you need."]But you’re not getting any farther until you show me what dirty tricks you’re using."_Oh good. I’ve been looking forward to curbstomping your team since you picked a starter.""Ready to learn some humility?""Alright. OK. Sure, of course."bWhy wouldn’t you annihilate a team without a scratch on yours? How could I not expect this?"SWhy would I think my work would count for ANYTHING? Ugh. You’re infuriating."...I can’t believe it."jI spend MONTHS out here, grinding my ass off to get this far, and you traipse in like it’s nothing."3Why are you better? Why are you always better?"6Fine! I guess I’ll see you in the championship."'Watch your back out there, though."9I will get better, and then I’m going to find you."@Zain ever so graciously spared supplies from his Aid Kit..."That was… real close."Such a good try."JBut since I won, I guess that makes you a pretty good place to train."C’mon. One more bout."You’re joking."$You’re not even going to try?"0I can’t believe you’d even consider it."!You -- I can’t believe it."-You really are an asshole, aren’t you?"NYou just want an opportunity to be smugly superior, like you always have."TFigures. The only reason you’re doing this is to get more attention from mom."5Well, go on. See how far that attitude gets you."I’m leaving."Business Sector"0I finally got my hands on some Fire Stones!"'I got 'em at the Evolution Market."WIn case you're wondering -- it's a building in the very north of the Battle Plaza.":Right next to the entrance to the Tournament Grounds."The door is boarded up."OHello! Would you be interested in signing a petition to demolish the road?"oThis road currently has no financial benefit to the city ever since the bridge to the south was destroyed."?It's quite an eyesore, and it disrupts pedestrian traffic."Every signature counts.".Are you sure? Prizca only stands to gain!">Thank you so much! You've contributed to Prizca's future."Ah, you again.".Have you changed your mind about signing?"SEventually, we'll get enough signatures that the city's council has to listen."6The city will be much better off for pedestrians."Look at the shiny bird!"AI wanna go up there to talk to it, but my dads never let me."/When I grow up, I wanna be a shiny bird..."There you are. Ready now?"5You’re insufferable some times, you know that?"%That last one was… real close."A Shiny Corviknight!"3It's too busy watching the city to notice you."1It's weird seeing the streets here so empty."\It's a combination of the road closure, and the Battle Festival happening right nearby."The Grand H