You. Sorry! Watch your back out there, I guess."Oh!"GUm, listen, you’re really cute but I’m not really... into you?"PI’m, like, super into the sweep me off my feet romance story kinda thing?"�Like, theoretically if I needed to disguise myself while bad guys were searching and I had someone I could kiss to hide my face. Y’know. Cliche stuff."NBut, um, I’m not, like, into actual relationships? If that makes sense?"5No! We, like, didn’t learn anything from this."We un-learned things."4Listen, we are, like, the dumbest people alive."IThat’s why we’re obsessed with justice and, um, kinda impulsive!"9Mainly me, but you too. I know it. We’re twinsies."-...I’m gonna miss the hell out of you."mI know, I know! I’m not, like, going-going. But, like, it feels that way. And I miss you already. Hug?"KUm... \PN? I’m, not, like, the healthiest person? Like, in the head."^I’ve done some pretty iffy stuff myself because I was, like, well, this is for justice."Like that makes it OK."�So, um, maybe working with Tamarind is a way for me to get justice for myself, too? And, yeah, I could probably use some therapy too."�And I understand if you don’t wanna be my friend after hearing that, but, um, I hope I see you again anyways. I’m gonna make things better."TYou go stop Yezera. Make sure all my hard work doesn’t get, like, undone, OK?"hThank you, \PN. I… I gotta go. But I hope I see you again. Thanks for showing me what justice is."=...Ugh, that was cheesy. I, um, yeah. Love you. Toodles."7You’re cool. You’re, like, my favorite person."HI know you’ve still got, like, a lot of stuff to do, so go do it."`I’ve got stuff to do, too. If Tamarind wasn’t waiting I’d, like, hug you for an hour."jBut, um, gotta go, I guess. You’re... we’ll see each other again? Right? Yeah. Of course we will.")I, um, yeah. Love you. Bye. Toodles!"KOh, so it’s you again. You’ve arrived at a rather fortuitous time."pI’ve caught this pair of Makyan forms and would like some more data – but excuse me. Again, my 