Gift!"Play out sai."Gonna have lots of fun!"3Harvest season means a lot of time on my feet."@Real pain. Least til I got some of them fancy shoe inserts."#Now I got a spring in my step."JSay, you're runnin' around a bunch too, right? Adventurin' and so on?">I got an extra set of 'em. I won't take no for an answer.".I 'spose I could run the Prizca Marathon."-My day to day is preparin' me just fine."#The snow is such an aesthetic."!My camera's out of memory...""Wanna take a selfie together?"<i> Click <i>"+Hell yeah, that's going the scrapbook."No"YesIu;␀kM[[�",The name on the mail box has worn away."-A small plastic tag reads "\PN's House"."2A shiny brass plaque reads "\PN's Residence"."The door is locked."BI got a lot of energy, but my Rockruff somehow has even more.""Too many candy treats, maybe?"2Yeah, you should probably have these instead."4Nevermind, it looks like he's just like this..."%Condensed sweat fogs the window."AMy god, this park is so much better than the one at LuxTech."West: Battle Plaza"North: Prizca Castle"East: Split Peaks"You read the plaque."o"The Capital Building represents the prosperity that came after the establishment of the Makyan Congress.""i"An unbroken era of peace which followed the decades of strife, which had left much of Makya razed.""{"Makya's monarchy was unable to govern the land, and the people of Makya came together to end the region's suffering.""Kantonian-Kalosian Fusion"3Someone seems to have left a note on the sign."<"Now closed indefinitely, thanks for all the memories!""0A sign is hung on the front door. It reads:"f"We're off to Casaba Villa for the summer! Any business inquiries can be given to our assistant!"""Ta-ta!""PBicycles are the only correct way to get around a dense town like this one."2I'm not just doing errands right now, though."#I'm getting some circles done!"Nature's Gallery"`"Prizca has stood for over 3500 years, making it the oldest capital city on the continent.""H"The people of Prizca will prosper for as long as the city stands.""*"May it last for another 3500 years!""7"Prizca, where the future is built with the past.""GA poster for an upcoming show. A notice says it's almost sold out!"7Next to it is a calendar of other upcoming events."1Prizca Castle predates even the city itself.";Some historians say it could be almost 4000 years old!"+The cityscape here always inspires me."=The shapes, the colors, the fashion, it's all wonderful."EIt's an artist's paradise, I can see why Noel sets up shop here."2I saw a famous singer appear out of thin air."8Right in front of that clay statue near the castle."JI tried reporting it to the rangers, but they all just laughed at me."I know what I saw!"TJust because I can't remember his name doesn't mean you shouldn't believe me..."Skeevy Eevee Pub"Prizca's East Gym"Leader: Noel"Sculptor, Battler, Artist."-A lineup for an upcoming music festival."UElectrique!, Mandibles of the Land, OHKO Queen, HippowDon't... it's a long list."6Museum-quality artifacts behind shiny metal bars."%I'll take your Pokémon for a --"..."BWow, you have no idea how easy it is to slip into that habit."DI'm just here to have a smoke before I have to go back to work."=The cafe inside is pretty nice, you should check it out."!Their coffee is pretty good."Bit pricey though."("Best bang for your buck in Makya!""@I used to be Chasm, but now I work at the Capitol Building."]Got myself a nice office and everything. A pretty decent setup for being a former grunt."uI mean, mostly everyone got off alright. Helena made sure everyone at least had a job before the Team disbanded."JI wonder what my former squadmates are doing. I hope they're alright."Noel's House"5The shops on this side of town are quite quaint.">Lot of odds and ends, stuff you won't find anywhere else!"Ironclad Dojo"$Make yourself as tough as iron!"UThe West end of Prizca was constructed rapidly over the last thirty or so years."PNo time for beauty or community to form, it's all very lifeless over there."1This side of the city is much more charming."ENoel may be chill, but the trainers in his gym are anything but."pLording their position over challengers, making them run petty errands to 'earn' the 'right' to fight them."6Makes me sick that they can be so openly corrupt."8The Houndominus has its eyes locked on its trainer."3Y'know, \PN, I never thought to ask your name."yFigured it out on the way here when I did a quick li’l background check on my client up here, and then on you too."pGuess this breaks some kinda confidentiality rule, but I ain’t never been an honorable sort: it’s Zain."KYour big brother’s hired me, lookin’ to get his reserves in shape."[Keepin’ it cool. Gotta make sure it ain’t just bravado, though. Ya know how it is."lLotsa folks talk a big talk. It’s been a while since we last had a chat, so maybe ya lost your touch."Y'Fraid not. I ain't honorable, but I do what I do, and I do a mighty fine job of it.">I got paid, I got Pokémon, and you know what that means."*Oh, ya don’t have to tell me twice."}I figure lettin’ you have a crack at 'em gives you a neat little leg up in a way that’s still me doing my job, ya get it?"!So, ya got time for a match?"yI know, I know, I do it every time, but I got debts to pay. We can chat afterwards, if that’s what you’re after."Whaddya say?".I ain’t goin’ nowhere. Drop by, yeah?"8Well, let’s see what your brother’s got for ya."4Back for a li’l sneak peek? Ya damned rascal."9Well, ya took care of that well enough, didn’t ya?"LMaybe Zain’s better than I am. He’s going through gyms, ain’t he?"(I never did have the time for that."_I was working for Chasm back when Yezera and I were fightin’. Then they set up the gyms."YYezera got through 'em like nothin’, but at that point… I wasn’t feelin’ it."tDon’t feel like talkin’ about her too much, though. She’s got enough on her plate without me gossipin’."1Didn’t I just say I wasn’t gonna gossip?"QBut everybody knows it: she went missin’. Couldn’t handle the spotlight."bHell, could barely handle a conversation with most folks. Been like that since she was a tot."(Ya better respect your elders, kid."EI ain’t talked your ear off half as much as my grandpappy did."LYa know you don’t hafta come find me, yeah? I didn’t hunt you down."What, of Yezera’s?"%Best damn friend there ever was."JSure, I was a bully back then, but ain’t nobody bullied her but me."7We fought like Zangoose and Seviper, ya know that?"-But 'nuff said. I gotta get out of town."7Things are 'bout to get messy – I gotta feeling."=So if you end up in the thick of it, keep your guard up."U'Member: slow is smooth, smooth is fast. Make it out of that, then we’ll talk."^Catch ya at that <imp>volcano in Casaba</imp>, yeah? And take this. Better you than Zain."OI'm here to challenge the gym, but the people in there are just the worst."KI don't have enough money to buy all the stuff they're making me grab!"BMaybe I can scare one of them into giving me back my items..."Its nametag reads "Thor"."East End Exclusives"CI know, I know, it's a <i>dog</i> park, not a <i>cat</i> park."FBut my little menace has more energy than I know what to do with."I had to find an outlet!"TThis man doesn't notice you, he seems to be rambling to someone over the phone."5You don't see a phone though. Maybe an earpiece?"(Who's a good boy? Who's a good boy?"You are boy, you are!"DYo yo, if it ain't my favorite person to lose over and over to."2Just kidding. That's Aaron. He's very polite.";Back on topic: The gym here is pretty straightforward."wOnce I grabbed a Knight Helmet from Prizca Castle to evolve this Escavalier, I knew I was about 50% there already."hThough, I'm still a crazy perfectionist, so I want to battle for more practice, if you're up to it."ASo much culture here. Makes me want to say something poetic."(But, eh, let's just battle instead."Understood."+I'll be here until you wish to battle."CHAAAAAARGE!"eAaron would have found a way to compliment my battling just now, despite how lop-sided that was."\Two Dark-types will be great against Noel, but it seems that its less good against you."PGimme a minute, and we'll be right as rain, and ready to compete yet again."CWow, they were right about word traveling fast in these parts."FA passing socialite told me about your victory a full minute ago."aI gotta travel fast, too! So begins my attempts at a perfect victory over Prizca East gym..."Noel is such a cool dude."UEveryone focuses on his sculptures, but I know that his true art is in battling!"QThe amount of offensive pressure his Pokémon create is simply breathtaking."OHis ace Metagross is especially scary if it manages to trap your Pokémon."So cool!"#W-what?! You got Noel's badge?"/You're sick! Sick! I wish I got to see it!"iWhat was once a printed notice has been painted over with a scene of a beautiful glacier at sunrise."'"TMs you NEED at prices you WANT!""My life has moved so fast."SFeels like just yesterday that I was attending the newly founded Novo Academy."+Of course, that was over 50 years ago!"2It's been upgraded to a "College" since then."Florian Park"LA few months ago someone tried to bring their yacht through this river."2His boat hit some rocks and sunk. Right here.">It took the city service three weeks to clear everything."JIt was completely stupid, but you have to respect his drive a little."-I practice styling my Furfrou every day!";Hey, do you have a Furfrou? I'd just love to style it!"+It's just brilliant! Brilliant, I say!"1Well, ok. I'll just be here with my Furfrou."@"Phones, batteries, accessories-- you name it, we have it!""Man, life is rough."bI came here from Hoenn to get a shot at taking out some of the avatars, but I've had no luck."FThis Gyarados avatar completely demolished my team the other day."(I really, really need a Fairy-type."BIf you happen to have one, I'll trade you a Relicanth for it."0Tsk. Maybe I'm just not cut out for this..."DIf you get your hands on an Fairy-type, I'd appreciate a 