Sure."Not right now."Yeah, let's go.Iu;␀�[[C"\PN…"}I’m not a very good liar, so I won’t try. You three, continue with extraction – please. I – I’ll buy you time.":\PN, you… do what you have to. I don’t… why…?"!I – I guess we’re alone."…"No."^I have faith that they’ll – that they can deal with Tamarind. But you’re different."0You’re special. We – we both know that."[I made a mistake – I was a… I was a child, \PN. And children are stupid sometimes."BI’m going to make it – make it right. Make it all better."I’m stealing Regidrago."nI don’t – I’m not going to lie. I’m unsealing the things I helped reinter, and… I don’t know."%I don’t know what to tell you."CI could try and convince you that I’m doing the right thing."aI could – I could tell you so many reasons and justifications and… it wouldn’t matter."_We’re going to fight anyways. I’m not going to go easy on you – I can’t afford to."So… try to make sure they don’t – keep your Pokémon safe. I don’t want to hurt them. I just need to buy a little time.":I… I’m in far too deep at this point to back out.";Good. I don’t… I don’t want to hurt you, either."KDon’t expect a fair fight. I’m sorry, but I – I have to do this."…Yeah. Me too."/Well, here goes. Artemisia, take the lead."ODon’t dive too deep – we’re getting out of here soon. Fend them off.".But if they put up a fight… crush them.";I - the extraction's wrapping up. I have to get going."4If you find me again, we'll have a real battle."Bye, for now."?I can't - you make Alessa look like a rank-and-file grunt."8Well. I've gotten what I came for; slowed you down."*I'm… glad to be your rival. Thanks."tI – uhf. I crippled one of their teams, but they got away. They’re good, dammit. And I’m out of practice."�Here – I can heal your Pokémon. Mine are going to need a little care before I’m ready to move out. But you go on ahead. Here.")You’ll use them better than I can."Now go after them." The door is tightly locked."O…Yezera, why would you – oh, \PN. Yeah, I can help heal your Pokémon."GNow go deeper into the catacombs, one of them is still down there."Nobody followed you? Good."-You know those weird caves around Makya?"YDesert with canals like circuit boards, or a mine where steel floor grows naturally."{Those are where the Regis are entombed. They’re Pokémon of incredible power that Team Chasm used to dominate the region."oMy hands ain’t clean on that, either, and now someone’s trying to break out my old bruiser: Regidrago."ZWe don’t know who, and we don’t know why, but that thing was buried for a reason."aBecause Yezera told us to, and because we – I’ll explain later. Time’s of the essence."TYeah, and I’m sorry for not cluing you in earlier, but what’s done is done."GWe need to move, now, if we’re gonna catch whoever’s in there."II can pull some strings, make sure you can catch up to your brother."LAnd if you don’t help, maybe the opposite. So quit whinging and help."kFollow me. If there’s a fight, you take point and I’ll flank. I’m good, but I’m not that good." They’re in the catacombs."aThe door Regidrago’s locked behind should be impenetrable, but… let’s go check it out."Just to make sure."Let me pass."	Why?"What are you doing?"Don't do this."Very well."!I'm looking forward to this."..."This is a lot."Why should I help?"What's the plan?[C"\PN…"}I’m not a very good liar, so I won’t try. You three, continue with extraction – please. I – I’ll buy you time.":\PN, you… do what you have to. I don’t… why…?"!I – I guess we’re alone."…"No."^I have faith that they’ll – that they can deal with Tamarind. But you’re different."0You’re special. We – we both know that."[I made a mistake – I was a… I was a child, \PN. And children are stupid sometimes."BI’m going to make it – make it right. Make it all better."I’m stealing Regidrago."nI don’t – I’m not going to lie. I’m unsealing the things I helped reinter, and… I don’t know."%I don’t know what to tell you."CI could try and convince you that I’m doing the right thin