oyalty. I bet her Pokemon would follow her to hell and back."NI smuggled some dynamite into the city, but I think the cops are onto me."$Take it off my hands for $5000?"You'd be doin' me a solid."0Some days you just can't get rid of a bomb."#My worryin' will soon be over."%You hand over $5000 in exchange."+I'm outta here--gotta store this cash."Quit yankin' my chain."No"Yes["hYou know the first champion of Makya? I heard she lost her arm by feeding it to a starving Pokemon."WTalk about inspiring loyalty. I bet her Pokemon would follow her to hell and back."NI smuggled some dynamite into the city, but I think the cops are onto me."$Take it off my hands for $5000?"You'd be doin' me a solid."0Some days you just can't get rid of a bomb."#My worryin' will soon be over."%You hand over $5000 in exchange."+I'm outta here--gotta store this cash."Quit yankin' my chain."No"Yes;["hYou know the first champion of Makya? I heard she lost her arm by feeding it to a starving Pokemon."WTalk about inspiring loyalty. I bet her Pokemon would follow her to hell and back."NI smuggled some dynamite into the city, but I think the cops are onto me."$Take it off my hands for $5000?"You'd be doin' me a solid."0Some days you just can't get rid of a bomb."#My worryin' will soon be over."%You hand over $5000 in exchange."+I'm outta here--gotta store this cash."Quit yankin' my chain."No"Yes0Iu;␀A[[E"(A fight next to lava! How dramatic!"5For my next adventure, a battle while skydiving!"SWell, I got the selfies I needed. These'll be going in the scrapbook for sure."%Have you ever done scrapbooking?"VI find it really comforting. We only have our memories after everything, ya know?"!CAUTION: Deadly magma ahead!"\Red lines of graffiti criss-cross the word "magma". The word "lava" is written beneath."OThe grass here is full of soot! Useful for growing plants and Grass-types."6All this sand is starting to get in my clothes..."HHave you meet the Soot Collector? He makes the coolest instruments!"7The natural soot here is perfect for my Bellossom!"SThe stuff near factories usually have chemicals in them, so I can't use those."!You one of them Casaba folk?"Whewie, what a fight."*I oughta head back home to the ranch." Well I'll be, what a fight."4Gotta get those battlin' bones out while I can."5Could never do that too much while on the ranch." A tattered and locked door."OA letter tacked to the door reads "Moved to Kalos. Not dealing with lava.""South: Foreclosed Tunnel"[So ya muddled your way through somehow, huh? Got that look in your eyes like you know."jBig ol' conspiracy, huh? Been lied to? Yeah, well, comes with the territory. Better get suited to it."X'Course. We’re confidants, Yezera and I. Nearly decked her when she told me, too."YBut she always was the smarter one 'tween us. Who the hell am I to second-guess her?"\Maybe I am, maybe I ain't. Don't matter much, do it? You plannin' on arresting me? Hah."hLooking right as rain, ain'tcha? Heard from a fortune teller that you’ve got a steel core to you."4Maybe she was right. Might be able to use that."#Hah! Don’t kid me, babyface."VBut, uh, you ain't exactly the kid that strutted into Novo, cocky as all get-out."3Still cocky. Got some ice to you, too, though."BWasn’t plannin’ on inviting you out here to chat, though."DGoes like this: Yezera’s about to do somethin’ real stupid."�I ain’t bright enough to know if her plan’s worth it or not. Figure that’ll be settled with a duel – ain’t no other way for the likes of us."RAnd she’ll be facin’ one of us, so why don’t we get some training done?"UDon’tcha burn yourself out now. Push yourself too hard and ya might just snap."oOh, I oughta let you know: used to be I did bounty hunting for Chasm. I ain't about to play fair or clean."I only play for keeps."Ya ready?"Eh."CI’ve fought better in my time, ain’t no question 'bout it."2Still, ya beat me. Hope ya learned something."=Kid, answer me somethin’. How do ya feel about Yezera?"PAin’t much of an answer. I like her too, mind you; maybe a li'l too much."uFigures. She ain’t easy to love sometimes, y’know? Goes double for when she’s up to somethin’ like this."jWell, how 'bout that. You can tell I like ya, 'cause I ain’t even gonna hurt you for sayin’ that.":'Cause she betrayed you? Or 'cause she’s obnoxious?"AOr, heh, 'cause she keeps givin’ you a run for your money?"FDon’t really matter what you say. If wishes were Rhyhorn, yeah?"LWe’ll see which side of the line ya fall on when it comes down to it."TGotta strong urge to say somethin’ heartfelt – guess I’m gettin’ sappy."6Like I said, though, words are cheap. Take these."]I’ll see ya 'round. Don’t you worry 'bout finding me. I’ll find you 'fore the end."@Then we’ll settle what to do 'bout Yez. Love that girl..."You knew?"You in on it?"Don't care."Already am."One moment."Let's go."I like her."Don't like her."I love her."I hate her.[E"2Uma batalha próxima à lava! Que dramático!"IEm minha próxima aventura: uma batalha enquanto pulo de paraquedas!"eBom, consegui as <i>selfies</i> que eu precisava. Com certeza, vão pro álbum de recordações." Você já fez scrapbooking?"cEu acho bem reconfortante. No fim das contas, tudo que nós temos são nossas memórias, sabe?")CUIDADO: Magma mortífero à frente!"{Linhas vermelhas de grafite fazem um "X" na palavra "Magma". A palavra "Lava" está escrita em baixo. "Lava mortífero"...?"aA grama aqui é cheia de fuligem! Bem útil para cultivar plantas ou Pokémon do tipo Grama."CToda essa areia está começando a entrar nas minhas roupas..."OVocê conhece o Coletor De Fuligem? Ele faz uns instrumentos muito legais!">A fuligem natural daqui é perfeita para minha Bellossom!"MA fuligem de fábricas geralmente tem químicos, então não posso usar."'Tu é um desses pessoar de Casaba?"Ufa, qui batáia."*Eu divia vortá pra casa, pro rancho."Ave, qui briga!"AÉ mió eu treiná o riscá da faca inquanto eu ain'cunsigo.":Num dava pa fazê essas coisa quan'eu tava no rancho."%Uma porta desgastada e trancada."TUma carta fixada à porta diz: "Mudei-me para Kalos. Não vou lidar com lava."."Sul: Túnel Interditado"_Intão ocê acabô dan'um jeito di si virá, né? Tá com aquele zói di quem sádascoisa."qUma tramóia das grande, né? Mentiro pr'ocê? Caiu na arapuca? Ah, fais parte do pacote. Mió si acostumá."nMai é Craro. Nóis semo confidente, a Yez i eu. Casi dí uma chulapada na cara dela quand'ela mi contô."jMai' ela sempre foi a mai'sperta di nóis duas. Quem diabo eu sô pra dizê si ela tá certa ou não?"`Tarvêis isteja, tarvêis não. Num importa muito, importa? Tá pranejano mi prendê? Hehe."dMai tu ta chei dos coice hoje, num tá? Orvi dizê di uma vidente qui tu tem uns miolo di aço."ITarvêis ela tivesse certa. Tarvêis tu consiga si aproveitá disso."+Hah! Num mi fais rir, rostin di bebê."dMai, óia, ocê num é mais aquela criança qui entrô em Nova toda pimpona i cheia di soberba."JAinda é uma criança mei pimpona, mai tu tem uma certa frieza agora."AMai, enfim, eu num ti chamei pra cá pra ficá só na prosa.":É ansim: a Yez tá pra fazê uma burrage das grande."�Eu num sô sabida o suficiente pra sabê si o prano dela é bão ou não. Acho qui isso vai si resorvê numa batáia – num tem oto jeito pra gente como nóis."_I vai sê um di nóis qui vai luitá cum ela, intão pruquê a gente num dá uma treinada?"YNum vai si esforçá dimais, viu? Si tu puxa a corda dimais, uma hora ela arrebenta."gAh, é bão tu sabê: eu trabaiava como caçadora di recompensa pra Chasm. Eu num vô jogá limpo."Eu jogo pra ganhá."Tudo pronto?"	Meh.">Eu bataiava mió na minh'época, disso num tenho dúvida."NDi quarqué jeito, tu mi venceu. Ispero qui tenha aprendido arguma coisa.">Criança, fala uma coisa pra eu: O qui tu acha da Yezera?"XNum diz lá muita coisa. Eu gosto dela também, viu. Tarvês inté um cadin dimais."jImaginei. Ela num é fácir di amá às vêis, sabe? Ainda mais quan'ela tá tramano um treco desses."yÓia, quem diria. Dá pra vê qui eu vô com a tua cara, pruquê eu num vô saí no braço c'ocê por tê dito isso."FPor ela tê ti traído? Ou pruquê ela é uma chatona di galocha?"-Ou, heh, pruquê ela num ti dá trégua?"@Num importa muito u qui tu diz. Si querê fosse podê, né?"MNóis vai vê di qui lado ocê vai ficá quand'a hora chegá di verdade."WTô c'uma vontade danada di dizê argo bunito – acho qui tô ficano sentimentar."3Mai, com'eu disse, falá é fácir. Tó, pega."ZNóis si vê puraí. Num si preocupe em mi achá. Eu vô ti encontrá antes do finar."VI entonces nóis vai decidí u qui fazê sobre a Yez. Amo dimais 'quela garota..."Você sabia?"Tá ajudando ela?"Não ligo."Já me acostumei."Um momento."Vamos."Eu gosto dela."Não gosto dela."Eu amo ela."Eu odeio ela.;[E"(A fight next to lava! How dramatic!"5For my next adventure, a battle while skydiving!"SWell, I got the selfies I needed. These'll be going in the scrapbook for sure."%Have you ever done scrapbooking?"VI find it really comforting. We only have our memories after everything, ya know?"!CAUTION: Deadly magma ahead!"\Red lines of graffiti criss-cross the word "magma". The word "lava" is written beneath."OThe grass here is full of soot! Useful for growing plants and Grass-types."6All this sand is starting to get in my clothes..."HHave you meet the Soot Collector? He makes the coolest instruments!"7The natural soot here is perfect for my Bellossom!"SThe stuff near factories usually have chemicals in them, so I can't use those."!You one of them Casaba folk?"Whewie, what a fight."*I oughta head back home to the ranch." Well I'll be, what a fight."4Gotta get those battlin' bones out while I can."5Could never do that too much while on the ranch." A tattered and locked door."OA letter tacked to the door reads "Moved to Kalos. Not dealing with lava.""South: Foreclosed Tunnel"[So ya muddled your way through somehow, huh? Got that look in your eyes like you know."jBig ol' conspiracy, huh? Been lied to? Yeah, well, comes with the territory. Better get suited to it."X'Course. We’re confidants, Yezera and I. Nearly decked her when she told me,