ns.",\wuHe's too busy filming to notice you.">Makya's Pokemon League has gathered quite a few skeptics."rThe region doesn't have a traditional Elite Four, and Gym Leaders here aren't exactly career Trainers either."vSome especially harsh critics have claimed that the whole thing is simply a front for a rebranding of Team Chasm."2They're right, but not in the way they think."{Obviously I'm biased since I'm former Chasm myself, but I really do think the League here is a real attempt at going legit."1Makya is at a critical point in its history."VEither we become a fully fledged region, or we get relegated as merely secondary."mI don't want this place to end up like Orre, dismissed as a third rate region with a fourth rate League."-A recycle bin stacked heavy with papers."6An assortment of books on Makyan history and law."CThe connecting tunnel from Sweetrock was blocked by an avatar!";How am I supposed to get my daily shipment of candies?Iu;␀`#[[d"A painting of a flower."8The longer you look, the more Flabébé you notice!":It's a beautifully carved ice sculpture of a Grumpig."-It's an overhead view of a Pokémon gym!"6Did the gym look like this before Noel took over?"Yo, champ in the making!"NNoel is an artist, painting with the colors of Ice-type and Psychic-type."\And, like any good artist, he allows his audience to experience his work their own way."2There's quite a few types that can work here."8You can't go wrong with Rock, Dark, or Bug Pokemon."9Fire and Ghost are pretty good alternatives as well.";Oh, and you might notice that he isn't here right now."?He'll come if you can make it all the way through the gym."JMake a wave and he'll be here. Word gets around quick in these parts."%A painting of a house by a pond."SThe reflections in the water are broken only by the ripples of falling leaves."MYour fighting style is truly magnificent! I feel the need to take notes."2Surely I've left my quill around somewhere..."NYou may have bested me in battle, but you'll still struggle against Noel."!Leave me be, you nincompoop.")A clear glass statue of a Pidgeotto."OWhen put between the ice statues, the shape of the blown glass stands out!"<It's a beautifully carved ice sculpture of an Alakazam."oHey, sorry champ, but Noel's policy here is that everybody's gotta move through the gym counter-clockwise."3I'm assuming its got some artsy-fartsy reason."%So, come on over this way, yeah?"Yo."This canvas is empty."'...or is it an all-white painting?"6Ugh.... nothing to do but crash at home, I guess."?An inspiring battle, fit for feature in my next sculpture!"A bust of a smiling man."4If you tilt your head, it looks like a Zoroark!"NIt's a beautifully carved ice sculpture of the legendary Pokemon Mesprit."?The light shining through the flower petals is enchanting."Dropped and shattered..."Wow, intense fight."#Gonna chill out for a bit now."Heh, get it?"Chill out?"Cause, like..."The ice..."4The face of this statue seems vaguely familiar."5Noel is, in every sense of the word, and artist."Wow! Top class art."*You bring your medium to a new level.":It's a beautifully carved ice sculpture of an Espeon."1It's a graphite sketch of the Gym's Greeter!")An ice sculpture of a bird Pokémon."Wait...."4It's glass, carefully crafted to look like ice!"(You doing good? Down for a rematch?"$How’re you? Holding up? Good."AIf you’re looking for a challenge, I could go for a round."Feeling up for it?"NMakes sense. Get some rest. You look like you’ve been pushing yourself."xCool. If you don’t mind, I’m gonna add a little bit of chaos into the mix: you’ll lose your cool before I do."]Yeah, sure thing. I’m more of an artist than a fighter, but I hear I’m not half bad."$Had to get here somehow, right?"/Masterwork. A masterwork, without a doubt."BI didn’t take you for an artist – not pretentious enough."DBut you are, and I present my highest and only award: my badge."IBut you are, and I can’t award you with anything more than praise."AYou’re the only person in this town that’s impressed me."&So I’ve got a favor to ask you."*Team Chasm made something down there."9They messed with the Regis, and they made something."@They say it wasn’t intentional. I figure they’re lying."GHit up my house – as far northeast as you can get in this place."ETake a peek behind the bookshelf and you’ll get there alright."!Yeah. You’re still better."HThat offer stands, you know. I ain’t gonna be doing this forever."%Solid work. Focused, expressive."(No mistaking the work of an expert."Please take my badge."�If you’ve got an appreciation for Ice or Psychic after all of this is done, come back. You’d make a better gym leader than I."6And, hey, come back sooner if you want a rematch."LThat Avatar's the one thing that screws up the atmosphere in this town.""Well, besides Bence and Zoé.">Go through my house. It’s tucked away in the northeast."kNot much, but it’s home… and it’s got a few tricks up its sleeve. Check behind the display case."That’s that.",You feel OK? You did something special."OMaybe it’s common for you, but for me… my life got a whole lot easier."So chill. You deserve it." Ugh, way to ruin the vibes."#That was pretty cool, I guess."*You're just here for the badge right?"Heh, poser." It's an abstract landscape."CThings seem less and less realistic the further away they are."1I sparkled and shone... but you much moreso."A rare defeat."Not right now."You bet.[d"A painting of a flower."8The longer you look, the more Flabébé you notice!":It's a beautifully carved ice sculpture of a Grumpig."-It's an overhead view of a Pokémon gym!"6Did the gym look like this before Noel took over?"Yo, champ in the making!"NNoel is an artist, painting with the colors of Ice-type and Psychic-type."\And, like any good artist, he allows his audience to experience his work their own way."2There's quite a few types that can work here."8You can't go wrong with Rock, Dark, or Bug Pokemon."9Fire and Ghost are pretty good alternatives as well.";Oh, a