 now I don't know what to do with it."KIt may be cute, but I'm raising enough Pokemon back at the farm as is."0That's why I'll offer 'em to you for $5000.".'S alright. I'll cultivate some patience."Hoooyaaaahhh!"&\PN hands over $5000 in exchange."Time I be moseyin' on."1Er, ya alright? I don't see that much on ya."I LOVE FOSSILS!"9YOUR FOSSILS ARE WEAK! I AM STRONGER! I WILL ASCEND!"(FOSSILS! FOSSILS! THEY'RE THE BEST!"F! O! S! S! I! L! S!"\Yo, homeboss, we are Chara and Scilla's number one fans. We study all their techniques."uYo, homeboss, you have devastated our team. Our styles are cramped and yours is cramping. We take our departure."Yo, homeboss, our combined adoration was not enough to overcome your battle style. We admire your dedication to the craft."gI invested in Victoire's factory when she first started. Now I'm rich and can waste time battling!"5Tally-ho, Trainer! I have a paycheck to collect.""Oh well, I've lost yet again."No matter. I'm rich."4I've paid for a lifetime supply of Max Revives."eI could fight you again right now if I wanted to, but I don't, since I'm really, really wealthy."5People always talk about how beautiful Makya is."RBeen underappreciating it for a while— tunnel visioned on my gym challenge."BIt takes views like this one to remind me how much I love it."Vanya shivers."-This place has such a sense of gravitas."/Though, maybe not as much as my team does."`Been trying to stay grounded recently. Figured I needed something to keep me down to earth.":Mentally, it’s been a mixed bag, but physically...?"#Well, I fell over a few times."VTalking about “gravitas”, this is the second to last spot I’ve got planned."!Let’s make it count, yeah?"Gotcha."Vanya nods."JYeah, it’s... pretty chilly. Hard to tell that it’s still summer."&Not gonna gripe and moan, though."EI’m... pretty exhausted, after everything that’s happened..."/So, I need to save my energy for battling!"Agreed?"7I’m trying not to let my thoughts weigh me down."/Let’s keep