Ahem!"DPlease keep your hands off. This collection is for buyers only."You reach out..."Ah, excuse me!"JWhile I'm glad you're interested, these books are no longer for sale."LPerhaps the Capitol Library would have the material you're looking for?"CA bust of an ancient Makyan king. It's in excellent condition."LHello there. Perhaps you have come looking to purchase exclusive items?"5Unfortunately, I don't deal to just any Trainer."]Some of these items are rather powerful, and I can't let them fall into the wrong hands.".A book on the appraisal of ancient items.")An ice sculpture of a bird Pokémon!"1You wonder if they replace it when it melts."'We don't sell to everyone, dearie."eWe don't want to enable Trainers with poor intentions, so we only sell to Trainers we can trust."3That said, only 8 people have ever managed it!"7My husband and I used to be quite the adventurers."�We've racked up quite the collection of artifacts, though now that we're older in our years we're trying to find these items new homes."-They're not coming wherever we're going."TThe inscription is worn and hard to parse, but a nearby sign has a translation."I"O Titan of the Age of Mythos, we build an aegis and tomb for thee."">"Slumber well in your armor/catacomb(?) and be at peace.""OThe sign notes that it's unclear which word is used in the final sentence."qThose fools over at Aegis Insurance called and tried to convince us to register for "adventuring insurance"."^A good idea on the surface, but the fine print restricted us from entering ancient tombs!"RTo think, that they would try and pull the wool over our eyes with that scam."7Clearly they have no respect for treasure hunters!"By jove!"#Your demeanour. An adventurer!"A delver of secrets."&One who leaves no stone unturned."(You found something, haven’t you?"<i>Sniff sniff<i>."Yes, yes..."/The unmistakable scent of ancient Unova..."Could it be?".The legendary stones located once again?!"..."2Yes, yes... there’s no other explanation..."/I spent years poring over those old ruins."$I’ll never forget that scent.";Well, fledgeling, you’ve sure outshown this old man."AI won’t ask where you acquired them. Wouldn’t be polite."\But if you have it in you to share the glory, I know a thing or two about those stones.".It may just be possible. Yes, just maybe."!To turn stone back to flesh."HYes, I’ll prepare the reagents right away... right away indeed..."Quickly now, quickly—";Hmmm... wait. I see a look of hesitation on your face."Is it… not yet time?"PI can wait! Oh, it’ll be exquisitely difficult, but I’m up to the task."Go!"$Follow your destiny, fledgling!"Quickly now, quickly."4Hand over the ancient stone. The egg of legend." I have everything prepared."Well, I say!""That’s quite disappointing."FI wouldn’t suppose you know the location of the... other stone?".Quite famously, they are a matching pair."DT’would be quite the tragedy to locate one and not the other."=Those years of work and study in Unova were not in vain."-This old man can finally rest at ease..."7A sign claims it's an icon representing Regidrago."+It's elusive as to where it was found."The statue grins at you.";It looks happy, menacing, and lonely at the same time."$An old globe sits on the table."4The borders look different than you're used to."No"Yes[O"6This pillar looks like it belongs somewhere else.">These books are in pristine condition, despite their age."You reach out and..."
