g to save me again."Am I really that one-note?"]I’ll have to try and be more creative in the future – I can’t stand being cliché."QTo answer your question: I hope not, but there’s only one way to find out."8Shall we look upstairs? At your leisure, of course."fOh, no. I’m not going up there first. You’re the bold and brash one between us, aren’t you?"
