hapter in humankind’s domination of the world."pAnd then Regigigas, a remnant of the first era, the primordial era, just after Arceus created the universe."*Arceus created, and Regigigas shaped."<Pokémon were greater, before they became domesticated."iYou’ve seen the echoes of those primordial Pokémon. Soon, that’s what all Pokémon will become."No, not hostile."oYou’re so used to Pokémon being loving and subservient that it’s shocking to see them demand respect.".They’re wild animals. Leave them alone."AWhat about Rattata? What about Boltund? What about Venipede?"WJust another species. Not privileged. Not the center of the universe. Not anymore.")Returned to nothing but white stone."eWho knows what humans will do from there? I’m sure they’ll find a way. They’re persistent.")I’m good with Pokémon. Very good."=I’ll be better off there than here, that’s for sure."KBut I’m wasting your time. I’m only good at one thing, in the end."You ready?"…Alright."6Care to enjoy the view with me? It’s beautiful."&Good. I know you won’t bore me."`Maybe now you’ll understand – this is the only language that we both speak, in the end."+If we’re friends, you’ll fight me."+If we’re enemies, you’ll fight me."Rivals, you’ll fight me."So why, then?"…Don’t say that."%I – I… I care about you too."8I’m sorry. I’m sorry – just… just fight me."+Show me. It’s the only thing I know."3…Then watch as the world you know is erased."It’s that simple."9Answer? No, of course not. You won’t stop me here."NBut it’s how we understand each other better. Show me who you are, \PN.">Oh? You – you really think so? You’ve done so before."EI’m sure you can. Just try. You’ve never let me down before."So, shall we dance?"@Regieleki, Regidrago, you can go now. Return to your tombs."XYou’ll be unmade, too, once this is all done. Just like the eras you commemorate."Do you understand now?"3The real reason? Haven’t I given you enough?"oA world of untapped potential! An end to the boredom! Freeing Pokémon from their saccharine subservience!"$Fine. You want the real reason?"8…Not lying. I just haven’t told you everything."JTo free their potential, to free them from humans, and to free… me."W…Always. Terrified. Not of any Pokémon, never in my life. But always of people."$That’s why I have to do this."pYou don’t understand, \PN. If I was good with people like you, I wouldn’t be doing this. But I’m not."�And you know what drives me mad? They should understand that! They should respect it! I saved this entire damn region! I’m a hero!"9And how am I repaid? With prying eyes and paparazzi."TI thought if I was good enough, they’d be kind to me. They’d understand me."vWell, I became Champion, and they still made me sick. The thought of having to talk to anyone still terrified me."/So I disappeared, and then the ennui came."EEnough. Enough! I deserve to be happy! I deserve to be at peace!"rIf I can’t talk to people, then I’ll create a world where people don’t rule. Where they don’t matter."QPokémon will rule, and I will understand them, and they will understand me."TI’ll be the shadow behind the throne, and I’ll – I’ll finally be happy!".I’m so tired, \PN. I’m so very tired."|You can never understand it – living in a world ruled by people you’re terrified of. People you can’t comprehend."_I deserve some rest. I deserve some peace. And this is the only way I’m going to get it."LThat’s the real reason. For me. So I can have a world where I belong."Do you? Could you ever?"6I deserve a chance at happiness. I never got one.")Everyone else did. It’s only fair."Oh."8Oh… well, thank you. If only it changed anything."
