et!"�I can't do it anymore! I'm going back to Johto! (But also stream my album Cosmic Carousel now available wherever you get your music.)"pSang's just too hard to compete with! He's got this whole region in a musical chokehold! ...I hate it here."Cabela's House"Yes"No;[+"Helena's House"eThis place is too dangerous for you, kid. Those avatars'll send you packing -- if I don't first!"YBut my team was perfectly geometrically balanced between line, sphere, and triangle!"&...Huh? What do you mean, "type?""iMy battle ferret! My anger sphere! My delightful tiny triangle being! How dare you -- you scoundrel!"!The door is securely locked."A sign reads "Email Me""?I heard the Cave of Hatching has a lot of strong trainers."I wonder how you stack up?"yThey say recently Wild Pokemon in the Cave of Hatching have been carving the stones into these beautiful egg shapes!"!I have to see it for myself!"*Look at this pretty egg-shaped stone!"BMy friend got it from the Cave of Hatching and gave it to me!"!The door seems to be locked."ZThey say it's too dangerous out here now. Well, I'll show them! I'll beat all of you!"eHey, could ya... could ya beat those giant Pokemon for me? So I can come out here to play again?"eDammit! I can't even crush you! And you're like a baby compared to those big see-through things!"iI sensed this region's distress from across the seas, and you -- you are at the heart of its plight!"xSuch shining purpose! My role in your path is over. I wonder: is it carved by force of will, or merely force alone?"bPerhaps I have misread the flow of the aether. Your role may be entirely different after all."South: Gigalith's Guts" North: Eleig River Crossing"West: Svait"East: LuxTech Campus".Hey, hey, take a chance on me, won't you?"@I'm an old hand at gamblin'. Been doin' it most of my days."*I'll share my ways with your Pokemon."7Teach em' how to take a chance on a powerful move."=Teach 'em to push on through till they get that big hit."Sound like a deal?"%Yes! I knew I was due for a win!"BHey, hey, not the result I wanted... but I'll keep on tryin'."cCome to Makya, they said. You'll be a huge hit, they said. Now I'm battling to make ends meet!"�I can't do it anymore! I'm going back to Johto! (But also stream my album Cosmic Carousel now available wherever you get your music.)"pSang's just too hard to compete with! He's got this whole region in a musical chokehold! ...I hate it here."Cabela's House"Yes"NoIu;␀Z[[J":\PN! Go around the other way! Pincer maneuver, right?"9No second thoughts. She’s probably already inside."1You – you let her by? I – I trusted you!"'Don’t! Don’t you patronize me!"MYes, it is! You heard what she said! She needs to be brought to justice!"@This whole region gave her a chance and look what happened!"Don’t lie to me!"KI listened to that entire conversation. Ugh! You’re such a pushover!"jYou don’t believe in any of this at all, do you? You’re not my friend! You’re not even my ally!"No!"<No, I will not calm down! I’m gonna get even angrier!"...I’m so stupid."No, you aren’t!"HIf you were sorry, you’d do something about it! But you didn’t!"1Yeah, I’m sure you do! And I have my mine!"%I can’t believe I trusted you!"KI’m... oh, \PN. I’m, like, I’m not sorry for being, like, wrong."?I’m sorry for what I’m about to do to you. Hah! Hahah!"Hahahah! Alright!"HLike, fine, Tamarind gets away! But I’ve got someone even better!"Do I look OK, you idiot?"qI’m, like, pretty far down at this point! But I’ve got a shovel and I’m about to dig you down with me!"KYeah. You knew this would happen, you traitor. I hope it’s worth it!"OOh, it is way past time! I can’t believe I let my guard down around you!"#Are you ready? I don’t care."0Jeanne, you were right. Butcher this creep."You beat me. Fine! Fine!"YI don’t care! What does it matter? Of course you’re better than me! Everyone is!"^...You don’t know how, like, completely tempting it is to kick you while you’re down."FYou’d deserve it. But I should let you get up. I know I should."m...So what now? You want to go skitter off and eat treats out of Tamarind’s hand? Fine! See if I care!"3You can burn for all I care. I – I hate you!"3I. Don’t. Care! You’re not better than me!"mEveryone’s always trying to show they’re better than me because they’ve got the law on their side!"|Or they’re older, or bigger, or a better trainer! Well you’re all idiots! You’re all corrupt! You should all just die!"'No you’re not! Shut up! Shut up!"JYou don’t care what you did! You don’t care that you betrayed me!"]Good! I’m glad you hate me! At least that means you have a good reason for hurting me."(I hate you too. I hate you so much."PGo die! I hate you! Ugh – you make my skin crawl, you manipulative creep!",I should’ve trusted Jeanne about you."(...It’s over. Everything is over."-Funny. It’s, like, honestly hilarious.":I was gonna help Yezera end everything! Reset it all!"�And now I don’t even want to! Screw that. You don’t deserve justice. None of you do! Why would I want to make everything good?"xThen I don’t get the pleasure of tearing it down! It’s pointless anyways! Nothing I do is ever going to matter!"SPeople are all just corrupt lapdogs like you, \PN. Thanks for showing me that."eI guess you got what you wanted – screw Yezera. I’ll take care of this world myself. My way."dToodles, \PN. I’d say I hope I never see you again, but, like, honestly? It’s the opposite."1You better PRAY you never see my face again."]Congratulations. You’ve, like, totally dethroned Tamarind as my least-favorite person."4Go die in a hole. I hope I never see you again."OAnd, like, yeah, maybe I’m overreacting! Maybe I’m just a crazy bitch!"bBut I was hoping for one minute that someone might face real consequences! And you ruined it!"AI hate you, \PN. If you follow me, I WILL sic Jeanne on you." Toodles, you miserable pig.";...Your survival instincts tell you not to follow her."Candy..."This isn't right."Give her a chance."I'm sorry."Candy, calm down."