ld've gotten that on tape."VAlright man, you've got me impressed. Taking out Makya's best ain't an easy task."1You look the type that's going places, yeah?"=Gonna want to meet this guy if you're trying to do that."rHe's a bit on the wild side but that ain't anything new for you, I bet. I'm sure you two will get along well."XWell, no use hanging around here. Already got all the workout I needed for the day."SI'll try to catch you around, yeah? If not, well, have a great career I guess."0I don't need a ship, I'm a natural swimmer!" A natural sinker as well..."[I work on a boat because I need cash to live. If I could swim instead of eat, I would."-My biceps are beyond your comprehension."XThe water here can get really deep! If I didn't have this tube, I'd probably drown!"8I must rely on myself! I must get swimming lessons!"$I trust this tube with my life."KDo you know how to swim? Why'd you have to use your board to get here?"	\PN!")So, we know where they're all going."9But there's something important we still don't know."nIn your time exploring the Oasis System, please tell me you figured out what the purpose of the place is."+Or at least you have some thoughts...?"A common theory..."_Something about it just doesn't make sense to me, though. The data just doesn't line up..."RUgh. All this effort... even with your help we still can't make any PROGRESS."@I'm not enough... and it seems that even you aren't enough."$The most feasible hypothesis...")They are quite dangerous, in theory."2I feel that there must be more to it, though."DUgh. I was hoping you'd be able to do more. To understand more." To help me FIGURE THIS OUT!"	Ugh."'What were you even doing in there?"pI didn't think of you as the kind of person who'd walk around gawking instead of actually paying attention."!You're just like the others."oI didn't waste 3 months trying to crack the code to just turn around and decide that it was all pointless."I'm... sorry."NWhat a hypocrite I am. This is not the thing I should be focusing on now."9And I certainly shouldn't be getting angry with you."8I should be... grateful. For what you did in there."6For doing what I can't. Confronting The Drillers."FI... I love my Pokemon... but they could never do what yours did."(Let's focus on the problem at hand."nYou prevented The Drillers from getting their hands on the genies... but both groups are still out there."#We've got to chase after them."WI may not be able to battle, but Michi here is like a cargo plane in Pokemon form."EShe'll get us to wherever the Forces of Nature have fled off to."$It's your time to shine, Michi!")I... can understand your hesitation.".Do your preparations, then. Please hurry."West: Canal Desert"Northwest: Split Peaks" Northeast: Sweetrock Harbor"It’s Michi, the Tropius."2She looks excited to fly off on an adventure!"7She came back to fly you back to the Empty Island!"IYou give her a soft pat on the back, but decide to not fly with her."She makes a content noise."VI come here to relax with my Pokemon. Though, a battle or two won't hurt, either.".The Skeevy Eevee needs us, I can feel it."Maybe I'll see you there!"`That was fun! You should fight my sister, too. She's all the way at the start of the river!"aGood battling! You should fight my sister, too. She's all the way at the start of the river!""Halt, in the name of justice!"SI really gotta stop using that opening when stopping people for inspections..."hNo, I didn't want to battle you. Here's my badge. We heard that there was suspicious activity here."You see any crime lately?"No? Hmm, suspicious."Ah!"!Mm, oh, it's only you again."-Turtle? Do you have a turtle to show me?"TThis Stealth Spray—useless to me, apparently—is what I can offer in return."It's not much, I know."2Sorry, sorry, I'm just nervous around people."oREALLY nervous. So nervous that I went online and special ordered this stuff that makes you harder to see."_I'm so stupid... it's a spray-on material. Of course I can't use it while <i>swimming</i>!")But swimming is my only joy in life."cI just... I've got to find a way to be less scared of people. At least while I'm in the water."vMy therapist said I could change how I think by being inspired by others. Said I could even do that with Pokemon!"9There's lots of Pokemon that can protect themselves!"!That's it! Show me a TURTLE!"TEr, I mean, <i>please</i> show me a turtle. If I'm not harming you by asking..."@I'll give you my second bottle of Stealth Spray, if you do."FAh! Oh! Whatever am I going to do without a turtle to inspire me?"'Oh, thank you thank you thank you!"BThe swimmer studies your Pokemon's shell with great interest."	Wow!"Yes! Yes!!"I understand, now!"?Here, take the stupid spray. I don't need it anymoooooore!"=This mental armor will protect me from judgmental gazes.",I'll swim wherever and whenever I want!"?I lost my glasses! Here, my Pokemon can help us find them!"(Aha! Found them! Now we can battle!"0...huh? Did my Pokemon battle on their own?"%I still can't find my glasses..."*I should really switch to contacts..."!Maybe get a guide Pokemon..."_Zarude stares at you with its arms crossed. After giving you a quick sniff, it locks eyes."mIt probably wants to join your team. It gives a smile that's hard to read while holding up its Pokeball.""Accept Zarude onto your team?"8You decide to decline the Zarude's request for now."+You take the Pokeball from the Zarude."8It gives a few grunts as it re-enters its Pokeball." To whomever it may concern:"YThis, is my island. And mine alone. I have stolen every object here fair and square."=You are free to look, but not to touch. Enjoy your stay."-A large wooden lock holds the door shut."%You insert the Ruined Tower Key."/With some effort, you slowly turn the key."3The lock falls to the ground with a dull thud."Not now."Yeah, let's go."Electricity generation."!Protects us from the genies."I have no idea."It doesn't need a purpose."No"Yes"No."	Yes.[�"kYo, yo, yo, what's a Trainer like you 