e scouting."UIt’ll get you just about anywhere in the region – nobody hides from you now."3So go get those badges and save the day, hero."Who are you?"Why are you doing this?"Shut up, edgelord."Who are they?"What do they want?"Why Yezera?"Not my problem."You wanted power?"You wanted money?"You wanted knowledge?"Why should I care?"Then why is Yezera..."How many Regis are stolen?"They're opening that door."Your point?Iu;␀g[[8")Would you like to catch this Phione?""You leave the Phione for now."MYo! Shoulda known I was gonna find you here. Um, yeah, how’s it going?"Good, good, yeah, me too."CSheesh. I get that. Things are kinda... kinda rough now, yeah."@Hey, I mean, can’t hope for much better than that, right?"6Hah! Yeah, yeah, I get that. Same here, honestly."QBut, um, you competing? I mean, obviously, but, yeah, great to see you here."MSorry, I’m rambling. I’m kind of a nervous idiot before a challenge."`I barely scraped past Samorn, honestly, and I’m not super sure how well this is gonna go."%I, uh, I hope I get to face you."VGood. I want to see you at full power, y’know? Take off those training weights."rI thought of it on the way over and was like, oh, wow, I might actually be squaring off against you properly."hHah! You really take this seriously, huh? But, nah, I wouldn’t bet on me either. I know my place."kAww. Don’t want to hurt my feelings? I mean, it’s not like you have any reason to be scared of me."MIf we do face each other, I... yeah, let’s be clear: I’m gonna lose."MBut I’m going to try my best, and if I make it close, I’ll be happy."tSometimes you just gotta say “well, I’m not the best person in the room, but that isn’t gonna stop me.”"TUm. Yeah. So, uh, I don’t know if you noticed, but… this isn’t my Phione."VYeah. So, uh, my Phione laid an egg, and that egg hatched into this li’l thing."HMy Phione’s napping right now, but this rascal is full of energy."^This one’s a bit more feisty. It’s got this, I don’t know, devil-may-care attitude."dMy Phione’s pretty chill. Maybe it’ll mellow with age? This one just hatched, so who knows."7Yeah, no worries. I didn’t really expect you to."This little rascal just hatched from an egg – my Phione’s a bit more chill, a bit more mellow. This one’s a real fighter."iNo, no, mine is napping. This is a newly-hatched Phione, complete with youthful rebellious attitude."$Which, y’know, cool, I guess.".But, uh, yeah. I’ve got a spare Phione."�I don’t know how useful the squirt will be to you, but if you want it, I’d be more than happy to give it to you. I know you’ll care for it."XI hope it helps you out somewhere, sometime. It’s looking for a fight. I know it."SNo? Alright, well, maybe you’ll get a second chance if you change your mind."]Anyways, yeah, tournament is kicking off, so bye for now. Maybe I’ll see you in there."mHope so. And then – oh, yeah, I almost forgot. My Phione’s been wanting to visit the water recently."@I just... I know it. It needs something. Somewhere special."uI’ve heard about some kind of deep spring or river or something around the <imp>base of the Eleig river</imp>."UI’m gonna try and find it after the Championship wraps up. I owe it to Phione."=So... yeah. So long, friend. Hope I’ll see you around."Take the Phione."Don't take the Phione."
