ns! That’s right: time to pay!"zThat’s what they all said. You’re not a team grunt! You’re just, like, a temporarily inconvenienced mastermind!"dUgh, you’re all the same. Well, I’ve chewed through a lotta grunts. No different this time!"'Nope! But I really really want to!"zTamarind’s out of my reach, but you’re, like, the second-best thing. So c’mere so I can give you a bloody nose."7If you were sorry you’d stop fighting me, idiot!"�You’re such a – such a dolt! How can I get it through your thick skull that you’re the bad guy? Can I beat it into you? Wanna find out?"�Oh, I swear, I’ll roll up these sleeves and deck you myself if I have to! I swear, if you chip my nails I’m gonna kill you for real!"=C’mon, boys and girls! We’ve got a beatdown to give!"Ah. Hah. Hahaha!"}So be it! My reading is complete – the scars of this battle left in the ancient stone here are a portent of things to come."TCan you suppose what it says? It says I shall lose here, and you shall triumph.".Hah! Fate has a sense of humor, it seems."`Go on. Continue yet deeper. I know my place, and will not stand against destiny any longer."qFor my sanity, I will refrain from attempting to divine the results of your future battles. I take my leave."%Awww, kid, you shouldn’t have."xGoin’ all-out? On yours truly? I’m touched. Not even half-honest, either – it’s a treat seein’ you fight."~Go on. Yez is waitin’ for you. I ain’t too hung up on this whole scheme. Yez’ll turn out fine either way – tough girl."RTougher than me, I swear. So you go do what ya got planned, whatever that is."WIf ya hurt her, they’ll never find the body, blah blah blah, you know the drill."AGood luck, kid. Come find me some time afterwards, y’hear?"0...Go. Leave. Now, before I lose my temper."dIs that really what the fate of the universe hangs on? Our relative skill in training Pokémon?"fIt’s ridiculous! It’s idiotic! I can’t believe – go! Just go! I should... I should... go."~Noted. Excuse me – I fear I may not have provided a