l my friends... and I’ve got a lot of friends."TWow! So you ARE good! You could be one of my bestest friends one day, you know." Oh, but I’m running late!"ZI’ve got an appointment to keep – a li’l rendezvous with some old, OLD friends."<Adieu, \PN! It’s been lovely! You can go now, though!"SHey! She told you you could leave now. Don’t disrespect my friend like that."WUgh. Just gonna traipse on through Lainie’s home? Our home? Some friend you are."YYou aren’t gonna get away with this. Think you can just do whatever you want, huh?"^Lainie’s reuniting with some old friends right now. Please leave. Immediately. Or else."tDon’t be surprised if everyone unfriends you after this. Betraying Lainie is beyond the pale. Unforgivable..."@Lainie... I’m sorry. I’ll try better next time, friend."Take it."Don't take it."I've heard of you."	Who?"It's an honor."Uh, I need to go."Let's do this.Iu;␀>[[<"kWait... I know that feeling. That’s the feeling I get when someone wants to ask an obvious question!"fHow did I catch Necrozma anyways? Well, what can I say: I’ve got friends in high places! Ahaha!"Oh! You’re here!"FYou’re in luck – I just finished my <outln2>reunion</outln2>."UThey still remember me! They still love me! They still <outln2>obey me</outln2>!"{And I love them too! I’m gonna show everything how much I love it! I’m gonna wrap up the sun and the moon in a big hug!"�And then you! And then everything else! And I’m never going to let them go! You know how I told you I was kind of a big deal...?"I meant it!"bNow don’t be scared! You have everything that makes life worth the fight! Friendship! Love!"M<outln2>Light</outln2>! They’ll all be mine! <outln2>FOREVER!</outln2>"RCome back! My friends still have so much <outln2>light</outln2> left to give!",Hahaha! ENDLESS <outln2>LIGHT</outln2>!".Look at me! Radiant, forever! Bask in it!"The... light... am I OK?"*Whoa. I remember... some WEIRD stuff!"Did – Solgaleo and Lunala must’ve bolted. Can’t blame ‘em, hah! I guess I kinda did go a little light-crazy there."$Great question! I have no idea!"oSomething horrible, probably! Fortunately, I’m naturally trauma-immune, so I’ve got that going for me!"ZOkie-dokie! There’s nothing that Lainie can’t spring back from! Even, uh... that."@On li’l old Lainie? That’s why it pays to have friends!"pThey’ll never believe you! And even if they did, they’re Makyan police! Don’t worry about it so much!"pAs far as I can tell, my mind was hijacked by an extradimensional intelligence of nebulous nature! I dunno!"vMaybe avatars of Ultra Beasts work differently – I’m not a scientist! Unless you count my PhD in friendology."{All I know is I came back to Makya with an amazing catch. Next thing I know I want to become friends with the moon and sun!"_That’s not really out of character for me, though, so nobody noticed anything was wrong!"#Let me put it in simple terms!"~Lainie go Alola. Lainie come back. Lainie feel weeeeird. Lainie accidentally summon manifestations of sun and moon. Oops!"OK!"Aaapaaaarreeeentlyyy."Neeecrooozmaaa."Caaan – OK, nevermind."vApparently Necrozma can call Solgaleo and Lunala from across the universe so it can feed off their eternal light!"&Cool! Also, sorry about that one!"bOnly legally, and only in Sinnoh! They couldn’t catch me to get me evaluated anywhere else!"eSpeaking of catching things: that avatar of Necrozma can call Solgaleo and Lunala from anywhere!"KAnd they just show up! To have their endless light, um, ended! Oopsie!"�I don’t really get how avatars work! Or how Ultra Beasts work! So I REALLY don’t understand what that Necrozma avatar was doing!":But thanks for getting rid of it, by which I mean me!"�Next time just punch me in the face! It’ll probably work better! Oh, also, you should probably take this so there isn’t a next time!"�She hands you a Beast Ball. There is a terrible presence within that threatens to devour all light within the room, and possibly the world."BIt’s probably for the best that Lainie