e swag!"7I think the proper thing to say is... skull emoji?";Maybe I'm trying too hard to connect with the youth..."CMy daughter seems to pick up a new dialect every six months..."5Wis? Bis? Whatever the emoji of the skull means?""Wave Lengths""!A page of handwritten notes."f"This cave is full of these interactable objects. Circuit boards, of a kind, covered in symbols.""6"I've figured out three of the symbols thus far.""i\f[Circuit Puzzle/regi_statue]"These represent a statue of Regieleki. Electricity flows from these.""n\f[Circuit Puzzle/electric_fence]"These represent the electric gates that block access to various areas.""�\f[Circuit Puzzle/electricity_ground]"These are grounding points. Electricity will flow to one of these, whichever is closest, by the shortest path.""�"By manipulating some aspects of the circuit, you can route the electrical current away from the doors, depriving them of power and disabling them.""a"Machinery deeper into the System likely incorporates other elements of varying complexity.""3GRAHHHH! I AM TEENAGE REBELLION AT ITS FINEST!"aNow that I think about it... I'm ten... I still have a few more years until I have to rebel."CI AM A MENACE TO SOCIETY! I EXPLORE DANGEROUS CAVES ON MY OWN!"JGRAHHHHH! I LET THE DEMONS TAKE OVER! FEAR MY WRATH AND DISOBEDIENCE!""Integration Chamber""\\PN... of all people, you are who should least be trusted to wield a legendary Pokemon."6I know exactly why it is that you do what you do."7And it is for that reason... that I must stop you."JUnlike the others, Landorus could not be held by this ancient prison."9And yet it stayed... containing itself in this cave."BWhy...? Because it knew that it was too dangerous on its own."OIt needs the others... to bring stability. To create order from the chaos."LI tell you this: No single person can handle these powers on their own."2Even a Pokemon can understand this principle."HAnd yet you think you're special... that you're above restrictions."0You aren't. And I hope