in an intense fire. It leaves the target with a burn."UThe user spews magma around the target, trapping and binding it for three turns."dThe user attacks everything by causing its own head to explode. The user also takes 50% recoil."kThe user attacks by breathing a special, hot fire. This also lowers the target's Sp. Atk by two steps."]The user attacks the target at full power. This lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."HAttacks by igniting a small stone and launching it as a fiery ball."FThe user rampages and attacks while spewing flames for two turns."vThe user rigs its shell to explode. If hit by a foe's physical move, the shell detonates and hurts all near foes."~With a fiery forehead, the user hurls itself at the foe. This lowers the user's Defense, Sp. Def, and Speed by two steps."TIf the target's HP is half or less, this attack will hit with double the power."\A spray of bubbles is jetted at the target. This has a 20% chance to lower their Speed."\A spray of bubbles is forcefully ejected at the target. It also lowers the foe's Speed."NThe user clamps onto the target, trapping and binding it for three turns."oDiving on the first turn, charging and becoming hidden, the user hits from below water on the second turn."gRends the target with its hard gills. Deals 50% more damage unless the target has moved this turn."SThe target is hit with a watery blast. The user is exhausted on the next turn."SThe target is blasted by a huge volume of water launched under great pressure."bThe user scatters mysterious water around and heals itself and allies by 25% of their max HP."USlams into the target using an aquatic blast with a 20% chance to lower Defense."dThe user attacks opposing Pokémon with a pulse of water which glows a deep and brilliant blue."SThe user cuts the foe with sharp shells. It has a 50% chance to lower Defense."TThe user shoots boiling hot water at its target. This has a 30% chance to burn."�The user breaks its shell. This raises the user's Attack, Sp.