t once, raising Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps, or four in sunshine."pThe user heals itself and allies by 25% of their max HP, as well as healing non-volatile status conditions."QThe user attacks by pelting the target with leaves. Can random critical hit."aThe user handles a sharp leaf like a sword and attacks by slashing. Can random critical hit."YA storm of sharp leaves is whipped up. This lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."CA seed is planted on the target, causing it to become leeched."VThe user scatters leaves that chase the target. Can't miss and skips protections."FThe user attacks by scattering petals in a rampage for two turns."TThe user violently whirls its vines, tentacles, or the like to lash the target."\Sharp-edged leaves are launched to slash at the opposing team. Can random critical hit."]The user generates a shock wave from within its body. This lower's the target's Sp. Def."VThe user charges, then attacks on the second turn. Charges instantly in sunshine."MProtects the user from attacks. Physical attackers take 1/8th HP damage."SThe user scatters bursts of spores that induce sleep. Only one use per battle."JLowers the target's Attack, then heals itself by the target's Attack."EThe user heals itself by half of its max HP, or 66% in sunshine."nThe user lands an intense tropical kick on the target. This also lowers the target's Attack by two steps."7The target is struck with slender, whiplike vines."^The user slams its rugged body into the target to attack. The user also takes 33% recoil."cAttacks with an electrified beak. Deals 50% more damage unless the target has moved this turn."|The user becomes energized, doubling the power of its next Electric-type attack. Also raises the user's Defense and Sp. Def."bThe user fires a concentrated bundle of electricity, raising the user's Sp. Atk by two steps."[The user's body generates an eerie impulse. Lowers the target's Sp. Atk by four steps."[The user hurls an electric orb at the foe. It does more damage the faster the user is."hThe user captures and attacks foes by using an electric net, which lowers their Speed by two steps."NThe user levitates using electrically generated magnetism for five turns."dThe user nuzzles its electrified cheeks against the target. This also leaves the target numbed."aThe user attacks everything around it. The user's HP is restored by 50% of the damage dealt."^The user attacks with electrically infused fists. Normal-type moves become Electric-type."dThe user strikes the target with a quick jolt of electricity. Can't miss and skips protections."UThe user throws an electrical tackle at the target. It has a 30% chance to numb."ZCan't miss in rainstorm. It has a 30% chance to numb. Can hit targets flying high up."RA strong electric blast is loosed at the target. It has a 10% chance to numb."fThe user throws a cage of electricity around the target, trapping and binding it for three turns."wThe user bites with electrified fangs. It has a 20% chance to numb and a 20% chance to lower Defense by two steps."QThe target is punched with an electrified fist. It has a 10% chance to numb."_A jolt of electricity is hurled at the foe to inflict damage. It has a 10% chance to numb."RThe user lunges at the foe while electrified. The user also takes 33% recoil."YThe user savagely attacks foes with lightning and wind. It has a 30% chance to numb."eThe user shrouds itself in electricity and smashes into its foe. The user also takes 25% recoil."XThe user fires an electric blast like a cannon to inflict damage and cause numbing."bA strong electric blast crashes down on the target. It has a 60% chance to flinch the target."\The user relaxes and lightens its body to move faster, raising its Speed by four steps."nThe user temporarily empties its mind to forget its concerns. It raises the user's Sp. Def by four steps."UThe user quietly focuses its mind to raise its Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps."bThe user casts a horrible spell on the opponent. This removes 4 PP from their last used move."aThe user shoots its psychic power from its eyes to attack. It has a 20% chance to frostbite."dThe user foretells an attack. Two turns later, a hunk of psychic energy hits the targeted spot."qThe user employs psychic power to average its unmodified Defense and Sp. Def stats with those of its target."}The user faints. In return, the Pokémon taking its place will have its HP restored and non-volatile status conditions cured."VThe user emits a healing pulse which heals the target's HP by half of its max HP."bThe user unleashes a vicious blow after a cute act. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."TThe user employs its psychic power to switch stat step changes with the target."�Using a hyperspace hole, the user appears next to the target and strikes. Can't miss, skips Substitutes and destroys protections."GThe user instructs the target to use the target's last move again."oA wondrous screen is put up to halve special attacks for five turns, or reduce it by 33% in multi battles."}The user faints. In return, the Pokémon taking its place will have its non-volatile status conditions and HP fully restored."_Until end of turn, reflects status moves that target the user or create hazards around it."]A retaliation move that counters any special attack, inflicting double the damage taken."pThe user employs psychic power to average its unmodified Attack and Sp. Atk stats with those of the target."NThe target is attacked with a peculiar ray. It has a 30% chance to dizzy."pThe user bites the target using psychic capabilities. Also breaks any screens protecting the target's side."_The user tears at the target with blades formed by psychic power. Can random critical hit."oUsing its psychic power of suggestion, the user transfers its non-volatile status condition to the target."PThe user hypnotizes itself into copying any stat change made by the target."pCloaking itself in psychic energy, the user slams into the target, raising the user's Defense by two steps."pA wondrous screen is put up to halve physical attacks for five turns, or reduce it by 33% in multi battles."bThe user goes to sleep to fully restore their HP and heal any non-volatile status conditions."QThe user mimics the target completely, copying the target's natural Ability."NThe user employs its psychic power to exchange Abilities with the target."nThe user focuses its willpower to its head and attacks the foe. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."XThe target is hit with a rainbow-colored beam. It has a 40% chance to lower Attack."�The user puts up a rainbow-colored screen to halve move damage for five turns, or reduce it by 33% in multi battles. Only usable in hail."\A blizzard strikes all near foes. Can't miss in hail. It has a 30% chance to frostbite."^The user blows a cold breath on the target. This attack always results in a critical hit."VThe user attacks by hurling a blizzard-cloaked icicle lance at opposing Pokémon."MSummons hail for six turns. Damages non-Ice, non-Ghost-types every turn."\The target is struck with an icy-cold beam of energy. It has a 10% chance to frostbite."}The user bites with cold-infused fangs. It has a 20% chance to frostbite and a 20% chance to lower Defense by two steps."NThe target is punched with an icy fist. It has a 10% chance to frostbite."dThe user flash freezes chunks of ice and hurls them at the target. This move always goes first."TThe user launches sharp icicles at the target. It multi-hits two to five times."aThe user attacks with a gust of chilled air. It also lowers the targets' Speed by two steps."]The user attacks with a chilling gust of powdery snow. It has a 10% chance to frostbite."The user swings its tail wildly at opposing Pokémon, lowering their Attack or Sp. Atk (whichever is higher) by two steps."RThe user raises all its stats by two steps, at the cost of 33% of its max HP."MThe user sends out a telluric shockwave, damaging and dizzying all foes."YComets are summoned down from the sky. This lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."VThe user exhales a mighty gust that inflicts damage. It has a 30% chance to numb."8The user slashes the target with huge, sharp claws."mThe user vigorously performs a mystic, powerful dance, raising its Attack by two steps and Speed by one."oAttacks all enemy Pokémon with pure vitality. Weakens in damage as the user loses HP. Weakest at half HP."RThe user uses its body like a hammer to attack the target and inflict damage."SThe target is attacked with a shock wave generated by the user's gaping mouth."ZThe user forces the target to switch out, to be replaced at random. Always goes last."4The user unleashes a strong beam from its core."[The most powerful attack of the original form. The user is exhausted on the next turn."kThe user attacks with apocalyptic light. This ignores their ability. Changes Necrozma's form upon use."kThe user blasts the target with power that distorts even time. The user is exhausted on the next turn."WThe user tears the target along with the space around it. Can random critical hit."OA small tornado hits the target. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."bIf the target has already taken some damage in the same turn, this attack's power is doubled."PHits once for each party Pokémon. Deals more damage based on their Attack."[The target is bitten with viciously sharp fangs. It has a 20% chance to lower Defense."_The user swings its body around violently to inflict damage on everything in its vicinity."zThe user slashes its shell blade, leaving a hazard layer of Spikes under the target if none have already been placed."`The user tells the target a secret, lowering its Sp. Atk by three steps. Always goes first."\The user crunches up the target with sharp fangs. It has a 20% chance to lower Defense."[The user swings both arms and hits the target. Ignores the target's stat step changes."cThe user releases an aura imbued with dark thoughts. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."TThe user feigns crying to worry the target, lowering its Sp. Def by four steps."mThe user fakes the target out and stabs them with its disheveled hair. Can't miss and skips protections."lThe user draws up to the foe disarmingly, then throws a sucker punch. Can't miss and skips protections."mThe user transforms its wrath into a fire-like aura to attack. It has a 50% chance to flinch the target."dThe user throws its held item at the target. Some items deal more damage or have extra effects."UTurns the foe's power against it, dealing damage using the target's Attack stat."QThe user sharpens its claws to raise its Attack and Accuracy by three steps."VThe user howls loudly to raise its Attack by three steps, and its allies' by one."Unleashes a barrage of attacks. Can't miss, skips Substitutes and destroys protections. Lowers the user's Defense by two steps."NTraps the user and target until either of them faints or is switched out."7The user slaps the target to knock off their item."YIf the user's stats were lowered during the turn, the power of this move is doubled."UThe user faints in order to lower the target's Attack and Sp. Atk by five steps."\The user slashes the target the instant an opportunity arises. Can random critical hit."mProtects the user from damage this turn. It also lowers the Defense of physical attackers by four steps."_The user lowers the target's Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps. Then, the user switches out."MIf the user moves after the target, this attack's power will be doubled."NThe user attacks with a pillar of dark light. This ignores their ability.">Inflicts double damage on a target that is switching out."?The user suppresses the target and makes its move go last."dThe user yells as if it is ranting about something, lowering the target's Sp. Atk by two steps."gThis turn, the user steals the effects of healing, buffing, or protective screen moves a foe uses."kThis move enables the user to attack first. It fails if the target is not readying an attack, however."OThe user trades held items with the target faster than the eye can follow."eThe target is taunted into a rage that prevents it from using status moves for three more turns."pThe user attacks and steals the foe's held item simultaneously. Items stolen from wild Pokémon are stored."aThe user attacks the target's throat. The target cannot use sound-based moves for two turns."kAll stat step changes affecting the target turn topsy-turvy and become the opposite of what they were."fThe user torments and enrages the foe, making it incapable of using the same move twice in a row."^The user strikes with a fierce blow of Dark Mastery. It always results in a critical hit."gThe user raises the Defense and Sp. Def of an ally Pokémon by two steps using a mysterious aroma."qThe user stares with its baby-doll eyes, which lowers the target's Attack by three steps. Always goes first."[The user gazes charmingly at the target. The target's Attack is lowered by four steps."WThe user protects itself and its allies from status moves with a mysterious power."TThe user emits a powerful damaging flash. It has a 40% chance to lower Sp. Atk."TThe user does emotional damage to the target. Can't miss and skips protections."gThe user steals the target's HP with a kiss. The user's HP is restored by 75% of the damage dealt."CThe user stirs up a fairy wind and strikes the target with it."TThe user unleashes a strong beam. This lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."\The user charges with energy and raises all of its stats by two steps on the next turn."bFires a powerful beam of light drawn from the Eternal Flower. The user also takes 50% recoil."_The user attacks by borrowing the power of the moon. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Atk."XThe user hits the target with the force of nature. It cuts the target's HP to half."^The user plays rough with the target and attacks it. It has a 20% chance to lower Attack."XAttacks the target and breaks its spirit. Lowers the target's Sp. Atk by two steps.