tored by 100% of the damage dealt."oThe user chooses between Searing Crunch, Glacial Crunch, Aquatic Crunch, and Volt Crunch to use this turn."`The user chooses between Fire Fang, Ice Fang, Hydro Fang, or Thunder Fang to use this turn."{The user performs a spirited dance for its allies and itself, raising their Speed and raising their Accuracy by four steps."�The user foretells your choice of Fire, Electric, or Ice-type. One turn later, the targeted spot explodes with energy of that type."fChanneling fear, the user bites the target. Deals double damage if the user is below half health."VThe user channels ancient energy to grant a nearby ally an extra turn this round."XDeals more damage the less HP the user has. After attacking, the user switches out."mThe user's eyes glow with divine judgement, numbing the target and lowering both its Attack and Sp. Atk."OThe user focuses its aim to raise its Sp. Atk and Accuracy by three steps."CThe user slashes broadly, cleanly slicing all nearby battlers."_The user cleans the target aggressively with soapy water. It has a 50% chance to waterlog."XThe user spins the target with a cleansing vortex. It has a 30% chance to waterlog."iThe user lounges around with decadent laziness, restoring its HP by 66%. This move always goes last."oA lullaby is sung in a calming voice that puts the target with half its HP or less left into a deep sleep."hThe target is struck by a pulse of negative energy. This resets the target's positive stat changes."`The target is cut by a piercing slash. Can random critical hit, and does so twice as often."@The user shoots a pulse of neutral particles at the target."The user suddenly falls asleep for one turn, making enemies drop their guard, lowering their Defense and Sp. Def by four steps."aThe user pranks the target, surprising it and lowering its Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps."kThe user expresses a mystical potential. Changes type to match the user's Gem, Plate, or Crystal Veil."WThe user pulverizes 