re points with precise punches, numbing it."hA kick that can also eliminate trapping and hazards afflicting your side. Also raises user's Speed."aThe user grabs the target, slamming both of them into the ground. The user takes 20% recoil."\The user attacks with a burst of inner energy. Lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."`The user mimics Kung Fu techniques while sleeping. This move can only be used while asleep."PThe user attacks with a strong punch. It has a 20% chance to lower Defense."fThe user holds fast with its teammates, raise its Defense by three steps, and its allies' by one."_The user shoots three arrows made of Aura with extreme precision. Can random critical hit."dThe user manifests a bolt of pure courage. This has a 20% chance of raising the user's Sp. Atk."sThe user relentlessly rampages with its whip-like hands for two turns. Each hit will always be a critical hit."wThe user kicks while rotating at high speed, dashing across the battlefield to deal damage to all nearby battlers."LA reckless rushing attack from the air. The user also takes 25% recoil."�The user compresses air around the target to impossible density. If the move is super- or hyper-effective, damage is increased by 30%."mThe user takes an aerial look at the field. This raises its Sp. Atk, Defense, and Accuracy by two steps."bThe user fires a stormy gust at the target. This also raises the user's Sp. Atk by two steps."`The user whips up a cold north wind to attack the target. It has a 30% chance to frostbite."nAn apple falls from high up to strike the foe. Always goes first. Deals double damage in intense Gravity."XThe user propels a gale-force wind at the target. It has a 10% chance to frostbite."SWinds from all directions arrive together in a flurry to rip about the target."tThe opponent is shredded by talons. This attack always results in a critical hit, but applies jinx to the user."YThe user sends a chilly wind towards the target. This has a 10% chance to frostbite."~A high pi