 to lower Sp. Def."KThe user and target bathe in acid. The user loses half its current HP."tThe user lashes the target with its corroded tail. This hits Steel-types for neutral damage and lowers Defense."`The user sprays the target with a corrosive chemical solution. It has a 30% chance to numb."WThe user infects the target with a touch and also destroys any Herbs it's holding."~The user launches a ball of trash to roll over all foes. The targets' held Berry or Gem stick to the ball and become unusable."EThe user partially dissolves, raising its Sp. Def by five steps."fThe user steals blood. If the target is knocked out, this raises the user's Attack by five steps."aA Grey Mist covers the battlefield. For five turns, stats are reset at the end of each turn."FThe user attacks while slathered in grime. This poisons the user."PThe user envelops the target in a foul wind. It has a 30% chance to poison."ZThe user stabs the opponent with a toxin-infused limb. It has a 10% chance to poison."XThe user shoots the target with a dart made of toxins. This move always goes first."{The user lays a hazard layer of poison spikes on the foe's side. One layer hurts switched in foes, two layers poisons."sThe user jabs the target with its stinger while retreating. This poisons the target and switches the user out."NThe user attacks with sticky slime, rendering the target's item unusable."]The user punches the target while holding a wad of slime. It has a 30% chance to poison."hThe user uses venom that turns the target's body against it. Super effective versus Fighting-types."\Attacks with energy from jealousy. All opposing Pokémon with stat boosts get poisoned."[The user gives off a terrible stench towards the target. It has a 30% chance to dizzy."iThe target is forced to switch out by a stinky cloud, then the user also switches. Always goes last."LThe user bites the target with toxic fangs with a 30% chance to poison."_The user chomps with venomous teeth. The user's HP is restored by