d sand. Can random critical hit."PThe user tosses hot desert sand on the target. It has a 10% chance to burn."iThe user attacks with a tectonic vibration. It also breaks any screens protecting the target's side."cBy sacrificing 33% of its max HP, the user lays two hazard layers of Spikes at the foe's feet."OHits the target with a sandy wind, then summons sandstorm for eight turns."tThe user slathers mud around to heal itself by half of its max HP. This extends any active screens by one turn."oThe user attacks by flattening the target into the ground. This resets the target's positive stat changes."|The user slams the earth with its tail, creating a shockwave to damage the target. It has a 40% chance to lower Attack."SThe user tramples the target. It has a 20% chance to lower the target's Speed."`The user attacks the opposing Pokémon by trampling it. It has a 20% chance to lower Speed."uStress cracks form underneath the target, blasting them with volcanic ash. It has a 40% chance to lower Sp. Def."9The user slams the target with their rock-hard body."YThe user smashes its rock-hard head into the target. The user also takes 33% recoil."kThe user bludgeons the target's arms and legs with a large rock. This has a 50% chance to fracture it."bProtects the user from damage this turn. The user will counter with Granite Head if attacked."8The user attacks with the bright glint of crystals."VThe user shoots a spike of diamond to strike the target. Can random critical hit."BThe user calls up spikes of diamond. Can random critical hit."ZThe user weakens the target's bones, making them fracture. They deal 33% less damage."YThe user rushes into the target with its stony body. The user also takes 25% recoil."uThe user scratches the target with rough rocks. If in sandstorm, the target's Defense is lowered by three steps."pThe user slams the target into a nearby hard object. Increases in power the higher the Defense of any ally."CThe user slams the target with blunt force, taking 20% recoil."iThe user sweeps away hazards afflicting your side while lunging forward. User also takes 33% recoil."KThe user numbs the target, then welcomes in sandstorm for eight turns."jThe target's item is spelled away with Lunar Magic. Additionally, the target is given an EXP Candy M."�The user calls all rocks to join it, summoning sandstorm for five turns and laying a hazard of levitating stones around the target."SThe user drops a single piece of solid bedrock on the target, fracturing them."�Protects the user and its allies from spread moves this turn and foes' moves get redirected to the user. Fails if used in succession."iThe user afflicts the target by turning their skin into stone. This has a 30% chance to fracture it."PThe user slams itself into the target with absurd force, taking 50% recoil."cLarge boulders are hurled at the foes to inflict damage. This has a 30% chance to fracture it."]The user throws a large rock at the target. If it misses, the user's Accuracy is raised."FThe user hits a rock in a precise way to launch it at the target."pThe user dances wildly while churning rocks towards the target. This raises the user's Attack by two steps."OIf this move misses, the target is forced to switch out. Always goes last."~The target is struck from all angles by light like gemstones. Deals double damage if the user has used a gem this battle."kThe user grinds stone into shrapnel and sprays it at the target. This has a 50% chance to fracture it."eThe user headbutts the target while maintaining a defensive aura. Sets Sanctuary for five turns."pThe user slams the target with a rocky blade. Destroys screens, Substitutes, and protections on the target."IThe user thrums ominously, lowering the target's Attack and Sp. Atk."9The user carefully lobs a small stone at high speed."�A star falls on the target. Witnessing this lucky star also enables random critical hits and doubles the user's critical hit chance."�The user attacks with shards from their rocky mane.