cted to the user this turn."<The foe is stabbed once by each of the user's stingers."sThe user makes a plea for survival, halving the damage their side takes from non-attack sources for ten turns."mThe user prepares its weapons. This raises the user's Attack by six steps but lowers Speed by six steps."0The user rakes the target with sharp claws."xThe user bites, claws, and stings the target while rolling. It has a 20% chance each to poison, waterlog, or leech."^The target is plastered with irritating scales, damaging it and changing its type to Bug."xThe user sheds a huge volley of scales at the target. Lands without fail. This lowers the user's Sp. Def and Speed."GThe user scratches the target with a flurry of claws, talons, etc."fIf the user is faster than the target, puts the target to sleep, then minimizes the user's Speed."kThe user stabs through the target using tremendous force. This lowers the user's Attack by four steps."gAvenging bugs everywhere, the user crushes the target. It has a 20% chance to lower their Defense."\The user stabs the target, injecting a painful chemical. It has a 30% chance to poison."[Halves attack damage taken this turn. Numbs any attackers. Fails if used successively."YThe user sucks the target's life. The user's HP is restored by 50% the damage dealt."\The user calls out its underlings to pummel the target. Skips and destroys protections."\The user summons bugs to terrorize the target, trapping and binding it for three turns."YThe user amps itself up for performance, raising its Sp. Atk and Speed by two steps."hTwo turns after this move is used, the target's HP is restored by three quarters the user's max HP."|The user goes into another plane and displaces the target's soul. This move does 30% more damage if the user is asleep."lDisables the target's last used move for four turns, then lowers a relevant stat on them by four steps."oThe user attacks with bitter emotion. This lowers the target's Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps if in 