ned."gRaises Sp. Atk by three steps. Until switch out, the user's attacks spread to hit all nearby foes."The user creates a golden pyre that revives a fainted Pokémon at half HP. That Pokémon switches in and its stats are boosted."sThe user dances with great heat. Pokémon hit by this are cured of frostbite. Deals 50% less damage to allies."mThe user pauses to plan its ranged attacks. This raises its Sp. Atk, Sp. Def, and Accuracy by two steps."WThe user shoots the target with a small bolt of fire. This move always goes first."9The user sets the target on fire, inflicting a burn."�If the target has a non-volatile status condition, this deals double damage and heals every battler's non-volatile status condition."^The user cloaks itself in a fierce blaze and attacks. It has a 20% chance to raise Speed."JThe user burns the target, then welcomes in sunshine for eight turns."TThe user warms up its body and attacks the target. It has a 10% chance to burn."wThe user launches up high, charging and becoming hidden, then explodes down on the second turn, taking 25% recoil."pThe user roars with the force of a volcano, raising the Attack of itself by three steps and allies' by one."kThe user attacks with fire that can be seen in multiple places, then summons sunshine for eight turns."{A lance of fire pierces the target from above, lowering their Sp. Atk. Can random critical hit, and does so twice as often."dThe user explodes itself into the target. The target is harmed, but also their Speed is raised."[Halves attack damage taken this turn. Burns any attackers. Fails if used successively."yThe user chomps down with burning fangs. It has a 20% chance to burn and a 20% chance to lower Defense by two steps."nThe user attacks with heat, creating an obscuring wall of haze. The user takes 33% less damage this turn."QCloaked in flames, the user dances wildly, raising its Sp. Atk by two steps."�The user sends up to two barrages of fire, each hitting two to five times. If two barrage