er erupts with powerful yellow light to damage and numb the target."WThe user creates an electric fueled cage, trapping and binding it for three turns."jThe user takes an entire grid of power into its belly to slam the target. The user takes 100% recoil."~The user chomps down with high-voltage fangs. It has a 20% chance to numb and a 20% chance to lower Defense by two steps."jLaunches many homing bolts. Deals 50% more damage unless it's the first turn the target is in battle."ZThe user rocks out by using each Sound-based move they know. Only one use per battle."FThe user fires a dimensional mote, lowering the target's Sp. Def."KThe user meditates, raising both its Attack and Sp. Atk by four steps."\The user skillfully attacks around the enemy's guard. Can't miss and skips protections."jThe user slows the target's mind with a psychically infused blow. This has a 30% chance to frostbite."_Splits off a section of the target's psyche. Disables their last used move for five turns."kAstral energy explodes around the target. This move always goes first. The user also takes 50% recoil."KBy sacrificing half its max HP, the user makes the target fall asleep."^The user's HP is restored by 50% of the damage dealt. Power doubles if the foe is asleep."bSummons eclipse for six turns, boosting Psychic-type attacks and heralding the total eclipse."eThe user slashes the target with aura-enriched wings. This boosts the user's Speed by two steps."yThe user psychically exploits weak points in the target's mind. Can random critical hit, and does so twice as often."lThe user psychically modifies its own genes, transforming into either Overmatter form or Overmind form."`The user claps with the power of a hundred hands, psionically striking all nearby battlers."bThe user swings its pendulum to cure a statused target, but make them fall into a deep sleep."KThe user dizzies the target, then welcomes in eclipse for eight turns."VThe user encourages the target to attack right after the user. Always goes first."aThe user conjures a giant fist to crush the target, trapping and binding it for three turns."]The user grabs the target with a conjured hand, trapping and binding it for three turns."xThe user psychically alters the target's brain to forget. This move disables the target's last move for five turns."lThe user syncs its mind with its teammates, raising its Sp. Atk by three steps, and its allies' by one."fThe target is hit by a weak telekinetic force. It has a 20% chance to lower the target's Sp. Def."lThe user spends 50% HP to create a Substitute. If successful, the user's Speed is raised by four steps."[The target is hit by a strong telekinetic force. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Def."nThe user creates an odd area for six turns in which Pokémon's offensive and defensive stats are swapped."�The user perfectly predicts the target's future location, then strikes. Lands without fail. This lowers the user's Defense and Speed."WThis move raises all the user's stats by two steps. Can only be used while asleep."dThe user attacks with an overpowering, superior intellect. Super effective versus Normal-types."XThe user employs hypnotic suggestion to make a dizzy target fall into a deep sleep."}Unveiling its ears, the released psychic power causes the user to rampage and multi-hit two to five times for two turns."\Psychic energy assaults the foe and darkens the sky, summoning eclipse for eight turns."|Pierces the mind of the target, inflicting doubt in their abilities, guaranteeing a critical hit on foes with boosted stats."tAfter making its attack to the target's psyche, the user teleports back to switch places with a party Pokémon.":The user overloads its mind to rampage for two turns."XThe user cuts using scissor-like blades of psychic energy. Can random critical hit."`The user manifests a piercing bolt of psychic energy. It has a 40% chance to lower Sp. Def."jThe user sends waves of cosmic energy to overwhelm the target's senses. Multi-hits two to five times."oCharges with astral power and boosts its Attack by two steps on one turn, then attacks on the second turn."mThe user forces its dreams to manifest, attacking the opponent. This move can only be used while asleep."lProtects the user from damage this turn. It also lowers the Sp. Def of special attackers by four steps."�The user does an arcane dance to summon a Pearl Of Wisdom to hold. The Pearl boosts all stats by 20% and can be flung for huge damage."OThe target is scrutinized, damaging their psyche. Can random critical hit."The user peruses its kingly stores of knowledge, selecting three random non-Psychic attacks. You choose which one it uses."^The user dazzles the target with celestial visions that lowers its Sp. Atk by five steps."�The user connects to the target's brainwaves to stabilize its mind, curing its dizziness, and granting it its other legal ability."eThe user takes control of the target's mind to unleash an attack on it. Can random critical hit."uThe user creates a bizarre area in which slower Pokémon get to move first for five turns. Only usable by Hoopa."eThe user imparts knowledge on its ally Pokémon, raising their Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps."MThe user chills all near foes so severely that their speed becomes zero."aAn aurora borealis flashes brightly at the target, lowering their Attack. Always goes first."QThe user lowers the target's body temperature, afflicting it with frostbite."UThe user grabs the target in a chilly embrace. It has a 10% chance to frostbite."�The user readies an attack with memories of ancient cold before attacking. If hit by a foe's special move, frostbite the attacker."ZThe target is put to sleep via a deep freeze. The user is exhausted on the next turn."qThe user covers the field with an fog of ice crystals, summoning hail and creating Grey Mist for five turns."pThe user summons a wind that drains vitality from all nearby foes. This has a 20% chance to frostbite them."_Attacks with energy from jealousy. All opposing Pokémon with stat boosts get frostbitten."XThe user jabs the target with a sharp icicle. It has a 40% chance to lower Defense."_The target is punched with a tremendous icy force. This move can't be used twice in a row."PThe target is overwhelmed by cold energy. It has a 30% chance to frostbite."~The user lays a hazard layer of frozen spikes on the foe's side. One layer hurts switched in foes, two layers frostbites."The user chomps down with icy cold fangs. It has a 20% chance to frostbite and a 20% chance to lower Defense by two steps."KRams the target with frigid force. This has a 10% chance to frostbite."gThe user attacks the target with a frontal cold wind. It lowers the target's Speed by three steps."VThe user absorbs the target's heat, frostbiting it and adding the Ice-type to it."aThe user freezes the target in place, dealing damage and minimizing their Speed and Evasion."AFor the rest of the round, the target's healing is reversed."lThe user picks up an iceberg and slams it into the target. This lowers the user's Attack by four steps."]The user slashes the target with ice like a sword. It has a 20% chance to lower Defense."`Halves attack damage taken this turn. Frostbites any attackers. Fails if used successively."aThe user targets the target's coldest spots. Its power doubles if the target is frostbitten."WThe user pins the target down with icy spikes, applying frostbite and trapping it."\Injects supercold liquid into the target, damaging them and halving all future healing."KThe user frostbites the target, then welcomes in hail for eight turns."aThe user foretells imminent winter. Two turns later, extreme cold attacks the targeted spot."bThe user throws an exploding package at enemies, or one filled with healing treats at allies."~The user sheds excess covering. This raises the user's Sp. Atk and Speed by three steps, but lowers Sp. Def by two steps."RThe user raises their Attack and Defense by two steps, and Speed by one step."gThe user flips, flaps, fumbles, then flounders. It becomes more powerful the less HP the user has.":The user rolls into the target while covered in snow."rThe user makes the target to trip into a huge pile of snow, damaging them and summoning hail for eight turns."pThe user incants a snowy hex, dealing damage and setting a hazard layer of frozen spikes around the target."xTo inflict massive damage, the user uses up its Ice-typing. This move can't be used if the user is not an Ice type."MThe user saps all the target's heat with a frigid touch, frostbiting it."XDrains the heat from the target. The user's HP is restored by 50% the damage dealt."VThe user bites a vulnerable spot from above. Super effective versus Flying-types."[Invokes the aspects of many dragons, striking with a physical move and a special move."PThe user attacks fueled by ire. Deals double damage if it's a critical hit."OThe user spits digestive juices at the target, destroying their held item."]The user slashes the foe while menacing. During eclipse, the target also becomes burned."nThe user rips and tears its way across the battlefield, damaging all near Pokémon and taking 50% recoil."gThe user bites to drain the target's energy. The user's HP is restored by 50% of the damage dealt."�The user harnesses primal instincts to strike at the target. This has a 20% chance to lower the higher of the target's Attack or Sp. Atk."~The user crushes the target with evil intent. This deals double damage if the target has a non-volatile status condition."�Eyes pulsing with rainbow energy damage the target and force it to hand over its held item. Items stolen from wild Pokémon are stored."fExhales magical fumes with a 30% chance to burn or frostbite the target depending on their stats."WSends hindering waves of energy forward, lowering hit foes' Evasion by four steps."`Doubles target ally's Attack and Speed. However, if the user faints, so too does that ally."^The user inspires a sudden dread in the target, damaging it. This move always goes first."xThe user launches four Dreepies, which spread out equally to hit near foes. But, they avoid targets they can't hit."uThe user charges, then attacks on the second turn. This burns or frostbites the target depending on their stats."]The user shakes the target with a deep, rumbling roar. This attack does physical damage."rProtects the user from attacks. If an eclipse is active, extends it by one turn. Fails if used in succession."}The target is harmed by a malevolent sound. This has a 20% chance to lower the higher of the target's Attack or Sp. Atk."YThe user strikes from swampy ground like a serpent. It has a 30% chance to waterlog."�The user flies high up into the air at supersonic speed, charging and becoming hidden. It greatly increases in power the faster the user is."aThe user looms over the target with awful menace, lowering their highest stat by four steps."VAttacks all foes with dormant draconic energy. Power increases by 50% in eclipse."�The user sprays the target with a shrinking liquid. For the next three turns, the target's highest stat will be lowered by two steps."`The user makes an offering, then multi-hits two to five times. Scatters coins for each hit."aThe user whips up a tornado to tear at the target. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."bThe user lets out a thunderous noise while sleeping. This move can only be used while asleep."eThe user charges up insane amounts of energy the first turn, then transforms on the second turn."rThe user strikes with a simultaneous three-beam attack. It has a 20% chance each to numb, burn, or frostbite."pThe user throws a royal fit to rampage for two turns. Raises Speed if a target is knocked out by this move."xThe Pokémon blots out the sky, summoning eclipse for eight turns and lowering each opponent's Attack by two steps."pThe user roots itself, then strikes at the target with serpentine strength. This has a 30% chance to leech."eDarkness rolls over the field, damaging all other Pokémon and setting Grey Mist for five turns."�The user insults the target using a compliment. Their Attack and Sp. Atk are raised by three steps, but they hurt themselves in confusion."FThe user maximizes its Sp. Atk in exchange for 33% of its max HP."sBites a hole in reality, creating a black hole to damage all near foes. Gravity is intensified for five turns."dThe user removes the energy and light around the target. Super effective versus Electric-types."ZThis attack deals 50% more damage if the target has any raised or lowered stat steps."{The user sacrifices their ally to cover all near foes in total darkness, making them drowsy. Fails if the user has no ally."UDeftly sets a hazard layer of damaging Spikes around the foe, then switches out."ZIf the target is the last able member of their party, this attack's power is doubled."qThe user tries to pick off a weak target. After damage, if the target is below 25% HP, they instantly faint."oThe user burrows into the target's subconscious with emotional manipulation. It has a 10% chance to leech."`The user disarms the target's blade. The target cannot use slice-based moves for two turns."GThe target is forced underwater for a brief time, waterlogging it."XThe user pushes the target violently into water. This has a 10% chance to waterlog."dWhen the user knocks out a target with this move, this raises the user's Sp. Atk by five steps."nThe user indulges its love of battle by striking a foe. Both of the user's Attack and Sp. Atk are raised."^The user raises all of their stats by two steps. Fails unless a foe is below half health."^The user attacks with dark illusions. This also lowers the target's Defense by two steps."hThe target is attacked with a pulse of negative feelings. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."cA punch that inflicts double the damage if the user has been hurt by the foe in the same turn."PFor the rest of the round, the healing of all damaged Pokémon is reversed."ZThe user prepares a precise cut. Always a critical hit. This lowers the user's Speed."VThe target is dragged viciously through water. This has a 30% chance to waterlog."^The user hides stealthily, charging and becoming hidden, then strikes on the second turn."gThe user emits a wave of anxious feelings which overwhelms all nearby Pokémon, taking 50% recoil."PSummons moonglow for eight turns and raises the user's Attack by two steps."LLowers the target's Sp. Atk, then heals itself by the target's Sp. Atk."hThe user chomps hard, cutting the target's HP by 50%, and the user's HP is restored by 50% of that."dDamages the target's life force directly. During moonglow, the target also becomes frostbitten."{The user tries to surprise-attack the target. Cannot miss in moonglow. Can random critical hit, and does so twice as often."_The user attacks and steals the foe's held item. It can't steal if the user holds an item."JThe user entangles the target's mind with dark thoughts, leeching it."?The user invades deep into the target's mind, leeching it."�The user demands tribute from the target. Scatters coins. Damage and coins are doubled if the target has a non-volatile status condition."KThe user steals the target's stat boosts, and then attacks. Goes last."pThe user slashes all around them, creating deep scars on all nearby foes. This lowers each target's Attack."tThe user schemes to raise its Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps. During moonglow, also raises Speed by two steps."OThe user hacks at the target with great violence. Can random critical hit."oThe user attacks and steals the foe's held item simultaneously. You then choose a party member to hold it."zExplodes, dealing an extra 30 base power to all nearby for each Spikes hazard layer underneath them. The user faints."rThe user darkly follows the target before striking. Inflicts double damage on a target that is switching out."jStares harshly, dealing double damage if they hurt the user this turn. Only usable on the first turn."EThe user heals itself by half of its max HP, or 66% in moonglow."SThe user bullies the target, causing distress. This has a 30% chance to leech."kThe user swings aggressively while suffering from nightmares. This move can only be used while asleep."yThe user transforms into a cloud of vermin, charging and becoming hidden. On the second turn it ambushes the target."oThe user submerges the target in water, then bludgeons them repeatedly. This has a 10% chance to waterlog."gThe user sings with reckless abandon, annoying the target. There's a 30% chance they become dizzy."tThe user smacks the target and steals its item while it is stunned. Items stolen from wild Pokémon are stored."HThe target is lulled to sleep. Can only be used during a Full Moon."]The target is pranked with a huge bucket of water. This has a 30% chance to waterlog it."�The target is hit with a generous donation. Consumes up to 1000 scattered coins. Base power is boosted by 10 for every 100 consumed."�Healing coral forms on the foe's side. For the next four turns, attacks on foes heal the user for 33% of the damage dealt. This can overheal."<Leeches the target by kissing them with its thin mouth."ZThe user dances in tune with a dreamlike energy, raising their Sp. Atk by four steps."lThe user goes to sleep and enters a dreamscape. This sets Sanctuary on the user's side for eight turns."aThe user tickles the target excessively, damaging it. This has a 20% chance to lower Attack."QThe target's mind is overloaded with emotion. Applies Torment to the target."gThe user shoots a magical arrow which seeks out the target's weak points. Can random critical hit."<An enchanting outcry. Can't miss and skips protections."yThe user dances vigorously, raising all its stats by three steps. The user’s stat steps are reset two turns later."}A patch of medicinal flowers sprouts across the battlefield. This heals every Pokémon for 1/8th HP each turn for five turns."`The user plays with the target with unnecessary force. It has a 50% chance to lower Attack."\The target is punished by a barrage of fae wind. This has a 30% chance of jinxing them."{The user draws the Crystal Caliburn, which empowers light and slice moves by 50% and transforms the holder into Royal form."WThe user flashes colorful light to damage the target. This move always goes first."GThe user chucks a party favor which explodes in the target's face."oMakes everyone's hearts beat together. Others can join in the Round and make the attack do greater damage."�The user uses honey to fully restore its HP. However, this lures swarming insects, trapping and binding the user for three turns."dThe user attempts to humble the target, guaranteeing a critical hit on foes with boosted stats."fThe user hopes for bad luck, jinxing the target. Attacks against them crit and pierce protection."lThe user wields an exaggerated power to strike the target. This lowers the user's Attack by four steps."yThe target is taunted by a deceptive look. It can't use status moves this or next turn. This move always goes first."LThe user leeches the target, then welcomes in moonglow for eight turns."|Enables random critical hits for the user, doubles its critical hit chance, and raises its Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps."]The user causes an accident, damaging the target. This has a 30% chance of jinxing them."XThe user causes the target to trip and fall. This has a 50% chance of jinxing them."TAttacks nearby foes with a misty explosion. The user loses half its current HP."�The user disappears in a cloud of mist, charging and becoming hidden. On the next turn, the target becomes jinxed and frostbitten."]Summons moonglow for six turns, boosting Fairy-type attacks and heralding the Full Moon."EThe user invokes forbidden celestial powers to smite the target."FThe user throws a tricky punch. Can't miss and skips protections."`The user bites with playful abandon. This deals double damage on the user's first turn out."rThe user creates a puzzling area for six turns in which Pokémon's unmodified Attack and Sp. Atk are swapped."pThe user captivates the target with something puzzling, then strikes. Super effective versus Psychic-types."iThe user foretells a terrible fate. Two turns later, the targeted spot is damaged by fated disaster."jThe user spins sugar into a ball launched at the target. The slower the user, the greater the damage."PA spirited wind blesses the user, raising its Sp. Atk, Speed, and Accuracy."GThe user goes on a wild tantrum, going on a rampage for two turns."wThe user swaps the target's held item with its own. It also switches its unmodified Speed with the target's Speed."LThe user uses fae magic to invoke the target's true name, jinxing them."VThe user attacks with its wards, dealing damage based on the user's Sp. Def stat."PStrikes the target with lunar light, then summons moonglow for eight turns."aA mischevious wind whips around to attack the target. This has a 50% chance of jinxing them."hThe user ponders ancient wisdom, selecting three random status moves. You choose which one it uses."rThe user mutates its genetic code, transforming into any of its 3 other forms. Only useable as Deoxys Normal."[The user makes a risky, difficult attack. If it misses, the user's Accuracy is raised."^The user hides, charging and becoming hidden, then strikes the target on the second turn."OThe user makes a foolhardy, roundabout attack. It misses much of the time."/The target is multi-hit two to five times."iThe user foretells an attack. Two turns later, the targeted spot is struck by a well-planned attack."KThe user attacks with simple determination and rampages for two turns."MThe target is attacked with a slash of claws or blades, always critting."uThe user gleams with light. This lowers each foe's Sp. Atk by two steps and raises its own Sp. Atk by two steps."`The user prepares to defend itself. It'll survive the next three hits which would faint it."qThe user growls fiercely. This lowers each foe's Attack by two steps and raises