. User becomes Steel-type."gThe user cloaks itself in fire and charges at the foe, burning it. The user also takes 33% recoil."fThe user attacks by breathing a special, hot fire. This lowers the target's Sp. Atk by six steps."aThe user lays two hazard layers of burning spikes on the foe's side. User becomes Fire-type."HThe user inflicts burns on all nearby foes. User becomes Fire-type."iThe user summons sunshine for six turns. This raises its Attack and Sp. Atk. User becomes Fire-type."iA spray of bubbles is forcefully ejected at all nearby foes. This lowers their Speed by three steps."�The user enters a state of total focus, prevents stat steps from being lowered, raises Attack and Sp. Def, and becomes Water-type."kThe user summons rainstorm for six turns and surrounds itself with Aqua Ring. User becomes Water-type."LThe user inflicts waterlog on all nearby foes. User becomes Water-type."xA move that only the avatar of Kyogre can use. The user commands a Luvdisc avatar and a Remoraid avatar to join it."[The user forcefully shoots six seeds in rapid succession, spread among nearby enemies."aA nutrient-draining attack. The user's HP is restored by all the damage taken by the target."WThe user charges by gathering light, then blasts all near foes on the second turn."�The user heals all non-volatile status conditions on their side, gains the ability Stability, heals itself for 25% HP and becomes Grass-type."IThe user inflicts leech on all nearby foes. User becomes Grass-type."hThe user raises its Defense by two steps and gains the ability Iron Barbs. User becomes Grass-type."]The user scatters bursts of spores to induce sleep on all foes. User becomes Grass-type."The user summons an allied Gossifleur. This raises its Sp. Def by three steps, and its allies' by one. User becomes Grass-type."FA powerful electric blast is let loose on the target, numbing it."TThe user raises its Sp. Atk and Speed by two steps. User becomes Electric-type."KThe user inflicts numb on all nearby foes. User becomes Electric-type."TTwo turns after this move is used, a hunk of psychic energy attacks the target."hThe user raises its Sp. Def by four steps and gains the ability Unaware. User becomes Psychic-type."pThe user raises its Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps and maximizes its Accuracy. User becomes Psychic-type."kThe user summons eclipse for six turns. This raises its Attack and Sp. Atk. User becomes Psychic-type."SBounces back status moves for the next three turns. User becomes Psychic-type."{The user summons an allied Abra. This raises its Sp. Atk by three steps, and its allies' by one. User becomes Psychic-type."bThe user creates an Odd Room for six turns. This raises its Speed. User becomes Psychic-type."}The user employs hypnotic suggestion to make all nearby statused foes fall into a deep sleep. User becomes Psychic-type."OThe target is struck with an absolute zero beam of energy, frostbiting it."NThe user inflicts frostbite on all nearby foes. User becomes an Ice-type."_The user lays two hazard layers of frozen spikes on the foe's side. User becomes Ice-type."lThe user summons hail for six turns. This lowers every foe's Speed by two steps. User becomes Ice-type."XThe user raises its Attack, Defense, and Speed by two steps. User becomes Ice-type."The user crushes all near foes with evil intent. This deals double damage to targets with a non-volatile status condition."NThe user exhales a mighty gust that inflicts damage and numbs the target."sA move that only the avatar of Zekrom can use. All battlers gain Steel-type and have their stat changes reset."QThe user raises its Attack and Speed by two steps. User becomes Dragon-type."ZThe user lowers each near foe's highest stat by four steps. User becomes Dragon-type."oA move that only the avatar of Reshiram can use. All battlers have all of their stats raised by two steps."|The user summons an allied Poochyena. This raises its Attack by three steps, and its allies' by one. User becomes Dark-type."cThe user torments all near foes, preventing them from repeating moves. User becomes Dark-type."gThe user blasts all nearby foes with the moon's full power, lowering their Sp. Atk by three steps."HThe user raises its Sp. Atk by four steps. User becomes Fairy-type."yThe user summons moonglow for six turns. This raises the Defense and Sp. Def of all allies. User becomes Fairy-type."oThe user creates a Puzzle Room for six turns. This raises its Attack and Sp. Atk. User becomes Fairy-type."AThis move exists just to showcase the PBS Extensions system.[�"QO usuário ajuda o alvo, fazendo-o usar seu movimento logo após o usuário."sApressada e aleatoriamente, o usuário usa um movimento entre os conhecidos por outros Pokémon em sua equipe."HO usuário maximiza seu Ataque em troca de 33% de seus PV máximos."XO usuário passa seu item equipado ao alvo se o alvo não possuir um item equipado."jO usuário atura ataques por dois turnos, então ataca de volta, causando o dobro do dano que sofreu."fO usuário prende o alvo, bloqueando fisicamente seu caminho ou o impedindo de se mover por medo."iO usuário se joga no alvo com todo o peso de seu corpo. Tem 30% de chance de causar imobilização."\O usuário ataca tudo à sua volta com a força destrutiva de um estrondo ensurdecedor."MO usuário muda seu tipo para ser o mesmo tipo de um de seus movimentos."iThe user changes its type to make itself resistant to the type of the attack the opponent used last."pO usuário se aproxima do alvo, então rouba seu item. Itens roubados de Pokémon selvagens são guardados."ZThe target is hit with rhythmically launched punches that have a 30% chance to dizzy."EA reckless, life-risking tackle. The user also takes 33% recoil."mThe user attacks the foe with an echoing voice. If this move is used every turn, it does greater damage."`Obriga o alvo a continuar usando apenas o seu último movimento utilizado por três turnos."JAn attack move that cuts down the target's HP to equal the user's HP."aThe user endures any attack with at least 1 HP. It always fails if it is used in succession."jThe user dances to compel the target to mimic it, making the target's Ability the same as the user's."bThe user explodes to inflict damage on those around it. The user faints upon using this move."aThe user rushes the target at blinding speed. This attack always goes before any other move."xDoubles its power if the user has a non-volatile status condition. Ignores damage reduction from burn or frostbite."oAn attack that hits first and makes the target flinch. It only works the first turn the user is in battle."bThe user flails about aimlessly to attack. It becomes more powerful the less HP the user has."WEnables random critical hits for the user, and quadruples its critical hit chance."eThe user draws attention to itself, making all foes' moves get redirected to the user this turn."[The target is multi-hit two to five times with raking swipes. Can random critical hit."hThe user rushes at the target using every bit of its power. The user is exhausted on the next turn."GThe user intimidates the target by staring at it to cause numbing."PThe user growls, scaring nearby foes. Their Attack is lowered by two steps."WThe user stiffens all the muscles in its body to raise its Defense by three steps."sO usuário prepara sua cabeça e ataca, colidindo-a contra o alvo. Tem 50% de chance de causar imobilização."oThe user makes a soothing bell chime to heal the non-volatile status conditions of all the party Pokémon."NThe user assists an ally by boosting the power of its next attack by 50%."TThe user holds back when it attacks, and the target is left with at least 1 HP."VThe foe is attacked with a powerful beam. The user is exhausted on the next turn."fThe user bites hard on the target with its sharp fangs. It has a 50% chance to flinch the target."SThe user lets loose a horribly echoing shout with the power to inflict damage."lThe user releases countless shots of light. Its type varies with the kind of Plate the user is holding."cThis move can be used only after the user has used all the other moves it knows in the battle."ZThe user leers at nearby foes with sharp eyes. Their Defense is lowered by two steps."~If the user acts before the target, it copies the target’s attacking move and uses it against them with 50% increased power."FThe target is slugged by a punch thrown with muscle-packed power."\The user waggles a finger and stimulates its brain into randomly using nearly any move."qCloaking itself in high energy, the user slams into the target. This move's type depends on the held memory."^The user draws power to attack by using a held Berry. The Berry used determines its type."oAn attack that makes use of nature's power. Its effects and type vary depending on the user's environment."ZThe user intimidates all nearby foes, lowering their Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps."ONumerous coins are hurled at the target to inflict damage. Scatters coins."IThe target is physically pounded with a long tail or a foreleg, etc."NIt enables the user to evade all attacks. It fails if used in succession."rO usuário avança contra o alvo em uma velocidade que o torna quase invisível. Garantidamente vai primeiro."sA spin attack that can also eliminate trapping and hazards afflicting your side. Also raises the user's Speed."JRestoring its own cells, the user heals itself by half of its max HP."XThe user recycles a held item that has been used in battle so it can be used again."PThe user reflects the target's type, making it the same type as the target."HThe user rests to cure itself of any non-volatile status condition."hGets revenge for a fainted ally. If an ally fainted in the last turn, this attack's damage doubles."HThe foe is forced to switch out to a random ally. Always goes last."fThe user attacks with a song. Others can join in the Round and make the attack do greater damage."uO usuário usa suas garras duras, pontiagudas e afiadas para causar dano ao alvo. Tem chance de acerto crítico."tO usuário explode para inflingir dano a todos os Pokémon em campo. O usuário desmaia ao usar este movimento."WAs arestas do usuário ficam mais afiadas, aumentando seu Ataque em três níveis."SThe user shoots a mysterious beam that changes the target's Ability to Simple."jIt enables the user to permanently learn the move last used by the foe. Once used, Sketch disappears."BBy slacking off, the user heals itself by half of its max HP."\O alvo é rasgado com um golpe de garras ou de lâminas. Tem chance de acerto crítico."eThis attack inflicts double damage on a numbed foe. It also cures the target's numbing, however."MThe user emits a snoring sound. This move can only be used while asleep."nThe power stored using the move Stockpile is released all at once in an attack. 150 base power per stack."`The user shines a spotlight on the target so that only it will be attacked during the turn."]The user stockpiles power, reducing move damage taken by 30%. This can be stacked twice."=Used only if the user has no PP. It also hurts the user."aO usuário come sua fruta equipada, então aumenta sua Defesa e Def. Esp. em um nível cada."rThe user spends 25% HP to create a doll to protect it from move damage, additional effects, and status moves."dThe user chomps hard on the target with its sharp front fangs. It cuts the target's HP to half."PThe user generates odd sound waves from its body. The target becomes dizzy."fThe user consumes its Stockpile to heal itself by 50% of its max HP per stack. This can overheal."[Raios em forma de estrela são atirados no alvo. Não pode errar e ignora proteções."SA physical attack in which the user slams into the target with its whole body."RA full-body attack for slamming into the foe. The user also takes 25% recoil."XThe user gets teary eyed. This lowers the target's Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps."aThe user has teatime with all the Pokémon in the battle. Each Pokémon eats its held Berry."jThe user fires a beam of light at its target. The type changes depending on the Drive the user holds."JThe user performs a wobbly dance that dizzies the Pokémon around it."=O usuário entra em alvoroço, atacando por dois turnos."]The user tickles the target into laughing, lowering its Attack and Defense by two steps."ZThe user transforms into a copy of the target right down to having the same move set."rThe user strikes with a simultaneous three-beam attack. It has a 15% chance each to numb, burn, or frostbite."eThe user unleashes its ultimate move. Can't miss and skips protections. Only one use per battle."mThe user attacks in an uproar, going on a rampage for two turns. Over that time, no one can fall asleep."]One turn after this move is used, the target's HP is restored by half the user's max HP."EThe user is roused, raising its Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps."mO usuário boceja, fazendo com que o alvo fique com sono. O alvo irá dormir no final do turno seguinte."ZThe user looses a flurry of open-palmed arm thrusts that multi-hit two to five times."pO usuário libera uma explosão de aura das profundezas de seu corpo. Não pode errar e ignora proteções."WThe user slams into the opponent, dealing damage based on the user's Defense stat."aThe user attacks with a swift chop. It also breaks any screens protecting the target's side."YThe user tenses its muscles to bulk up, raising its Attack and Defense by two steps."WThe user coaches its ally Pokémon, raising their Attack and Defense by two steps."^A retaliation move that counters any physical attack, inflicting double the damage taken."QThe user delivers a chop with its forearms crossed. Can random critical hit."LO alvo é rapidamente chutado duas vezes seguidas usando ambos os pés."TAn energy-draining punch. The user's HP is restored by 33% of the damage dealt."[The user risks all to attack the foe. The user faints but does damage equal to its HP."UThe user dives down onto the target from the sky. This move is also Flying-type."9The user focuses its energy and unleashes its power."kThe user focuses its mind before launching a punch. It will fail if the user is hit before it is used."KThe target is attacked with a shock wave. It has a 30% chance to numb."aO alvo é atacado com um pulo seguido de uma joelhada. Se errar, é o usuário quem se fere."GThe target is attacked with a sharp chop. Can random critical hit."ZThe user attacks the target's legs swiftly, lowering the target's Speed by two steps."NThe user throws a punch at blinding speed. It is certain to strike first."qThe user protects itself and allies from damaging moves. It only works the first turn the user is in battle."QAttacks wildly with swords or fists. The user is exhausted on the next turn."VThe user traps itself into the battle and raises all of their stats by two steps."aEnvolve o alvo, prendendo-o. Diminui a Defesa e Def. Esp. do alvo em dois níveis por turno."iStriking opponents repeatedly makes the user's fists harder, raising the user's Attack by two steps."nThe user protects itself and its allies from priority moves. It always fails if it is used in succession."]The user attacks by slicing with its long horns. Ignores the target's stat step changes."eThe user cuts with its long horn. The odd power contained in it does physical damage to the foe."gO usuário atinge o alvo com um golpe impiedoso. Esse ataque sempre resulta em um acerto crítico."cThe user grabs the target and recklessly dives for the ground. The user also takes 33% recoil."jThe user attacks the target with great power. This lowers the user's Attack and Defense by two steps."mO usuário chuta o alvo com um movimento rápido como um raio. Diminui a Defesa do alvo em dois níveis."hThe user whirls its fists to send a wave of pure vacuum at the target. This move always goes first."|O usuário agilmente atinge o alvo. Dobra de dano se o usuário não tiver nenhum item equipado quando o movimento começar."kO usuário confunde o oponente com sua velocidade, então ataca. Não pode errar e ignora proteções."fO usuário ataca com ar que corta até mesmo os céus. Tem 40% de chance de fazer o alvo hesitar."sO usuário esquenta seu bico antes de atacar. Se atingido por um movimento físico inimigo, queima o atacante."VThe user attacks foes with savagely cold winds. It has a 30% chance to frostbite."oO usuário recolhe suas asas e ataca de uma altitude baixa. O usuário também leva 33% de dano colateral."cThe user attacks using a sound wave based on words it has learned. It also dizzies the target."yThe user whips up a wind to blow away protective screens on the opponent's side. Also removes hazards on both sides."gO usuário faz um ataque espiralado usando seu bico como uma broca. Tem chance de acerto crítico."UO usuário golpeia o alvo com suas asas. O alvo é atingido duas vezes seguidas."`The user covers the target's body with a mass of down that lowers its Attack by five steps."SThe user soars, charging and becoming hidden, then strikes on the second turn.";The user whips up a gust of wind to attack the target."aO usuário absorve os PV de seu alvo. Os PV do usuário são curados em 75% do dano causado."YO alvo é perfurado com um bico ou chifre pontiagudo. Tem chance de acerto crítico."kO usuário bica o alvo. Se o alvo estiver segurando uma Fruta, o usuário a come e ganha seus efeitos."WThe user heals itself by half of its max HP. The user loses Flying-type this turn."iThe user whips up a turbulent whirlwind that doubles the Speed of all party Pokémon for four turns."cO oponente é atacado com um spray de um ácido forte. Tem 20% de chance de diminuir Def. Esp."gO usuário cospe um fluido que derrete o alvo. Isso diminui a Def. Esp. do alvo em quatro níveis."|O usuário solta um arroto repugnante contra o alvo. Dá o dobro de dano se o usuário tiver comido uma fruta nesta batalha."pO usuário ataca com uma nuvem de fumaça branca. Isso redefine as mudanças de atributo positivas do alvo."bO usuário se enrola e se concentra. Isso aumenta Ataque, Defesa e Precisão em dois níveis."GA slashing attack with a poisonous blade. Can random critical hit."<The user shoots filthy garbage at the target to attack."LThe user bites the target with toxic fangs with a 50% chance to poison."OA cloud of noxious gas is sprayed in the face of the target, poisoning it."dThe target is stabbed with a tentacle or arm seeped with toxins. It has a 10% chance to poison."YThe user stabs the target with a poisonous stinger. This has a 30% chance to poison."EThe user hits the target with its tail. Can random critical hit."lInflicts physical or special damage, whichever will be more effective. This has a 30% chance to poison."NUnsanitary sludge is hurled at the target. It has a 30% chance to poison."JIt swamps the area around the user with a giant wave of toxic sludge."\The target is attacked with an emission of filthy gases. It has a 30% chance to poison."hThe user shoots poisonous threads to poison the target and lowers the target's Speed by four steps."WNearby poisoned foes have their Attack, Sp. Atk, and Speed lowered by three steps."jThe user drenches the foe in a special poisonous liquid. Its power doubles if the target is poisoned."mO usuário atira o osso que segura. O osso dá meia-volta e atinge o alvo duas vezes: ao ir e ao voltar."�O usuário atinge tudo ao seu redor ao pisotear o chão. Isso diminui, em um nível, a Velocidade de todos os Pokémon atingidos."UThe user burrows, charging and becoming hidden, then attacks on the second turn."dThe user crashes into its target while rotating its body like a drill. Can random critical hit."dThe user makes the ground under the foe erupt with power. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Def."[The user sets off an earthquake that strikes every Pokémon around it and underground."zGravity is intensified for five turns, grounding all Pokémon, doubling their weight, and doubling all move Accuracy."nThe user attacks by shooting a beam of mud at the target. It also lowers the target's Speed by two steps."`The user attacks its foes by manifesting the power of the land in fearsome blades of stone."]The user wraps foes in fierce winds and searingly hot sand. It has a 30% chance to burn."PThrows scorching sand at the target to attack. It has a 10% chance to burn."FThe user heals itself by half of its max HP, or 66% in sandstorm."zThe user lays a hazard layer of Spikes on the foe's side. Foes that switch into battle are hurt a bit for each layer."SThe user attacks driven by frustration. Power doubles if previous move failed."eThis move also hits Pokémon that are in the air. Those Pokémon are knocked down to the ground."ZThe user attacks with a wave that crawls along the ground. Those it hits are trapped."UO usuário esmaga o alvo em alta velocidade. Esse movimento sempre vai primeiro."jO usuário ataca com um poder pré-histórico. Tem 20% de chance de aumentar todos os seus atributos."[The user whips up a storm of diamonds to damage foes, raising its Defense and Sp. Def."oCharges with space power and boosts its Sp. Atk by two steps on one turn, then attacks on the second turn."XThe user attacks with a ray of light that sparkles as if it were made of gemstones."hThe user shoots powerful lasers using the power of a prism. The user is exhausted on the next turn."lThe user hurls hard rocks at the target. The target is multi-hit two to five times in quick succession."PThe user polishes its body to reduce drag, raising its Speed by four steps."GThe user picks up and throws a small rock at the target to attack."WBoulders are hurled at the target. It also lowers the target's Speed by two steps."fThe user launches a huge boulder at the target to attack. The user is exhausted on the next turn."WSummons sandstorm for six turns. Damages non-Rock, non-Ground Pokémon every turn."\The user lays a levitating hazard around the foe. It deals Rock-typed 1/10th HP damage."fThe user swings its stone axes. This leaves a levitating stone hazard floating around the target."=The user stabs the foe with sharpened stones from below."bPours sticky tar over the target, lowering its Speed by six steps and making it weak to Fire."lThe user and its allies are protected from spread moves for a turn. Always fails if used in succession."hO usuário pica o alvo. Se o alvo tiver uma Fruta equipada, o usuário a come e ganha seus efeitos."O usuário vibra suas asas para criar uma parede nociva de som. Tem 20% de chance de diminuir a Def. Esp. do alvo em um nível."qThe user calls its underlings to shield it, raising its Defense and Sp. Def by two steps. Always goes first."cWhen the user knocks out a target with this move, this raises the user's Attack by five steps."UOnly works on the first turn the user is in battle. This move always goes first."^The user calls out its underlings to heal it. The user heals itself by 60% of its max HP."XThe user summons bugs to swarm the target, trapping and binding it for three turns."^The user drains the target's blood. The user's HP is restored by 50% of the damage dealt."fThe user makes a lunge at the target, attacking with full force. This lowers the target's Attack."VUsing its tough and impressive horn, the user rams into the target with no letup."_Sharp spikes are shot at the target in rapid succession. They multi-hit two to five times."PFires an exploding pollen puff at enemies, or a HP-restoring one at allies."SThe user raises their Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps, and Speed by one step."IThe user attacks with a beam of light. It has a 30% chance to dizzy."cThe foe is attacked with powdery scales blown by wind. It has a 20% chance to raise all stats."dThe user rolls over its foes, crushing them. It has a 40% chance to lower the target's Defense."tWeaves a sticky net around the opposing team, a hazard which lowers their Speed by two steps upon switching in."xAll nearby foes are bound with silk blown from the user's mouth. This silk lowers the targets' Speed by four steps."eWhile resisting, the user attacks all nearby foes. The targets' Sp. Atk is lowered by two steps."]The user stares at flashing lights to focus its mind, raising its Sp. Atk by five steps."eAfter making its attack, the user rushes back to switch places with a party Pokémon in waiting."[The user slashes at the foe by crossing its scythes or claws. Can random critical hit."dO usuário ataca o alvo gritando de forma espantosa. Tem 40% de chance de fazer o alvo hesitar."]O usuário ataca lançando uma quantidade assustadora de pequenos fantasmas no oponente."IThe target is exposed to a sinister ray, causing it to become dizzy."bWhen this move is used, if the user faints, the foe that landed the knockout hit also faints."TFor five turns, this move prevents the target from using the move it last used."{The user hexes the target with evil magic. This deals double damage if the target has a non-volatile status condition."ZThe target is licked with a long tongue, causing damage. It has a 30% chance to numb."dThe user emits a sinister ray. This move can be used on the target regardless of its Abilities."fThe user blasts the target with a gust of repulsive wind. It has a 20% chance to raise all stats."bThe user adds its HP to the target's HP, then equally shares the combined HP with the target."_Any Pokémon that hears this song faints in three turns, unless it switches out of battle."VThe user frightens the target with a scary face to lower its Speed by four steps."WThe user hurls a shadowy blob at the target. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Def."iThe user beats the target with a bone containing a spirit. This lowers their Defense by three steps."SThe user slashes with a sharp claw made from shadows. Can random critical hit."|The user disappears, charging and becoming hidden, then strikes on the second turn. It hits even if the foe protects itself."BThe user throws a punch from the shadows. Lands without fail."aThe user extends its shadow and attacks the target from behind. This move always goes first."`The user moves into the target's shadow, steals the target's stat boosts, and then attacks."XThe user attacks while also stitching the target's shadow to the ground to trap it."\The user takes the target trick-or-treating. This adds Ghost type to the target's type."TThe user shoots a sinister, bluish-white flame at the target to inflict a burn."nO usuário perde parte de seu corpo, tornando-se mais leve e aumentando sua Velocidade em quatro níveis."AO usuário se torna um enorme escudo e colide contra o alvo."CO usuário se torna uma enorme espada colossal e corta o alvo."`O usuário atinge o alvo com socos rápidos como balas. Esse movimento sempre vai primeiro."jThe user foretells doom. Two turns later, the targeted spot is hit with a concentrated beam of light."}The user rotates, centering the hex nut in its chest, and then strikes twice. Each hit has a 30% chance to flinch the target."iThe user gathers all its light energy and releases it at once. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Def."LThe user attacks by grinding two of its steel gears against the target."eThe user tackles the target with a high-speed spin. The slower the user, the greater the damage."�The user slams into the opposing side with its heavy body. The heavier the user is compared to the target, the greater the damage."VThe user hardens its body's surface like iron, raising its Defense by four steps."aThe foe slams the target with its steel-hard head. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."kProtects the user from damage this turn. It also lowers the Attack of physical attackers by two steps."hThe user focuses intensely. For the next three turns, its attacks will be guaranteed critical hits."VA retaliation move that counters any attack, inflicting 150% of the damage taken."OThe target is raked with steel claws. It has a 20% chance to raise Attack."TA horrible sound like scraping metal lowers the target's Sp. Def by four steps."bThe target is hit with a hard punch fired like a meteor. It has a 20% chance to raise Attack."KThe user rotates its gears, raising its Attack and Speed by two steps."fFires a beam of steel that it collected from its entire body. The user loses half its current HP."\The target is hit with wings of steel. It has a 30% chance to raise the user's Defense."iThe user slams into the target with the force of a meteor. Can't be stopped by the target's Ability."_A frenetic dance to uplift the fighting spirit. It raises the user's Attack by four steps."_O alvo é arrasado por uma explosão ardente. O usuário deve descansar no turno seguinte."PO usuário dá um chute flamejante. Tem 10% de chance de causar queimadura."fAtaca com a ira ardente da inveja. Todos os oponentes com aumentos de atributo sofrem queimadura."�Para inflingir um dano massivo, o usuário consome sua tipagem de Fogo. Esse movimento falha se o usuário não for do tipo Fogo."KThe target is attacked with small flames. It has a 10% chance to burn."gThe user attacks in an explosive fury. Weakens in damage as the user loses HP. Weakest at half HP."EThe foe is attacked with an intense blast of all-consuming fire."yThe user bites with flame-cloaked fangs. It has a 20% chance to burn and a 20% chance to lower Defense by two steps."iThe user strikes the target with a flaming lash. This also lowers the target's Defense by two steps."tA column of fire hits the target. When used with its Grass equivalent, it creates a Sea of Fire for four turns."JThe target is punched with a fiery fist. It has a 10% chance to burn."[The user engulfs the target in fierce flames, trapping and binding it for three turns."eThe user cloaks itself in flame and attacks. Building up more power, it raises the user's Speed."WThe target is scorched with an intense blast of fire. It has a 10% chance to burn."ZThe user cloaks itself in fire and rushes at the target. It has a 30% chance to burn."LThe user runs at the foe while on fire. The user also takes 33% recoil."The user slams the opposing side with its flaming body. The heavier the user is compared to the target, the greater the damage."_The user attacks by exhaling hot breath on the opposing team. It has a 20% chance to burn."nThe user attacks all foes nearby with fire. The targets' held Berry or Gem becomes burnt up and unusable."cThe user attacks by engulfing the target in an intense fire. It leaves the target with a burn."UThe user spews magma around the target, trapping and binding it for three turns."dThe user attacks everything by causing its own head to explode. The user also takes 50% recoil."kThe user attacks by breathing a special, hot fire. This also lowers the target's Sp. Atk by two steps."]The user attacks the target at full power. This lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."HAttacks by igniting a small stone and launching it as a fiery ball."FThe user rampages and attacks while spewing flames for two turns."vThe user rigs its shell to explode. If hit by a foe's physical move, the shell detonates and hurts all near foes."~With a fiery forehead, the user hurls itself at the foe. This lowers the user's Defense, Sp. Def, and Speed by two steps."MSe os PV do alvo forem 50% ou menos, este ataque terá seu dano dobrado."uUma rajada de bolhas é lançada contra o alvo. Tem 20% de chance de diminuir a Velocidade do alvo em um nível."jUma rajada de bolhas é fortemente lançada contra o alvo. Diminui a Velocidade do alvo em um nível."YO usuário agarra o alvo com força, prendendo-o e constringindo-o por três turnos."oDiving on the first turn, charging and becoming hidden, the user hits from below water on the second turn."gRends the target with its hard gills. Deals 50% more damage unless the target has moved this turn."SThe target is hit with a watery blast. The user is exhausted on the next turn."SThe target is blasted by a huge volume of water launched under great pressure."bThe user scatters mysterious water around and heals itself and allies by 25% of their max HP."USlams into the target using an aquatic blast with a 20% chance to lower Defense."dThe user attacks opposing Pokémon with a pulse of water which glows a deep and brilliant blue."SThe user cuts the foe with sharp shells. It has a 50% chance to lower Defense."TThe user shoots boiling hot water at its target. This has a 30% chance to burn."�The user breaks its shell. This raises the user's Attack, Sp. Atk and Speed by three steps, but lowers Defense and Sp. Def by two steps."QThe target is struck with a supersonic water blast. Can random critical hit."qThe user bursts into a bubbly song. Pokémon hit by this are cured of burn. Deals 50% less damage to allies."VThe user immerses the target in superheated steam. This has a 30% chance to burn."WIt swamps the area with a giant wave, hitting every battler nearby and underwater."bStrikes the target thrice, with mastery of the Water style. Always results in a critical hit."MThe user lunges at the target and has a 40% chance to flinch the target."RThe target is blasted with a forceful shot of water. Can random critical hit."pA column of water hits the target. When used with its Fire equivalent, it creates a Rainbow for four turns."gThe user multi-hits the target two to five times with throwing stars. This move always goes first."iThe user spouts water to damage the foe. Weakens in damage as the user loses HP. Weakest at half HP."_Um ataque que drena nutrientes. Os PV do usuário são recuperados em 50% do dano causado."yO usuário solta um aroma tranquilizante que cura todas as condições de status não voláteis afetando sua equipe."oO usuário rapidamente atira sementes contra o alvo. Resulta em acertos múltiplos, de duas a cinco vezes."rO usuário atira sua clorofila acumulada para causar dano no alvo. O usuário perde metade de seus PV atuais."eThe user protects itself by wrapping its body in soft cotton, raising its Defense by five steps."lThe user releases cotton-like spores that cling to all foes nearby, lowering their Speed by four steps."\The user attacks with the essence of life. It has a 20% chance to raise user's Sp. Atk."]The user slams the target with an enormous tree. The user is exhausted on the next turn."hThe user snares the target with grass and trips it. The heavier the target, the greater the damage."tA column of grass hits the target. When used with its Water equivalent, it creates a vast Swamp for four turns."eThe user's body grows all at once, raising Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps, or four in sunshine."pThe user heals itself and allies by 25% of their max HP, as well as healing non-volatile status conditions."QThe user attacks by pelting the target with leaves. Can random critical hit."aThe user handles a sharp leaf like a sword and attacks by slashing. Can random critical hit."YA storm of sharp leaves is whipped up. This lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."CA seed is planted on the target, causing it to become leeched."VThe user scatters leaves that chase the target. Can't miss and skips protections."FThe user attacks by scattering petals in a rampage for two turns."TThe user violently whirls its vines, tentacles, or the like to lash the target."\Sharp-edged leaves are launched to slash at the opposing team. Can random critical hit."]The user generates a shock wave from within its body. This lower's the target's Sp. Def."VThe user charges, then attacks on the second turn. Charges instantly in sunshine."MProtects the user from attacks. Physical attackers take 1/8th HP damage."SThe user scatters bursts of spores that induce sleep. Only one use per battle."JLowers the target's Attack, then heals itself by the target's Attack."EThe user heals itself by half of its max HP, or 66% in sunshine."nThe user lands an intense tropical kick on the target. This also lowers the target's Attack by two steps."7The target is struck with slender, whiplike vines."^The user slams its rugged body into the target to attack. The user also takes 33% recoil."oO usuário ataca com um bico eletrizado. Dá 50% a mais de dano se o alvo ainda não se moveu neste turno."�O usuário fica energizado, dobrando o dano de seu próximo ataque do tipo Elétrico. Também aumenta sua Defesa e Def. Esp em um nível."gO usuário dispara um feixe concentrado de eletricidade, aumentando seu Atk. Esp. em dois níveis."[The user's body generates an eerie impulse. Lowers the target's Sp. Atk by four steps."[The user hurls an electric orb at the foe. It does more damage the faster the user is."hThe user captures and attacks foes by using an electric net, which lowers their Speed by two steps."NThe user levitates using electrically generated magnetism for five turns."dThe user nuzzles its electrified cheeks against the target. This also leaves the target numbed."aThe user attacks everything around it. The user's HP is restored by 50% of the damage dealt."^The user attacks with electrically infused fists. Normal-type moves become Electric-type."dThe user strikes the target with a quick jolt of electricity. Can't miss and skips protections."UThe user throws an electrical tackle at the target. It has a 30% chance to numb."ZCan't miss in rainstorm. It has a 30% chance to numb. Can hit targets flying high up."RA strong electric blast is loosed at the target. It has a 10% chance to numb."fThe user throws a cage of electricity around the target, trapping and binding it for three turns."wThe user bites with electrified fangs. It has a 20% chance to numb and a 20% chance to lower Defense by two steps."QThe target is punched with an electrified fist. It has a 10% chance to numb."_A jolt of electricity is hurled at the foe to inflict damage. It has a 10% chance to numb."RThe user lunges at the foe while electrified. The user also takes 33% recoil."YThe user savagely attacks foes with lightning and wind. It has a 30% chance to numb."eThe user shrouds itself in electricity and smashes into its foe. The user also takes 25% recoil."XThe user fires an electric blast like a cannon to inflict damage and cause numbing."bA strong electric blast crashes down on the target. It has a 60% chance to flinch the target."{O usuário relaxa e torna seu corpo mais leve para se mover mais rápido, aumentando sua Velocidade em quatro níveis."�O usuário temporariamente esvazia sua mente para esquecer suas preocupações. Aumenta a Def. Esp. do usuário em quatro níveis."cO usuário quietamente foca sua mente para aumentar seu Atk. Esp. e Def. Esp. em dois níveis."bThe user casts a horrible spell on the opponent. This removes 4 PP from their last used move."aThe user shoots its psychic power from its eyes to attack. It has a 20% chance to frostbite."dThe user foretells an attack. Two turns later, a hunk of psychic energy hits the targeted spot."qThe user employs psychic power to average its unmodified Defense and Sp. Def stats with those of its target."}The user faints. In return, the Pokémon taking its place will have its HP restored and non-volatile status conditions cured."VThe user emits a healing pulse which heals the target's HP by half of its max HP."bThe user unleashes a vicious blow after a cute act. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."TThe user employs its psychic power to switch stat step changes with the target."�Using a hyperspace hole, the user appears next to the target and strikes. Can't miss, skips Substitutes and destroys protections."GThe user instructs the target to use the target's last move again."oA wondrous screen is put up to halve special attacks for five turns, or reduce it by 33% in multi battles."}The user faints. In return, the Pokémon taking its place will have its non-volatile status conditions and HP fully restored."_Until end of turn, reflects status moves that target the user or create hazards around it."]A retaliation move that counters any special attack, inflicting double the damage taken."pThe user employs psychic power to average its unmodified Attack and Sp. Atk stats with those of the target."NThe target is attacked with a peculiar ray. It has a 30% chance to dizzy."pThe user bites the target using psychic capabilities. Also breaks any screens protecting the target's 