d by two steps."]The user attacks with a chilling gust of powdery snow. It has a 10% chance to frostbite."�O usuário ferozmente balança sua cauda contra Pokémon oponentes, diminuindo o Ataque ou Atk. Esp. (o que for maior) deles em dois níveis."eO usuário aumenta todos os seus atributos em dois níveis, ao custo de 33% de seus PV máximos."MThe user sends out a telluric shockwave, damaging and dizzying all foes."YComets are summoned down from the sky. This lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."VThe user exhales a mighty gust that inflicts damage. It has a 30% chance to numb."8The user slashes the target with huge, sharp claws."mThe user vigorously performs a mystic, powerful dance, raising its Attack by two steps and Speed by one."oAttacks all enemy Pokémon with pure vitality. Weakens in damage as the user loses HP. Weakest at half HP."RThe user uses its body like a hammer to attack the target and inflict damage."SThe target is attacked with a shock wave generated by the user's gaping mouth."ZThe user forces the target to switch out, to be replaced at random. Always goes last."4The user unleashes a strong beam from its core."[The most powerful attack of the original form. The user is exhausted on the next turn."kThe user attacks with apocalyptic light. This ignores their ability. Changes Necrozma's form upon use."kThe user blasts the target with power that distorts even time. The user is exhausted on the next turn."WThe user tears the target along with the space around it. Can random critical hit."OA small tornado hits the target. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."]Se o alvo já houver levado algum dano no mesmo turno, este ataque tem seu dano dobrado."bAcerta uma vez para cada Pokémon na sua equipe. Dá mais dano baseado no Ataque dos membros."jO alvo é mordido com presas extremamente afiadas. Tem 20% de chance de diminuir Defesa em um nível."WO usuário balança seu corpo violentamente para causar danos a tudo em sua volta."�O usuário corta usando sua concha-lâmina e co-
loca uma armadilha de camada de espinhos sob o alvo, se nenhuma camada já tiver sido colocada."`The user tells the target a secret, lowering its Sp. Atk by three steps. Always goes first."\The user crunches up the target with sharp fangs. It has a 20% chance to lower Defense."[The user swings both arms and hits the target. Ignores the target's stat step changes."cThe user releases an aura imbued with dark thoughts. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."TThe user feigns crying to worry the target, lowering its Sp. Def by four steps."mThe user fakes the target out and stabs them with its disheveled hair. Can't miss and skips protections."lThe user draws up to the foe disarmingly, then throws a sucker punch. Can't miss and skips protections."mThe user transforms its wrath into a fire-like aura to attack. It has a 50% chance to flinch the target."dThe user throws its held item at the target. Some items deal more damage or have extra effects."UTurns the foe's power against it, dealing damage using the target's Attack stat."QThe user sharpens its claws to raise its Attack and Accuracy by three steps."VThe user howls loudly to raise its Attack by three steps, and its allies' by one."Unleashes a barrage of attacks. Can't miss, skips Substitutes and destroys protections. Lowers the user's Defense by two steps."NTraps the user and target until either of them faints or is switched out."7The user slaps the target to knock off their item."YIf the user's stats were lowered during the turn, the power of this move is doubled."UThe user faints in order to lower the target's Attack and Sp. Atk by five steps."\The user slashes the target the instant an opportunity arises. Can random critical hit."mProtects the user from damage this turn. It also lowers the Defense of physical attackers by four steps."_The user lowers the target's Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps. Then, the user switches out."MIf the user moves after the target, this attack's power will be doubled."NThe user attacks with a pillar of dark light. This ignores their ability.">Inflicts double damage on a target that is switching out."?The user suppresses the target and makes its move go last."dThe user yells as if it is ranting about something, lowering the target's Sp. Atk by two steps."gThis turn, the user steals the effects of healing, buffing, or protective screen moves a foe uses."kThis move enables the user to attack first. It fails if the target is not readying an attack, however."OThe user trades held items with the target faster than the eye can follow."eThe target is taunted into a rage that prevents it from using status moves for three more turns."pThe user attacks and steals the foe's held item simultaneously. Items stolen from wild Pokémon are stored."aThe user attacks the target's throat. The target cannot use sound-based moves for two turns."kAll stat step changes affecting the target turn topsy-turvy and become the opposite of what they were."fThe user torments and enrages the foe, making it incapable of using the same move twice in a row."^The user strikes with a fierce blow of Dark Mastery. It always results in a critical hit."oUsando um aroma misterioso, o usuário aumenta a Defesa e Def. Esp. de um Pokémon aliado em dois níveis."oO usuário encara com seus olhos ternos, reduzindo o Ataque do alvo em três níveis. Sempre vai primeiro."aO usuário encara encantadoramente o alvo. O Ataque do alvo é diminuído em quatro níveis."WThe user protects itself and its allies from status moves with a mysterious power."TThe user emits a powerful damaging flash. It has a 40% chance to lower Sp. Atk."TThe user does emotional damage to the target. Can't miss and skips protections."gThe user steals the target's HP with a kiss. The user's HP is restored by 75% of the damage dealt."CThe user stirs up a fairy wind and strikes the target with it."TThe user unleashes a strong beam. This lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."\The user charges with energy and raises all of its stats by two steps on the next turn."bFires a powerful beam of light drawn from the Eternal Flower. The user also takes 50% recoil."_The user attacks by borrowing the power of the moon. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Atk."XThe user hits the target with the force of nature. It cuts the target's HP to half."^The user plays rough with the target and attacks it. It has a 20% chance to lower Attack."XAttacks the target and breaks its spirit. Lowers the target's Sp. Atk by two steps."dThe user attacks foes with love and hate. It has a 30% chance to lower both Attack and Sp. Atk."WThe user kisses the target with a sweet, angelic cuteness that dizzies the target."�The user attacks with a secret power that has a 30% chance to cause an effect. The effect varies depending on the user's environment."6The user attacks the target by dancing very hard."ZUm ataque desferido com o poder de um rei preguiçoso. Ignora e destrói proteções."RO usuário estabiliza seus olhos, mente e corpo para maximizar sua Precisão."kO usuário expõe seus dentes de uma forma ameaçadora, diminuindo a Defesa do alvo em quatro níveis."�Tanto o alvo quanto o usuário caem no sono, recuperando totalmente seus PV e curando quaisquer condições de status não voláteis."|O usuário confronta o alvo em uma disputa cabeça-a-cabeça. O dano é baseado no Ataque do alvo em vez de sua Defesa."jO usuário se concentra para estabilizar seu humor. Aumenta a Def. Esp. do usuário em três níveis."BO usuário ataca com todo o poder do Mercado. Espalha moedas."sO usuário ataca embuído em elementos. Tem 15% de chance de causar envenenamento, ensopamento ou parasitismo."\The user stimulates its brain by planning. It raises the user's Sp. Atk by three steps."sThe user chooses between the three most recent moves used by the opposing team, and uses that move themselves."WThe user curls up to conceal weak spots and raise both of its Defense and Sp. Def."TThe user dazzles nearby foes with light. Their Sp. Atk is lowered by two steps."=The user shoots a pulse of diffuse energy at the target."rThe user calls its team to a farm-fresh meal, sacrificing 25% HP to heal each of its party members by 25% HP."aThe user attacks with a disrupting beam of common sense. Super effective versus Fairy-types."oThis attack inflicts double damage on a waterlogged foe. It also cures the target's waterlogging, however."�The user gifts the target a bad egg, damaging them, and draining their vital essence. This move deals 50 damage. The user's HP is restored by 100% of the damage dealt."oThe user chooses between Searing Crunch, Glacial Crunch, Aquatic Crunch, and Volt Crunch to use this turn."`The user chooses between Fire Fang, Ice Fang, Hydro Fang, or Thunder Fang to use this turn."{The user performs a spirited dance for its allies and itself, raising their Speed and raising their Accuracy by four steps."�The user foretells your choice of Fire, Electric, or Ice-type. One turn later, the targeted spot explodes with energy of that type."fChanneling fear, the user bites the target. Deals double damage if the user is below half health."VThe user channels ancient energy to grant a nearby ally an extra turn this round."XDeals more damage the less HP the user has. After attacking, the user switches out."mThe user's eyes glow with divine judgement, numbing the target and lowering both its Attack and Sp. Atk."OThe user focuses its aim to raise its Sp. Atk and Accuracy by three steps."CThe user slashes broadly, cleanly slicing all nearby battlers."_The user cleans the target aggressively with soapy water. It has a 50% chance to waterlog."XThe user spins the target with a cleansing vortex. It has a 30% chance to waterlog."iThe user lounges around with decadent laziness, restoring its HP by 66%. This move always goes last."oA lullaby is sung in a calming voice that puts the target with half its HP or less left into a deep sleep."hThe target is struck by a pulse of negative energy. This resets the target's positive stat changes."`The target is cut by a piercing slash. Can random critical hit, and does so twice as often."@The user shoots a pulse of neutral particles at the target."The user suddenly falls asleep for one turn, making enemies drop their guard, lowering their Defense and Sp. Def by four steps."aThe user pranks the target, surprising it and lowering its Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps."kThe user expresses a mystical potential. Changes type to match the user's Gem, Plate, or Crystal Veil."WThe user pulverizes the target with both its fists. This raises the user's Attack."oThe user warms up by treating the target as a punching bag, damaging them and raising Attack by two steps."{The user adorns itself or the target with precious stones, changing it to your choice of Fairy, Dragon, or Steel-type."\The user performs a long-forgotten song and dance. This is both a Sound and Dance move."LThe user switches out to a party Pokémon in waiting. Always goes last."eThe user attacks the target with stored power. Has 10 more base power for each raised stat step."rThe user brings down a ruinous power on the target. This has a 20% chance of lowering all the target's stats."�A blessed screen protects the user's side from critical hits for five turns, reducing move damage taken by 25%, or 20% in multi battles."dThe user strikes while inviting the power of seasons. The user changes form to the next season."KThe user shouts with force at the target. This move always hits first."FThe user charges, then puts the target to sleep on the next turn."\The user smirks with confidence. The Sp. Def of nearby enemies is lowered by two steps."|A barrage of star-shaped rays are shot at the target, to multi-hit two to five times. Can't miss and skips protections."TThe user emits a deep, rumbling snore. This move can only be used while asleep."fThe user attacks and steals items from all near foes. Items stolen from wild Pokémon are stored."lThe user flings the dirty oil on its fur. It transfers any non-volatile status condition to the target."gThe user strikes the target, then slinks into the water. The user takes 33% less damage this turn."rThe user causes the air around the target to explode. The move's type is changed based on the active weather."�The user throws away up to 1000 scattered coins to bless its side, blocking random added effects and healing for 1/16th HP each turn. Lasts one turn per 100 coins."[Alters the reality of the area to damage a foe. Puzzle Room is created for five turns."bThe user conjures up the past, transforming the target into their previous evolutionary form."iO usuário manifesta seu entusiasmo em um chicote que possui 20% de chance de aumentar seu Atk. Esp."�Habilita acertos críticos aleatórios para o usuário, dobra suas chances de acerto crítico e aumenta seu Atk. e Def. em dois níveis."~O usuário contorce o chi do alvo com um pulso de energia, causando dano e diminuindo a Def. Esp. do alvo em um estágio."qAura profunda no corpo do usuário é canalizada em um pulso exterior. Não pode errar e ignora proteções."�Este Pokémon carrega no primeiro turno, e então libera um poderoso feixe de aura. Dá mais dano quanto menos PV o usuário possuir."Por mais três turnos, o alvo é inibido por regras que o previnem de usar movimentos que não sejam de seu próprio tipo."\O usuário abraça o alvo intensamente, prendendo-o e constringindo-o por três turnos."bO usuário improvisa uma dança, aumentando seus dois atributos mais fracos em três níveis."sO usuário exibe sua pele rochosa, aumentando seu Ataque e sua Defesa em dois níveis e ganhando o tipo Pedra."dO usuário e seus aliados levam 50% menos dano neste turno. Sempre falha se usado em sucessão."UO usuário arrisca um soco explosivo, arqueado e de corpo inteiro contra o alvo."rCombinando dança e arte marcial, o usuário atinge o alvo e aumenta sua própria Velocidade em dois níveis."CCerca o alvo com materiais de construção. O alvo é inibido."PThe user fires a small shockwave. This has a 30% chance to numb the target."vEnables random critical hits for the user, quadruples its critical hit chance, and raises its Speed by two steps."uThe user attacks freed from earthly attachments. Doubles in damage if the user has no item when the move starts."LThe user drops onto the target with a kick, dealing 25% recoil to self."lThe user endures attacks with 1 HP. If so, raises its Attack by two steps. Fails if used in succession."[The user raises all of their stats by two steps. Fails unless a foe fainted last turn."HThe user strikes the target with a basic frontal kicking technique."TThe user strikes the target's pressure points with precise punches, numbing it."hA kick that can also eliminate trapping and hazards afflicting your side. Also raises user's Speed."aThe user grabs the target, slamming both of them into the ground. The user takes 20% recoil."\The user attacks with a burst of inner energy. Lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."`The user mimics Kung Fu techniques while sleeping. This move can only be used while asleep."PThe user attacks with a strong punch. It has a 20% chance to lower Defense."fThe user holds fast with its teammates, raise its Defense by three steps, and its allies' by one."_The user shoots three arrows made of Aura with extreme precision. Can random critical hit."dThe user manifests a bolt of pure courage. This has a 20% chance of raising the user's Sp. Atk."sThe user relentlessly rampages with its whip-like hands for two turns. Each hit will always be a critical hit."wThe user kicks while rotating at high speed, dashing across the battlefield to deal damage to all nearby battlers."bUma investida aérea perigosa vinda dos céus. O usuário também leva 25% de dano colateral."�O usuário comprime, a densidades impossíveis, o ar ao redor ao alvo. Se o movimento é super ou hiperefetivo, o dano é aumentado em 30%."oO usuário observa o campo de batalha de cima. Isso aumenta Atk. Esp., Defesa e Precisão em dois níveis."vO usuário solta uma rajada de vento contra o alvo. Isso também aumenta o Atk. Esp. do usuário em dois níveis."bO usuário sopra um frio vento do norte para atacar o alvo. Tem 30% de chance de causar frio."vUma maçã cai do alto e atinge o oponente. Sempre vai primeiro. Dá o dobro de dano sob Gravidade intensificada."TO usuário propele um vendaval contra o alvo. Tem 10% de chance de causar frio."SWinds from all directions arrive together in a flurry to rip about the target."tThe opponent is shredded by talons. This attack always results in a critical hit, but applies jinx to the user."YThe user sends a chilly wind towards the target. This has a 10% chance to frostbite."~A high pitched screech lowers all nearby foes' Defense, Sp. Def, and Evasion by three steps. Can't miss and skips protections."[The target is jabbed repeatedly with a horn or beak that multi-hits two to five times."aThe user attacks with a divine wind to punish the target. Super effective versus Dark-types."UThe user hops high up to land on the target's head. It has a 10% chance to numb."fThe user chases the target and strikes it from above. It does more damage the faster the user is."cThe user whips up a lingering tailwind that ups the Speed of all party Pokémon for six turns."eThe user takes off at sonic speeds, raising its Speed by four steps and gaining the Flying type."_The user launches a pulse in the form of a shock wave. It has a 20% chance to raise Speed."tThe user falls from up high, crushing the target beneath. This move does 30% more damage if the user is asleep."]The user quickly jumps high up, then falls onto the target. It has a 10% chance to numb."uThe user quickly increases the air pressure to damage the target. This attack always goes before any other move."�Clears hazards on the opponent's side of the field, moves hazards on the user's side to the opponent's, then forces the targets to switch."_Attacks all near foes while clearing weather. This move fails in the absence of a weather."}The user swoops into battle with a piercing shriek, flinching the target. It only works the first turn the user is in battle."[The user assists an ally by boosting the power and Accuracy of its next attack by 50%."^The user strikes the target with a dart of air. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."BThe user slashes the target while dashing skillfully past it."gThe user shoots out a pulse of driving energy. Building up more power, it raises the user's Speed."KWind rapidly spins the target in place to multi-hit two to five times."UThe target is struck with large, imposing wings. The user also takes 20% recoil."ZO usuário arremessa um ácido forte no alvo. Tem 20% de chance de diminuir Def. Esp."\O usuário e o alvo são banhados em ácido. O usuário perde metade de seus PV atuais."zO usuário chicoteia o alvo com sua cauda corrosiva. Isso atinge tipos Aço com dano neutro e também diminui Defesa."oO usuário borrifa uma substância química corrosiva no alvo. Tem 30% de chance de causar imobilização."bO usuário infecta o alvo com um toque, também destruindo quaisquer Ervas que o alvo possua."�O usuário lança uma bola de lixo que rola sobre todos os oponentes. Frutas ou Jóias seguradas pelos alvos grudam na bola e são inutilizadas."EThe user partially dissolves, raising its Sp. Def by five steps."fThe user steals blood. If the target is knocked out, this raises the user's Attack by five steps."aA Grey Mist covers the battlefield. For five turns, stats are reset at the end of each turn."FThe user attacks while slathered in grime. This poisons the user."PThe user envelops the target in a foul wind. It has a 30% chance to poison."ZThe user stabs the opponent with a toxin-infused limb. It has a 10% chance to poison."XThe user shoots the target with a dart made of toxins. This move always goes first."{The user lays a hazard layer of poison spikes on the foe's side. One layer hurts switched in foes, two layers poisons."sThe user jabs the target with its stinger while retreating. This poisons the target and switches the user out."NThe user attacks with sticky slime, rendering the target's item unusable."]The user punches the target while holding a wad of slime. It has a 30% chance to poison."hThe user uses venom that turns the target's body against it. Super effective versus Fighting-types."\Attacks with energy from jealousy. All opposing Pokémon with stat boosts get poisoned."[The user gives off a terrible stench towards the target. It has a 30% chance to dizzy."iThe target is forced to switch out by a stinky cloud, then the user also switches. Always goes last."LThe user bites the target with toxic fangs with a 30% chance to poison."_The user chomps with venomous teeth. The user's HP is restored by 33% of the damage dealt."EThe target is given a Black Sludge, replacing their item if any."]Halves attack damage taken this turn. Poisons any attackers. Fails if used successively."CThe user blasts a bundle of venom at the target, poisoning it."OThe user finishes off its prey. Power is tripled against poisoned targets."WThe user opens a rift beneath the target, trapping and binding it for three turns."WThe target is consumed by a desert storm, trapping and binding it for three turns."^The user whips up a hot desert twister to attack the target. It has a 30% chance to burn."PThe user whips up dirt at supersonic speeds, damaging everything around it."sThe user cracks the earth under the target with a massive strike. This lowers the user's Attack by four steps."aAttacks by blasting dirt and debris at the target. This move always goes first in sandstorm."mThe user uses all their might to attack their opponent, forcing the user to use Rest on their next turn."`The user stabilizes its stance. This raises its Attack, Sp. Def, and Accuracy by two steps."aEnergy is sent through a conduit, erupting under the target. This move is also Psychic-type."uThe user propels itself forward with a wave of mud which also slams into the target. The user's Speed is raised."`The user attacks by hurling a blob of mud. It has a 20% chance to lower the target's Speed."~The user shapes primal clay to heal a nearby ally for their max HP. This can overheal. The user is exhausted on the next turn."VThe user opens a pit beneath the target, trapping and binding it for three turns."uThe user churns the ground underneath the target, entangling them in plant matter. It has a 30% chance to leech."QThe user hits a pitch that turns earth and stone to dust, damaging its foes."aThe user burrows, charging and becoming hidden, then attacks three times on the second turn."\The user causes the earth to rumble, striking every Pokémon around it and underground."VThe user blasts the target with highly pressurized sand. Can random critical hit."PThe user tosses hot desert sand on the target. It has a 10% chance to burn."iThe user attacks with a tectonic vibration. It also breaks any screens protecting the target's side."cBy sacrificing 33% of its max HP, the user lays two hazard layers of Spikes at the foe's feet."OHits the target with a sandy wind, then summons sandstorm for eight turns."tThe user slathers mud around to heal itself by half of its max HP. This extends any active screens by one turn."oThe user attacks by flattening the target into the ground. This resets the target's positive stat changes."|The user slams the earth with its tail, creating a shockwave to damage the target. It has a 40% chance to lower Attack."SThe user tramples the target. It has a 20% chance to lower the target's Speed."`The user attacks the opposing Pokémon by trampling it. It has a 20% chance to lower Speed."uStress cracks form underneath the target, blasting them with volcanic ash. It has a 40% chance to lower Sp. Def.">O usuário lança-se contra o alvo com seu corpo rochoso."mO usuário atinge o alvo com sua cabeça dura como pedra. O usuário também leva 33% de dano colateral."vO usuário atinge os braços e pernas do alvo com uma grande pedra. Isso tem 50% de chance de causar uma fratura."bProtects the user from damage this turn. The user will counter with Granite Head if attacked."8The user attacks with the bright glint of crystals."VThe user shoots a spike of diamond to strike the target. Can random critical hit."BThe user calls up spikes of diamond. Can random critical hit."ZThe user weakens the target's bones, making them fracture. They deal 33% less damage."YThe user rushes into the target with its stony body. The user also takes 25% recoil."uThe user scratches the target with rough rocks. If in sandstorm, the target's Defense is lowered by three steps."pThe user slams the target into a nearby hard object. Increases in power the higher the Defense of any ally."CThe user slams the target with blunt force, taking 20% recoil."iThe user sweeps away hazards afflicting your side while lunging forward. User also takes 33% recoil."KThe user numbs the target, then welcomes in sandstorm for eight turns."jThe target's item is spelled away with Lunar Magic. Additionally, the target is given an EXP Candy M."�The user calls all rocks to join it, summoning sandstorm for five turns and laying a hazard of levitating stones around the target."hO usuário derruba um enorme pedaço sólido de rocha-matriz no alvo, que é fraturado no processo."�Protects the user and its allies from spread moves this turn and foes' moves get redirected to the user. Fails if used in succession."iThe user afflicts the target by turning their skin into stone. This has a 30% chance to fracture it."PThe user slams itself into the target with absurd force, taking 50% recoil."cLarge boulders are hurled at the foes to inflict damage. This has a 30% chance to fracture it."]The user throws a large rock at the target. If it misses, the user's Accuracy is raised."FThe user hits a rock in a precise way to launch it at the target."pThe user dances wildly while churning rocks towards the target. This raises the user's Attack by two steps."OIf this move misses, the target is forced to switch out. Always goes last."~The target is struck from all angles by light like gemstones. Deals double damage if the user has used a gem this battle."kThe user grinds stone into shrapnel and sprays it at the target. This has a 50% chance to fracture it."eThe user headbutts the target while maintaining a defensive aura. Sets Sanctuary for five turns."pThe user slams the target with a rocky blade. Destroys screens, Substitutes, and protections on the target."IThe user thrums ominously, lowering the target's Attack and Sp. Atk."9The user carefully lobs a small stone at high speed."�A star falls on the target. Witnessing this lucky star also enables random critical hits and doubles the user's critical hit chance."�The user attacks with shards from their rocky mane. For the next three turns, the Pokémon in the targeted slot loses 1/8th of their max HP."aChurns nearby rocks, dealing damage to nearby Pokémon and removing hazards from both sides."qThe user emits a wave of green light to strike near foes. Deals double damage to those slower than the user."dO usuário injeta um bioquímico extremamente doloroso no alvo. Tem 10% de chance de envenenar."iO usuário causa uma reação alérgica no alvo. Isso diminui a Velocidade do alvo em três níveis."rO usuário cria um rápido flash de bioluminescência para atacar o alvo. Este movimento sempre vai primeiro."gUm exército de insetos, agindo como um, ataca o alvo por baixo. Superefetivo contra o tipo Terra."eO usuário esmaga o alvo com uma dura carapaça. Tem 30% de chance de diminuir a Defesa do alvo."|O usuário ataca com um horrível barulho de coisas batendo. Tem 20% de chance de diminuir a Def. Esp. do alvo em um nível."ZThe user preys on the target's fear of insects, giving it a weakness to the Bug type."oA swarm of insects is sent to gnaw at the target. It also breaks any screens protecting the target's side."eThe user vibrates its wings to make a damaging sound wave. It has a 40% chance to lower Sp. Def."LVenom is introduced into the target with fangs or spines, poisoning it."fThe user consumes a bit of the target's blood. The user's HP is restored by 50% the damage dealt."JThe user emits an aroma that raises the target's three weakest stats."cThe user applies a painful chemical to the target with a smack. It has a 10% chance to poison."�The user stabs the target with a sharp spike to drain its life force. The user's HP is restored by 50% of the damage dealt. This can overheal."ZThe user attacks with small beams of light. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."EThe user emits rapid bursts of light and rampages for two turns."hThe user attacks with a blinding flash of bioluminscence. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."jAll foes have their Attack and Sp. Atk lowered. All foes' moves get redirected to the user this turn."<The foe is stabbed once by each of the user's stingers."sThe user makes a plea for survival, halving the damage their side takes from non-attack sources for ten turns."mThe user prepares its weapons. This raises the user's Attack by six steps but lowers Speed by six steps."0The user rakes the target with sharp claws."xThe user bites, claws, and stings the target while rolling. It has a 20% chance each to poison, waterlog, or leech."^The target is plastered with irritating scales, damaging it and changing its type to Bug."xThe user sheds a huge volley of scales at the target. Lands without fail. This lowers the user's Sp. Def and Speed."GThe user scratches the target with a flurry of claws, talons, etc."fIf the user is faster than the target, puts the target to sleep, then minimizes the user's Speed."kThe user stabs through the target using tremendous force. This lowers the user's Attack by four steps."gAvenging bugs everywhere, the user crushes the target. It has a 20% chance to lower their Defense."\The user stabs the target, injecting a painful chemical. It has a 30% chance to poison."[Halves attack damage taken this turn. Numbs any attackers. Fails if used successively."YThe user sucks the target's life. The user's HP is restored by 50% the damage dealt."\The user calls out its underlings to pummel the target. Skips and destroys protections."\The user summons bugs to terrorize the target, trapping and binding it for three turns."YThe user amps itself up for performance, raising its Sp. Atk and Speed by two steps."{Dois turnos depois desse movimento ser usado, os PV do alvo são curados em três quartos dos PV máximos do usuário."�O usuário visita outro plano de realidade para deslocar a alma do alvo. Causa 30% a mais de dano se o usuário estiver dormindo."~Anula o último movimento usado pelo alvo por quatro turnos, então diminui um atributo relevante dele em quatro níveis."{O usuário ataca tratando o alvo mal. Isso diminui o Ataque e o Atk. Esp. do alvo em dois níveis se usado durante Granizo."WThe user causes a glitch in reality. This attack always results in a critical hit."`The user loses 25% of their max HP to curse the target, damaging their HP by 25% each turn."dThe user makes a dreadful bell noise, harming all near battlers with visions of impending doom."LThe target becomes trapped, and takes 50% more damage from all attacks."aThe user sings with deathly sounds to harm the target. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Def."]The target is subjected to a violent and frightening prank. It has a 10% chance to numb."iThe user forces itself or the target to spend 25% HP to make a Substitute by turning it into a doll."hThe user soothes the target, lowering its Speed by four steps. If in hail, they also become drowsy."vThe user channels its fallen allies to strike the target. This attack has 20 more power per fainted party member."PDisables the target's last used move for five turns, and cuts 5 PP from it."mSpectral hands reach from the ground to trip the target. The heavier the target, the greater the damage."gThe user foretells a terrifying danger. Two turns later, the targeted spot is mortally frightened."`Changes type based on machine haunted. 30% chance of extra effect based on machine haunted."jThe user cleanses the target's impurities with spiritual energy. Super effective versus Poison-types."DThe user switches out using a cruel illusion. Always goes last."pThe user opens its soul to unleash massive energy. This lowers the user's Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps."{The target begins transforming into gold. They lose 1/8th HP every turn, scattering ten times as many coins as health lost."yThe user makes the target hit itself by possessing its body. This move does 50% more damage if the target is asleep."iThe user summons apparitions that dance around hypnotically before they multi-hit two to five times."gThe user practices its punches against ghostly illusions, raising its Attack, Speed, and Accuracy."WThe user drains heat from the air around the target, afflicting it with frostbite."OThe user buries the target with somber force. Then, this move is disabled."pThe user drains the target's soul. The user's HP is restored by 50% of the damage dealt. This can overheal."XThe user licks the target, numbing them, or cursing them if they're already numbed."gThe user unleashes its grudge, damaging the target and cutting 4 PP from the move last used by it."MThe user heals itself by 66% of its max HP. Then, this move is disabled."aThe user suffocates the target by sucking the air from their lungs. Can random critical hit."oThe user snips the target's connection to life in order to curse them, damaging their HP by 25% each turn."aThe user thins the air around the target, depriving them of oxygen. Can random critical hit."PThe target is pestered by a giant tongue. This has a 50% chance to numb it."fThe user shoots the target with darkness formed from anger. It has a 40% chance to lower Sp. Def."jThe user rips into the target's soul, dealing damage through their Sp. Def rather than their Defense."NThe user attacks while wailing. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."VThe user channels the anger of wronged spirits, going on a rampage for two turns."bO usuário corta com entusiasmo, inspirando seus aliados a acompanharem usando Talho no alvo."�O usuário usa pólvora para se disparar contra seu oponente. Tem 30% de chance de aumentar a Velocidade do usuário em um nível."^Uma manobra perigosa que força o usuário a sair de campo se errar. Sempre vai primeiro."vInflicts physical or special damage, whichever deals more. Then, raises Attack or Sp. Atk, whichever wasn't used."VConductive materials ensnare the target, trapping and binding it for three turns."nThe user launches piercing feathers three times, lowering the foe's Defense. Then, this move is disabled."nThe user lays a levitating hazard of sharp feathers around the foe. It deals Steel-typed 1/8th HP damage."The user dislodges a blast of thin projectiles. This attack always results in a critical hit, but applies fracture to the user."uThe user uses explosive force to shoot shards of its own body at the target. The user loses 1/8th of its max HP."]The user reflects a burst of light off its curls. Blinds a Pokémon entering the battle."_The user headbutts the target with a metal head. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."�A large spike is shot at the target. If this causes the target to faint, a hazard layer of Spikes is set on the ground beneath them."LThe target is pierced with a sharp iron arrow. Can random critical hit."QThe target is pierced with a pointed metal javelin. Can random critical hit."QThe user attacks with reflected light. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Def."_The user strikes the target while magnetizing it, trapping and binding it for three turns."LProtects the user from attacks. Special attackers take 1/8th HP damage."YThe user attacks the target with a sword. If the target faints, scatters many coins."�The user creates a high quality area for six turns in which super-effective deals 25% more, and not very effective deals 25% less."aThe user creates an explosion from powdered metal, inflicting damage to 