lvo. Tem 30% de chance de causar queimadura."�Acerto crítico garantido se o alvo tiver mudanças de atributo. O alvo é purificado, tendo suas mudanças de atributo redefinidas."QThe foe is engulfed in a firestorm, trapping and binding it for three turns."\The target is dried out and loses Water-type. Then, it bursts into flame from the heat."]The user emits great amounts of heat, burning the target and adding the Fire-type to it."aThe user fires off explosive rounds in a beautiful display that multi-hit two to five times."aThe target is punched with a tremendous fiery force. This move can't be used twice in a row."zThe user lays a hazard layer of burning spikes on the foe's side. One layer hurts switched in foes, two layers burns."VThe user flashes with a burst of intensely bright flame. Can random critical hit."nThe user targets the opponents soft spots with a fiery strike. Its power doubles if the target is burned."gRaises Sp. Atk by three steps. Until switch out, the user's attacks spread to hit all nearby foes."The user creates a golden pyre that revives a fainted Pokémon at half HP. That Pokémon switches in and its stats are boosted."sThe user dances with great heat. Pokémon hit by this are cured of frostbite. Deals 50% less damage to allies."mThe user pauses to plan its ranged attacks. This raises its Sp. Atk, Sp. Def, and Accuracy by two steps."WThe user shoots the target with a small bolt of fire. This move always goes first."9The user sets the target on fire, inflicting a burn."�If the target has a non-volatile status condition, this deals double damage and heals every battler's non-volatile status condition."^The user cloaks itself in a fierce blaze and attacks. It has a 20% chance to raise Speed."JThe user burns the target, then welcomes in sunshine for eight turns."TThe user warms up its body and attacks the target. It has a 10% chance to burn."wThe user launches up high, charging and becoming hidden, then explodes down on the second turn, taking 25% recoil."pThe user roars with the force of a volcano, raising the Attack of itself by three steps and allies' by one."kThe user attacks with fire that can be seen in multiple places, then summons sunshine for eight turns."{A lance of fire pierces the target from above, lowering their Sp. Atk. Can random critical hit, and does so twice as often."dThe user explodes itself into the target. The target is harmed, but also their Speed is raised."[Halves attack damage taken this turn. Burns any attackers. Fails if used successively."yThe user chomps down with burning fangs. It has a 20% chance to burn and a 20% chance to lower Defense by two steps."nThe user attacks with heat, creating an obscuring wall of haze. The user takes 33% less damage this turn."QCloaked in flames, the user dances wildly, raising its Sp. Atk by two steps."�The user sends up to two barrages of fire, each hitting two to five times. If two barrages were sent, the user is exhausted on the next turn."ZSummons sunshine for six turns, boosting Fire-type attacks and hindering most others."vThe user launches volcanic debris, dealing damage and setting a hazard layer of burning spikes around the target."aThe user surrounds the target with fire which also destroys any clothing items it's holding."gA distinguished attack that motivates nearby allies to follow, letting them act immediately after."cThe user launches a concentrated ball of searing, bright white flame. Can random critical hit."}The user creates a storm using its flaming body, damaging everything around it and melting away hazards from both sides."�O usuário rapidamente altera a pressão da água, criando uma onda de choque pulsante. O usuário perde 1/8 de seus PV máximos."zO usuário morde com presas aquosas. Tem 20% de chance de ensopar e 20% de chance de diminuir Defesa em dois níveis."}Carrega no primeiro turno, invocando um temporal por cinco turnos, então submerge o oponente em água no segundo turno."O usuário atira água purificada, também curando as condições de status não voláteis de todos os Pokémon da equipe."pO usuário pula pra fora da água para atacar. Tem 20% de chance de diminuir a Defesa do alvo em um nível."zO usuário cria inúmeras bolhas para explodirem contra o alvo. Resulta em acertos múltiplos, de duas a cinco vezes."�O usuário cria uma bolha que envolve seu aliado. Na próxima vez que ele for atacado, 50% do dano é refletido como dano colateral ao atacante."xUma parede de bolhas é arremessada contra o alvo. Tem 20% de chance de diminuir a Velocidade do alvo em um nível."�Um vácuo aquático é induzido e rapidamente colapsado, gerando um intenso e explosivo pulso de água. O usuário perde 1/8 de seus PV máximos."fThe user pulls the target under the waves with crushing force. This has a 10% chance to waterlog."TThe user douses the target, healing itself by 33% of its max HP in the process."�The user spews alkaline bubbles that melt the target. For the next two turns, the target's Defense will be lowered by two steps."_Halves attack damage taken this turn. Waterlogs any attackers. Fails if used successively."\The user struggles in the water, splashing it onto the target. They become waterlogged."dThe user gains an instinctual knowledge of battle, raising its Attack and Sp. Def by two steps."UThe user crashes into the target with its quills. It leaves the target poisoned."oThe user propels a geyser of water at the target. This lowers the user's Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps."lThe user dives down with its beak wide open. Transforms into Gulping- or Gorging form, depending on HP."UThe user crashes into the target like a tsunami. The user also takes 33% recoil."HThe target is immersed in water. This has a 30% chance to waterlog."OThe user waterlogs the target, then welcomes in rainstorm for eight turns."wThe user opens a spring to blast the target, also forming an Aqua Ring around themselves, healing 10% HP per turn."qAttacks with pressurized water. Deals 50% more damage if the user has been hurt by the foe in the same turn."`The target is struck with a stream of pressurized water. This has a 10% chance to waterlog."\Summons rainstorm for six turns, boosting Water-type attacks and hindering most others."eThe user rams its sharp face right into the target. This lowers the user's Speed by three steps."VThe user crashes into the target on a ripping current. This waterlogs the target."kThe user rips the target, lowering their Defense by two steps. After attacking, the user switches out."SStrikes the target with harbor waters, then summons rainstorm for eight turns."�The user rests in a riverbed, restoring its HP by half of max, and forming an Aqua Ring around themselves, healing 10% HP per turn."�The user communes with all the world's water, waterlogging the target and forming an Aqua Ring around themselves, healing 10% HP per turn."oThe user attacks with a wave of murky water, which hits all near foes and lowers their Speed by two steps."iThe target is crushed in the user's shell, mouth, or claws, trapping and binding it for three turns."cThe user rams the target while splashing up a lot of water. This has a 30% chance to waterlog."dThe target gets covered in sticky spines, waterlogging it and losing 1/8th of their current HP."ZThe user wields tidal power to grab at the target. This has a 10% chance to waterlog."`The user uses a jet of water like a sword and attacks by slashing. Can random critical hit."gThe user wakes to unleash devastating tides. Can only be used while asleep, and wakes the user up."=The target is doused with water in order to waterlog it."mThe user crashes into the target with the force of a large wave. This has a 40% chance to lower Defense."�The user attacks the target using graceful fluid movements, also forming an Aqua Ring around themselves, healing 10% HP per turn."�The user's song heals the non-volatile status conditions of all party Pokémon, and forms an Aqua Ring around itself, healing 10% HP per turn."YThe target is inundated with a wave of seaweater. This has a 30% chance to waterlog."cThe user rides a wave, then crashes into the target. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."FO usuário aplica substâncias anestésicas, imobilizando o alvo."{O usuário usa vento para lançar suas folhas contra o alvo. Isso diminui a Defesa e Def. Esp. do usuário em dois níveis."�O usuário graciosamente corta o alvo três vezes. Na próxima vez que este movimento for utilizado, ele cortará uma vez a mais."qFlores desabrocham intensamente, causando dano ao alvo e aumentando o Atk. Esp. do usuário em dois níveis."kRevive e completamente recupera os PV de um aliado do tipo Grama desmaiado. Apenas um uso por batalha."|O usuário some em meio à folhagem, carregando o ataque e ficando oculto, então ataca de seu esconderijo no segundo turno."�O usuário derruba algumas de suas cabeças das alturas. Quanto mais alto for o usuário em comparação ao alvo, maior será o dano."nThe user flicks its thorns, dealing damage and setting a hazard layer of poison spikes around the target."eThe user fires a bolt of life energy at the target. It has a 20% chance to raise user's Sp. Atk."RThe target is disoriented by an explosive seed. It has a 30% chance to dizzy."KRound objects are hurled at the target to strike three times in a row."gThe user attacks the target with the power of a warding charm. Super effective versus Ghost-types."�The user keeps time for the team while attacking. Raises user's and allies' Speed and Accuracy. Counts as a Sound and Kick move."sThe user sheathes its blade. If hit by a foe's special move, it unsheathes it quickly, slashing all near foes."^The user uses their feet to pierce the foe. This has a 10% chance of leeching the target."RThe user eats decaying leaves, restoring its HP by 50% and raising its Speed."fThe target eats a strange seed. They become numbed if faster than the user, or leeched if slower."YCreates an odd flower to throw and damage a foe. Odd Room is created for five turns."PThe user stirs up a violent petal tempest and attacks everything around it."@The target is irritated by allergenic plants, poisoning it."oThe user bursts a ball of sleep-inducing powder. It fails unless the targeted slot hit the user this turn."\Attacks all near foes while destroying rooms. This move fails in the absence of a room."]The user kicks into the target like roots into earth. This has a 30% chance of leeching."]Halves attack damage taken this turn. Leeches any attackers. Fails if used successively."gLays roots that heal the user by absorbing 1/8th HP from foes each turn. The user becomes trapped."zSaps an enemy lured into its jaws. If they hit the user this turn, the user's HP is restored by 66% the damage dealt."[Attacks with energy from jealousy. All opposing Pokémon with stat boosts get leeched."PA parasitic seed leeches the target and lowers both its Attack and Sp. Atk."OThe user and the target each share their highest stat step with the other."OAttacks by gliding on the ground. This move always goes first in sunshine."gThe user calms itself and its teammates, raise its Sp. Def by three steps, and its allies' by one."VA nutrient-draining attack. The user's HP is restored by 75% of the damage dealt."aThe user makes a scary sound by shaking, forcing the target to switch out. Always goes last."UThe user wraps the target in its vines, trapping and binding it for three turns."_The user whips their legs into the target like a plant. This has a 10% chance of leeching."�Garante um acerto crítico se o alvo não possui mudanças de atributo. O alvo é disparado para frente, aumentando todos os seus atributos."�O usuário dá assistência ao próximo movimento de um aliado, aumentando sua força em 50% e o permitindo se mover logo após o usuário."lUm clarão de eletricidade é usado para criar uma luz forte que atinge todos os combatentes próximos."KPelo resto do turno, a cura do alvo é invertida. Sempre vai primeiro."O usuário e o alvo entram em uma disputa de poderes. O dano é baseado no Atk. Esp. do alvo ao invés de em sua Def. Esp."�O usuário se sobrecarrega com eletricidade. Se der menos de 50% dos PV máximos do alvo, o usuário recebe a diferença como dano colateral."jThe user wraps their body in electricity and crashes into the target. The user also takes 20% recoil."ERevives a fainted party member to 1 HP. Only one use per battle."cThe user breaks down all insulation to send a barrage of electricity to rampage for two turns."rThe user forces electricity between opposite points on the target's body. Super effective versus Steel-types."_The user harnesses a blade of lightning and slices at the target. Can random critical hit."dThe target is punched with a tremendous electric force. This move can't be used twice in a row."PThe user lets out an electric roar, raising the user's Speed by four steps."mThe user slashes all opposing Pokémon with tendrils of electricity, lowering their Attack by two steps."xThe user attacks with courage. Sets a Spikes hazard layer if Full. If Hangry, deals double damage and is Dark-type."rThe user dances to heal an ally by half of their max HP. They're cured of any non-volatile status conditions."jCloaking itself in light energy, the user shocks the target, raising the user's Sp. Def by two steps."SDeals 50% more damage if faster than the target. This lowers the user's Speed."pThe target is pranked by an electric jolt. They are taunted and unable to use status moves for three turns."[The user strikes the enemy while coated with electricity. It has a 10% chance to numb."jElectricity is generated to beam intense light directly at the target. This has a 30% chance to numb."dThe user dances with the speed of lightning, raising its Sp. Atk by two steps and Speed by one."WThe user slams down into the target with electricity. It has a 10% chance to numb."rThe user lays a hazard around the foe. It deals Electric-typed 1/12th HP damage, or double that in rainstorm."ZThe user dances to encourage its ally. Their attacks this turn will be critical hits."�The user coils its body to generate an electric field, levitating for five turns and raising its Attack and Sp. Def by two steps."VA megawatt of electricity surges through the target. It has a 30% chance to numb."[The user finds the highest base power move among your able party members, and uses it."9A weak electric jolt is launched to numb the target."~The user slices with claws of light that have a 50% chance to numb. Can random critical hit. Counts as a Light and Slice move."rSends a pulse to flip the polarity of those nearby to damage a foe. Polarized Room is created for five turns."ePuts the target into a quarantine, trapping and disabling the move it last used for three turns."SThe target is struck with an electric current and multi-hit two to five times."|This move creates a directional magnetic field which reduces damage from attacks with 100 or more base power for five turns."VTurns the foe's power against it, dealing damage using the target's Sp. Atk stat."jAn electrified cloud zaps the target, lowering their Speed. It has a 50% chance to flinch the target."WThe user charges, then attacks on the second turn. Charges instantly in rainstorm."NThe user erupts with powerful yellow light to damage and numb the target."WThe user creates an electric fueled cage, trapping and binding it for three turns."jThe user takes an entire grid of power into its belly to slam the target. The user takes 100% recoil."~The user chomps down with high-voltage fangs. It has a 20% chance to numb and a 20% chance to lower Defense by two steps."jLaunches many homing bolts. Deals 50% more damage unless it's the first turn the target is in battle."ZThe user rocks out by using each Sound-based move they know. Only one use per battle."QO usuário atira uma partícula dimensional, diminuindo a Def. Esp. do alvo."[O usuário medita, aumentando tanto seu Ataque quanto seu Atk. Esp. em quatro níveis."qO usuário habilidosamente ataca um ponto fraco da guarda do oponente. Não pode errar e ignora proteções."yO usuário atrasa a mente do alvo com um golpe imbuído de energia psíquica. Isso tem 30% de chance de causar frio."gApaga uma parte da psique do alvo. Anula o último movimento utilizado pelo alvo por cinco turnos."kAstral energy explodes around the target. This move always goes first. The user also takes 50% recoil."KBy sacrificing half its max HP, the user makes the target fall asleep."^The user's HP is restored by 50% of the damage dealt. Power doubles if the foe is asleep."bSummons eclipse for six turns, boosting Psychic-type attacks and heralding the total eclipse."eThe user slashes the target with aura-enriched wings. This boosts the user's Speed by two steps."yThe user psychically exploits weak points in the target's mind. Can random critical hit, and does so twice as often."lThe user psychically modifies its own genes, transforming into either Overmatter form or Overmind form."`The user claps with the power of a hundred hands, psionically striking all nearby battlers."bThe user swings its pendulum to cure a statused target, but make them fall into a deep sleep."KThe user dizzies the target, then welcomes in eclipse for eight turns."VThe user encourages the target to attack right after the user. Always goes first."aThe user conjures a giant fist to crush the target, trapping and binding it for three turns."]The user grabs the target with a conjured hand, trapping and binding it for three turns."xThe user psychically alters the target's brain to forget. This move disables the target's last move for five turns."lThe user syncs its mind with its teammates, raising its Sp. Atk by three steps, and its allies' by one."fThe target is hit by a weak telekinetic force. It has a 20% chance to lower the target's Sp. Def."lThe user spends 50% HP to create a Substitute. If successful, the user's Speed is raised by four steps."[The target is hit by a strong telekinetic force. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Def."nThe use