owers its Sp. Atk by five steps."�The user connects to the target's brainwaves to stabilize its mind, curing its dizziness, and granting it its other legal ability."eThe user takes control of the target's mind to unleash an attack on it. Can random critical hit."uThe user creates a bizarre area in which slower Pokémon get to move first for five turns. Only usable by Hoopa."eThe user imparts knowledge on its ally Pokémon, raising their Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps."aO usuário congela tão severamente oponentes próximos que suas velocidades tornam-se zero."rUma aurora boreal reluz intensamente sobre o alvo, diminuindo seu Ataque em um estágio. Sempre vai primeiro."FO usuário diminui a temperatura corporal do alvo, causando frio."VO usuário envolve o alvo em um abraço gelado. Tem 10% de chance de causar frio."�O usuário prepara um ataque com memórias de um frio ancestral antes de atacar. Se atingido por um movimento especial, causa frio no atacante."ZThe target is put to sleep via a deep freeze. The user is exhausted on the next turn."qThe user covers the field with an fog of ice crystals, summoning hail and creating Grey Mist for five turns."pThe user summons a wind that drains vitality from all nearby foes. This has a 20% chance to frostbite them."_Attacks with energy from jealousy. All opposing Pokémon with stat boosts get frostbitten."XThe user jabs the target with a sharp icicle. It has a 40% chance to lower Defense."_The target is punched with a tremendous icy force. This move can't be used twice in a row."PThe target is overwhelmed by cold energy. It has a 30% chance to frostbite."~The user lays a hazard layer of frozen spikes on the foe's side. One layer hurts switched in foes, two layers frostbites."The user chomps down with icy cold fangs. It has a 20% chance to frostbite and a 20% chance to lower Defense by two steps."KRams the target with frigid force. This has a 10% chance to frostbite."gThe user attacks the target with a frontal cold wind. It lowers