ivo contra o tipo Voador."jInvoca os aspectos de muitos dragões, atacando com um movimento físico e com um movimento especial."]O usuário ataca movido pela ira. Dá o dobro de dano se resultar em um acerto crítico."MO usuário cospe suco gástrico no alvo, destruindo seu item equipável."]O usuário ameaçadoramente corta o alvo. Durante o eclipse, o alvo também é queimado."{O usuário rasga e dilacera tudo ao seu redor, causando dano a todos os Pokémon próximos e levando 50% de dano colateral."kO usuário morde e drena a energia do alvo. Os PV do usuário são restaurados em 50% do dano causado."�O usuário acorda instintos primitivos para atin-
gir o alvo. Isso tem 20% de chance de diminuir o Ataque ou o Atk. Esp. do alvo (o que for maior)."~The user crushes the target with evil intent. This deals double damage if the target has a non-volatile status condition."�Eyes pulsing with rainbow energy damage the target and force it to hand over its held item. Items stolen from wild Pokémon are stored."fExhales magical fumes with a 30% chance to burn or frostbite the target depending on their stats."WSends hindering waves of energy forward, lowering hit foes' Evasion by four steps."`Doubles target ally's Attack and Speed. However, if the user faints, so too does that ally."^The user inspires a sudden dread in the target, damaging it. This move always goes first."xThe user launches four Dreepies, which spread out equally to hit near foes. But, they avoid targets they can't hit."uThe user charges, then attacks on the second turn. This burns or frostbites the target depending on their stats."]The user shakes the target with a deep, rumbling roar. This attack does physical damage."rProtects the user from attacks. If an eclipse is active, extends it by one turn. Fails if used in succession."}The target is harmed by a malevolent sound. This has a 20% chance to lower the higher of the target's Attack or Sp. Atk."YThe user strikes from swampy ground like a serpent. It has a 30% chance to waterlog."�The user flies high up into the air at supersonic speed, charging and becoming hidden. It greatly increases in power the faster the user is."aThe user looms over the target with awful menace, lowering their highest stat by four steps."VAttacks all foes with dormant draconic energy. Power increases by 50% in eclipse."�The user sprays the target with a shrinking liquid. For the next three turns, the target's highest stat will be lowered by two steps."`The user makes an offering, then multi-hits two to five times. Scatters coins for each hit."aThe user whips up a tornado to tear at the target. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."bThe user lets out a thunderous noise while sleeping. This move can only be used while asleep."eThe user charges up insane amounts of energy the first turn, then transforms on the second turn."rThe user strikes with a simultaneous three-beam attack. It has a 20% chance each to numb, burn, or frostbite."pThe user throws a royal fit to rampage for two turns. Raises Speed if a target is knocked out by this move."xThe Pokémon blots out the sky, summoning eclipse for eight turns and lowering each opponent's Attack by two steps."pThe user roots itself, then strikes at the target with serpentine strength. This has a 30% chance to leech."}Escuridão consome o campo de batalha, causando dano a todos os outros Pokémon e iniciando Névoa Cinzenta por cinco turnos."�O usuário insulta o alvo usando um elogio. O Ataque e Atk. Esp. do alvo são aumentados em três níveis, mas ele se machuca em confusão."KO usuário maximiza seu Atk. Esp. em troca de 33% de seus PV máximos."�Morde uma fenda na realidade, criando um buraco negro que ataca todos os oponentes próximos. Intensifica Gravidade por cinco turnos."aO usuário remove a energia e a luz que cercam o alvo. Superefetivo contra o tipo Elétrico."mEste ataque dá 50% mais dano se o alvo possui mudanças de atributo, sejam elas positivas ou negativas."�O usuário sacrifica seu aliado e cobre todos os oponentes próximos em escuridão, deixando-os com sono. Falha se o usuário não tiver aliados."[Habilmente armadilha uma camada de espinhos ao redor do oponente, então sai de campo."\Se o alvo é o último membro saudável de sua equipe, o poder deste ataque é dobrado."qThe user tries to pick off a weak target. After damage, if the target is below 25% HP, they instantly faint."oThe user burrows into the target's subconscious with emotional manipulation. It has a 10% chance to leech."`The user disarms the target's blade. The target cannot use slice-based moves for two turns."GThe target is forced underwater for a brief time, waterlogging it."XThe user pushes the target violently into water. This has a 10% chance to waterlog."dWhen the user knocks out a target with this move, this raises the user's Sp. Atk by five steps."nThe user indulges its love of battle by striking a foe. Both of the user's Attack and Sp. Atk are raised."^The user raises all of their stats by two steps. Fails unless a foe is below half health."^The user attacks with dark illusions. This also lowers the target's Defense by two steps."hThe target is attacked with a pulse of negative feelings. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."cA punch that inflicts double the damage if the user has been hurt by the foe in the same turn."MPelo resto do turno, a cura de todos os Pokémon atingidos é invertida."ZThe user prepares a precise cut. Always a critical hit. This lowers the user's Speed."VThe target is dragged viciously through water. This has a 30% chance to waterlog."^The user hides stealthily, charging and becoming hidden, then strikes on the second turn."gThe user emits a wave of anxious feelings which overwhelms all nearby Pokémon, taking 50% recoil."PSummons moonglow for eight turns and raises the user's Attack by two steps."LLowers the target's Sp. Atk, then heals itself by the target's Sp. Atk."hThe user chomps hard, cutting the target's HP by 50%, and the user's HP is restored by 50% of that."dDamages the target's life force directly. During moonglow, the target also becomes frostbitten."{The user tries to surprise-attack the target. Cannot miss in moonglow. Can random critical hit, and does so twice as often."_The user attacks and steals the foe's held item. It can't steal if the user holds an item."JThe user entangles the target's mind with dark thoughts, leeching it."?The user invades deep into the target's mind, leeching it."�The user demands tribute from the target. Scatters coins. Damage and coins are doubled if the target has a non-volatile status condition."KThe user steals the target's stat boosts, and then attacks. Goes last."pThe user slashes all around them, creating deep scars on all nearby foes. This lowers each target's Attack."tThe user schemes to raise its Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps. During moonglow, also raises Speed by two steps."OThe user hacks at the target with great violence. Can random critical hit."oThe user attacks and steals the foe's held item simultaneously. You then choose a party member to hold it."zExplodes, dealing an extra 30 base power to all nearby for each Spikes hazard layer underneath them. The user faints."rThe user darkly follows the target before striking. Inflicts double damage on a target that is switching out."jStares harshly, dealing double damage if they hurt the user this turn. Only usable on the first turn."EThe user heals itself by half of its max HP, or 66% in moonglow."SThe user bullies the target, causing distress. This has a 30% chance to leech."kThe user swings aggressively while suffering from nightmares. This move can only be used while asleep."yThe user transforms into a cloud of vermin, charging and becoming hidden. On the second turn it ambushes the target."oThe user submerges the target in water, then bludgeons them repeatedly. This has a 10% chance to waterlog."oO usuário canta de forma irritante e indiferente, irritando o alvo. Tem 30% de chance de atordoar o alvo."}O usuário golpeia o alvo e rouba seu item enquanto ele está atordoado. Itens roubados de Pokémon selvagens são guardados."HO alvo é induzido ao sono. Só pode ser usado durante a Lua Cheia."rO alvo é vítima de uma pegadinha com um enorme balde d'água. Isso tem 30% de chance de causar ensopamento."�O alvo é surpreendido por uma doação generosa. Consome até 1000 moedas espalhadas. O poder base aumenta em 10 para cada 100 consumidas."�Healing coral forms on the foe's side. For the next four turns, attacks on foes heal the user for 33% of the damage dealt. This can overheal."<Leeches the target by kissing them with its thin mouth."ZThe user dances in tune with a dreamlike energy, raising their Sp. Atk by four steps."lThe user goes to sleep and enters a dreamscape. This sets Sanctuary on the user's side for eight turns."aThe user tickles the target excessively, damaging it. This has a 20% chance to lower Attack."QThe target's mind is overloaded with emotion. Applies Torment to the target."gThe user shoots a magical arrow which seeks out the target's weak points. Can random critical hit."<An enchanting outcry. Can't miss and skips protections."yThe user dances vigorously, raising all its stats by three steps. The user’s stat steps are reset two turns later."}A patch of medicinal flowers sprouts across the battlefield. This heals every Pokémon for 1/8th HP each turn for five turns."`The user plays with the target with unnecessary force. It has a 50% chance to lower Attack."\The target is punished by a barrage of fae wind. This has a 30% chance of jinxing them."{The user draws the Crystal Caliburn, which empowers light and slice moves by 50% and transforms the holder into Royal form."WThe user flashes colorful light to damage the target. This move always goes first."GThe user chucks a party favor which explodes in the target's face."oMakes everyone's hearts beat together. Others can join in the Round and make the attack do greater damage."�The user uses honey to fully restore its HP. However, this lures swarming insects, trapping and binding the user for three turns."dThe user attempts to humble the target, guaranteeing a critical hit on foes with boosted stats."fThe user hopes for bad luck, jinxing the target. Attacks against them crit and pierce protection."lThe user wields an exaggerated power to strike the target. This lowers the user's Attack by four steps."yThe target is taunted by a deceptive look. It can't use status moves this or next turn. This move always goes first."LThe user leeches the target, then welcomes in moonglow for eight turns."|Enables random critical hits for the user, doubles its critical hit chance, and raises its Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps."]The user causes an accident, damaging the target. This has a 30% chance of jinxing them."XThe user causes the target to trip and fall. This has a 50% chance of jinxing them."TAttacks nearby foes with a misty explosion. The user loses half its current HP."�The user disappears in a cloud of mist, charging and becoming hidden. On the next turn, the target becomes jinxed and frostbitten."]Summons moonglow for six turns, boosting Fairy-type attacks and heralding the Full Moon."EThe user invokes forbidden celestial powers to smite the target."FThe user throws a tricky punch. Can't miss and skips protections."`The user bites with playful abandon. This deals double damage on the user's first turn out."rThe user creates a puzzling area for six turns in which Pokémon's unmodified Attack and Sp. Atk are swapped."pThe user captivates the target with something puzzling, then strikes. Super effective versus Psychic-types."iThe user foretells a terrible fate. Two turns later, the targeted spot is damaged by fated disaster."jThe user spins sugar into a ball launched at the target. The slower the user, the greater the damage."PA spirited wind blesses the user, raising its Sp. Atk, Speed, and Accuracy."GThe user goes on a wild tantrum, going on a rampage for two turns."wThe user swaps the target's held item with its own. It also switches its unmodified Speed with the target's Speed."LThe user uses fae magic to invoke the target's true name, jinxing them."VThe user attacks with its wards, dealing damage based on the user's Sp. Def stat."PStrikes the target with lunar light, then summons moonglow for eight turns."aA mischevious wind whips around to attack the target. This has a 50% chance of jinxing them."hThe user ponders ancient wisdom, selecting three random status moves. You choose which one it uses."rThe user mutates its genetic code, transforming into any of its 3 other forms. Only useable as Deoxys Normal."[The user makes 