t only the avatar of Rayquaza can use. All enemies struck lose their flinch immunity."sThe user slashes all near foes with with poisonous blades or edges. Will be critical against poisoned targets."\It swamps the area around the user with a giant sludge wave, poisoning everyone struck."|The user raises its Attack, Defense, and Accuracy by two steps. This summons an allied Ekans. User becomes Poison-type."gThe user sets Grey Mist for 8 turns and gives themselves a Black Sludge. User becomes Poison-type."cA cloud of poison gas is sprayed at all nearby foes, poisoning them. User becomes Poison-type."bThe user lays two hazard layers of poison spikes on the foe's side. User becomes Poison-type."}The user intensifies Gravity for five turns and damages all enemies for 1/4th of their max HP. User becomes Ground-type."�The user restores 1/8th of its HP. Raises its offensive-, but lowers defensive stats at the end of each turn. User becomes Ground-type."]The user lays three hazard layers of Spikes on the foe's side. User becomes Ground-type."gA move that only the avatar of Groudon can use. Gravity is intensified for the rest of the battle."JThe user attacks with a prehistoric power which raises all its stats."IThe user attacks with a sparkling gem-like ray, dizzying the target."oBoulders are hurled at all near enemies, preventing their movement. This lowers their Speed by four steps."YThe user raises its Speed by six steps and gains a Rock Gem. User becomes Rock-type."kThe user summons sandstorm for six turns. This raises its Defense and Sp. Def. User becomes Rock-type."[The user restores 1/8th of its HP and summons an allied Combee. User becomes Bug-type."YThe user raises its Sp. Atk, Sp. Def, and Speed by two steps. User becomes Bug-type."vNearby foes are bound with silk. This lowers their Attack, Sp. Atk and Speed by two steps. User becomes Bug-type."SThe user applies a damaging curse to all nearby foes. User becomes Ghost-type."bAttackers against the user suffer recoil f