steps."_The user lowers the target's Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps. Then, the user switches out."MIf the user moves after the target, this attack's power will be doubled."NThe user attacks with a pillar of dark light. This ignores their ability.">Inflicts double damage on a target that is switching out."?The user suppresses the target and makes its move go last."dThe user yells as if it is ranting about something, lowering the target's Sp. Atk by two steps."gThis turn, the user steals the effects of healing, buffing, or protective screen moves a foe uses."kThis move enables the user to attack first. It fails if the target is not readying an attack, however."OThe user trades held items with the target faster than the eye can follow."eThe target is taunted into a rage that prevents it from using status moves for three more turns."pThe user attacks and steals the foe's held item simultaneously. Items stolen from wild Pokémon are stored."aThe user attacks the target's throat. The target cannot use sound-based moves for two turns."kAll stat step changes affecting the target turn topsy-turvy and become the opposite of what they were."fThe user torments and enrages the foe, making it incapable of using the same move twice in a row."^The user strikes with a fierce blow of Dark Mastery. It always results in a critical hit."gThe user raises the Defense and Sp. Def of an ally Pokémon by two steps using a mysterious aroma."qThe user stares with its baby-doll eyes, which lowers the target's Attack by three steps. Always goes first."[The user gazes charmingly at the target. The target's Attack is lowered by four steps."WThe user protects itself and its allies from status moves with a mysterious power."TThe user emits a powerful damaging flash. It has a 40% chance to lower Sp. Atk."TThe user does emotional damage to the target. Can't miss and skips protections."gThe user steals the target's HP with a kiss. The user's HP is restored by 75% of the damage dealt."CThe user stirs up a fairy wind and strikes the target with it."TThe user unleashes a strong beam. This lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."\The user charges with energy and raises all of its stats by two steps on the next turn."bFires a powerful beam of light drawn from the Eternal Flower. The user also takes 50% recoil."_The user attacks by borrowing the power of the moon. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Atk."XThe user hits the target with the force of nature. It cuts the target's HP to half."^The user plays rough with the target and attacks it. It has a 20% chance to lower Attack."XAttacks the target and breaks its spirit. Lowers the target's Sp. Atk by two steps."dThe user attacks foes with love and hate. It has a 30% chance to lower both Attack and Sp. Atk."WThe user kisses the target with a sweet, angelic cuteness that dizzies the target."�The user attacks with a secret power that has a 30% chance to cause an effect. The effect varies depending on the user's environment."6The user attacks the target by dancing very hard."XAn attack empowered by the might of a lazy king. It skips and destroys protections."RThe user steadies its eyes, mind, and body in order to maximize its Accuracy."_The user exposes its teeth in a menacing way, lowering the target's Defense by four steps."wThe user and the target both fall asleep, fully restoring their HP and healing any non-volatile status conditions."The user engages the target in a head-to-head fight. The damage is based on the target's Attack rather than their Defense."^The user concentrates to stabilize its mood. It raises the user's Sp. Def by three steps."HThe user attacks with the full force of The Market. Scatters coins."jThe user thrashes while infused with elements. It has a 15% chance each to poison, waterlog or leech."\The user stimulates its brain by planning. It raises the user's Sp. Atk by three steps."sThe user chooses between the three most recent moves used by the opposing team, and uses that move themselves."WThe user curls up to conceal weak spots and raise both of its Defense and Sp. Def."TThe user dazzles nearby foes with light. Their Sp. Atk is lowered by two steps."=The user shoots a pulse of diffuse energy at the target."rThe user calls its team to a farm-fresh meal, sacrificing 25% HP to heal each of its party members by 25% HP."aThe user attacks with a disrupting beam of common sense. Super effective versus Fairy-types."oThis attack inflicts double damage on a waterlogged foe. It also cures the target's waterlogging, however."�The user gifts the target a bad egg, damaging them, and draining their vital essence. This move deals 50 damage. The user's HP is restored by 100% of the damage dealt."oThe user chooses between Searing Crunch, Glacial Crunch, Aquatic Crunch, and Volt Crunch to use this turn."`The user chooses between Fire Fang, Ice Fang, Hydro Fang, or Thunder Fang to use this turn."{The user performs a spirited dance for its allies and itself, raising their Speed and raising their Accuracy by four steps."�The user foretells your choice of Fire, Electric, or Ice-type. One turn later, the targeted spot explodes with energy of that type."fChanneling fear, the user bites the target. Deals double damage if the user is below half health."VThe user channels ancient energy to grant a nearby ally an extra turn this round."XDeals more damage the less HP the user has. After attacking, the user switches out."mThe user's eyes glow with divine judgement, numbing the target and lowering both its Attack and Sp. Atk."OThe user focuses its aim to raise its Sp. Atk and Accuracy by three steps."CThe user slashes broadly, cleanly slicing all nearby battlers."_The user cleans the target aggressively with soapy water. It has a 50% chance to waterlog."XThe user spins the target with a cleansing vortex. It has a 30% chance to waterlog."iThe user lounges around with decadent laziness, restoring its HP by 66%. This move always goes last."oA lullaby is sung in a calming voice that puts the target with half its HP or less left into a deep sleep."hThe target is struck by a pulse of negative energy. This resets the target's positive stat changes."`The target is cut by a piercing slash. Can random critical hit, and does so twice as often."@The user shoots a pulse of neutral particles at the target."The user suddenly falls asleep for one turn, making enemies drop their guard, lowering their Defense and Sp. Def by four steps."aThe user pranks the target, surprising it and lowering its Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps."kThe user expresses a mystical potential. Changes type to match the user's Gem, Plate, or Crystal Veil."WThe user pulverizes the target with both its fists. This raises the user's Attack."oThe user warms up by treating the target as a punching bag, damaging them and raising Attack by two steps."{The user adorns itself or the target with precious stones, changing it to your choice of Fairy, Dragon, or Steel-type."\The user performs a long-forgotten song and dance. This is both a Sound and Dance move."LThe user switches out to a party Pokémon in waiting. Always goes last."eThe user attacks the target with stored power. Has 10 more base power for each raised stat step."rThe user brings down a ruinous power on the target. This has a 20% chance of lowering all the target's stats."�A blessed screen protects the user's side from critical hits for five turns, reducing move damage taken by 25%, or 20% in multi battles."dThe user strikes while inviting the power of seasons. The user changes form to the next season."KThe user shouts with force at the target. This move always hits first."FThe user charges, then puts the target to sleep on the next turn."\The user smirks with confidence. The Sp. Def of nearby enemies is lowered by two steps."|A barrage of star-shaped rays are shot at the target, to multi-hit two to five times. Can't miss and skips protections."TThe user emits a deep, rumbling snore. This move can only be used while asleep."fThe user attacks and steals items from all near foes. Items stolen from wild Pokémon are stored."lThe user flings the dirty oil on its fur. It transfers any non-volatile status condition to the target."gThe user strikes the target, then slinks into the water. The user takes 33% less damage this turn."rThe user causes the air around the target to explode. The move's type is changed based on the active weather."�The user throws away up to 1000 scattered coins to bless its side, blocking random added effects and healing for 1/16th HP each turn. Lasts one turn per 100 coins."[Alters the reality of the area to damage a foe. Puzzle Room is created for five turns."bThe user conjures up the past, transforming the target into their previous evolutionary form."aThe user forms their excitement into a lash with a 20% chance of raising the user's Sp. Atk."{Enables random critical hits for the user, doubles its critical hit chance, and raises its Attack and Defense by two steps."cThe user contorts the target's chi with an energy pulse, damaging it and lowering its Sp. Def."dAura deep within the user's body is spurred to pulse outward. Can't miss and skips protections."{This Pokémon charges up for a turn, then releases a powerful beam of aura. This does more damage the less HP the user has."cThe target is barred by rules which prevent it from using off-type moves for three more turns."QThe user hugs the target intensely, trapping and binding it for three turns."OThe user improvises a dance, raising its two weakest stats by three steps."kThe user flexes its rocky skin, raising its Attack and Defense by two steps and gaining the Rock-type."gThe user and its allies take 50% less attack damage this turn. Always fails if used in succession."MThe user risks an explosive arcing full bodied punch against the target."dCombining dance and martial art, the user strikes the target and raises its Speed by two steps."HPins the target with building materials. The target becomes barred."PThe user fires 