r fires a stormy gust at the target. This also raises the user's Sp. Atk by two steps."`The user whips up a cold north wind to attack the target. It has a 30% chance to frostbite."nAn apple falls from high up to strike the foe. Always goes first. Deals double damage in intense Gravity."XThe user propels a gale-force wind at the target. It has a 10% chance to frostbite."SWinds from all directions arrive together in a flurry to rip about the target."tThe opponent is shredded by talons. This attack always results in a critical hit, but applies jinx to the user."YThe user sends a chilly wind towards the target. This has a 10% chance to frostbite."~A high pitched screech lowers all nearby foes' Defense, Sp. Def, and Evasion by three steps. Can't miss and skips protections."[The target is jabbed repeatedly with a horn or beak that multi-hits two to five times."aThe user attacks with a divine wind to punish the target. Super effective versus Dark-types."UThe user hops high up to land on the target's head. It has a 10% chance to numb."fThe user chases the target and strikes it from above. It does more damage the faster the user is."cThe user whips up a lingering tailwind that ups the Speed of all party Pokémon for six turns."eThe user takes off at sonic speeds, raising its Speed by four steps and gaining the Flying type."_The user launches a pulse in the form of a shock wave. It has a 20% chance to raise Speed."tThe user falls from up high, crushing the target beneath. This move does 30% more damage if the user is asleep."]The user quickly jumps high up, then falls onto the target. It has a 10% chance to numb."uThe user quickly increases the air pressure to damage the target. This attack always goes before any other move."�Clears hazards on the opponent's side of the field, moves hazards on the user's side to the opponent's, then forces the targets to switch."_Attacks all near foes while clearing weather. This move fails in the absence of a weather."}The user swoops into battle with a piercing shriek, flinching the target. It only works the first turn the user is in battle."[The user assists an ally by boosting the power and Accuracy of its next attack by 50%."^The user strikes the target with a dart of air. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."BThe user slashes the target while dashing skillfully past it."gThe user shoots out a pulse of driving energy. Building up more power, it raises the user's Speed."KWind rapidly spins the target in place to multi-hit two to five times."UThe target is struck with large, imposing wings. The user also takes 20% recoil."RThe user lobs harsh acid at the target. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Def."KThe user and target bathe in acid. The user loses half its current HP."tThe user lashes the target with its corroded tail. This hits Steel-types for neutral damage and lowers Defense."`The user sprays the target with a corrosive chemical solution. It has a 30% chance to numb."WThe user infects the target with a touch and also destroys any Herbs it's holding."~The user launches a ball of trash to roll over all foes. The targets' held Berry or Gem stick to the ball and become unusable."EThe user partially dissolves, raising its Sp. Def by five steps."fThe user steals blood. If the target is knocked out, this raises the user's Attack by five steps."aA Grey Mist covers the battlefield. For five turns, stats are reset at the end of each turn."FThe user attacks while slathered in grime. This poisons the user."PThe user envelops the target in a foul wind. It has a 30% chance to poison."ZThe user stabs the opponent with a toxin-infused limb. It has a 10% chance to poison."XThe user shoots the target with a dart made of toxins. This move always goes first."{The user lays a hazard layer of poison spikes on the foe's side. One layer hurts switched in foes, two layers poisons."sThe user jabs the target with its stinger while retreating. This poisons the target and switches the user out."NThe user attacks with sticky slime, rendering the target's item unusable."]The user punches the target while holding a wad of slime. It has a 30% chance to poison."hThe user uses venom that turns the target's body against it. Super effective versus Fighting-types."\Attacks with energy from jealousy. All opposing Pokémon with stat boosts get poisoned."[The user gives off a terrible stench towards the target. It has a 30% chance to dizzy."iThe target is forced to switch out by a stinky cloud, then the user also switches. Always goes last."LThe user bites the target with toxic fangs with a 30% chance to poison."_The user chomps with venomous teeth. The user's HP is restored by 33% of the damage dealt."EThe target is given a Black Sludge, replacing their item if any."]Halves attack damage taken this turn. Poisons any attackers. Fails if used successively."CThe user blasts a bundle of venom at the target, poisoning it."OThe user finishes off its prey. Power is tripled against poisoned targets."WThe user opens a rift beneath the target, trapping and binding it for three turns."WThe target is consumed by a desert storm, trapping and binding it for three turns."^The user whips up a hot desert twister to attack the target. It has a 30% chance to burn."PThe user whips up dirt at supersonic speeds, damaging everything around it."sThe user cracks the earth under the target with a massive strike. This lowers the user's Attack by four steps."aAttacks by blasting dirt and debris at the target. This move always goes first in sandstorm."mThe user uses all their might to attack their opponent, forcing the user to use Rest on their next turn."`The user stabilizes its stance. This raises its Attack, Sp. Def, and Accuracy by two steps."aEnergy is sent through a conduit, erupting under the target. This move is also Psychic-type."uThe user propels itself forward with a wave of mud which also slams into the target. The user's Speed is raised."`The user attacks by hurling a blob of mud. It has a 20% chance to 