nt. This deals double damage to targets with a non-volatile status condition."NThe user exhales a mighty gust that inflicts damage and numbs the target."sA move that only the avatar of Zekrom can use. All battlers gain Steel-type and have their stat changes reset."QThe user raises its Attack and Speed by two steps. User becomes Dragon-type."ZThe user lowers each near foe's highest stat by four steps. User becomes Dragon-type."oA move that only the avatar of Reshiram can use. All battlers have all of their stats raised by two steps."|The user summons an allied Poochyena. This raises its Attack by three steps, and its allies' by one. User becomes Dark-type."cThe user torments all near foes, preventing them from repeating moves. User becomes Dark-type."gThe user blasts all nearby foes with the moon's full power, lowering their Sp. Atk by three steps."HThe user raises its Sp. Atk by four steps. User becomes Fairy-type."yThe user summons moonglow for six turns. This raises the Defense and Sp. Def of all allies. User becomes Fairy-type."oThe user creates a Puzzle Room for six turns. This raises its Attack and Sp. Atk. User becomes Fairy-type."AThis move exists just to showcase the PBS Extensions system.Iu;␀�3[[�"
