 Snapshots"\Whether to automatically take screenshots of your Party Showcase after major victories."Prompt Level Moves"CWhether to let your Pokémon learn new moves when leveling up."Show Stat Changes"OWhether to show how your Pokémon's stats change on level up or evolution."Aid Kit Animation"QWhether to play an animation showing your party being healed by the Aid Kit."EXP-EZ Dispenser Animation"^Whether to play an animation showing the Pokemon being fed candy by the EXP-EZ Dispenser."Quick Evolution"HWhether to shorten the cutscene that plays when a Pokémon evolves."User Interface Options"Screen Size""How large the game screen is."S"M"L"XL"	Full"Dark Mode"FWhether or not user interface elements use a darker color scheme."Speech Frame")Which frame surrounds message boxes."Menu Frame"6Which frame surrounds other user interface menus."Text Entry"0Which method you want to use to enter text."Cursor"Keyboard"Bag Sorting"7How should items in your bag be sorted? Automatic."Hide Unseen Species"7Which species should the MasterDex avoid spoiling?"Legends"Name on Showcase"?Whether or not to put your player name on Party Showcases."Advanced Tutorials"AWhether to show popups explaining changes and new mechanics."Battle Options"Battle Effects"?How to treat move and effect animations. Fast is 2x speed."Standard"Battle Transitions"OWhether to speed up animations like starting battle or switching battlers."Damage Numbers"OWhether to display how much damage an attack did over the Pokémon's head."Effect. Messages"/Whether to state how effective a move was."Weather Messages"6Whether to show messages about weather mechanics."Status Messages"?Whether to show messages about status condition mechanics."Move Messages"GWhether to show messages when moves change base power or category."Avatar Messages"5Whether to show messages about avatar mechanics."Overworld Options"Default Movement"JWhether walking or running should be your player character's default."Walking"Running"Autosave"HWhether the game should save when healing and every 40 steps taken."Pokémon Follow"4Whether your first Pokémon follows behind you."World Weather"8Whether overworld areas experience random weathers."Force Time"?Force the overworld lighting of a certain hour of the day."6"12"18"24"Advanced Graphics Options"Color Shifts"@Whether Pokémon have unique appearances. Disable if laggy."Particles";Whether to display particle effects. Disable if laggy."Screenshake";Whether to use screen shake effects. Disable if laggy."Flashing">Whether to use screen flash effects. Disable if annoying."(Could not create game Options file."Speed Options"UI Options"Adv. Graphics Options"Player Appearance"Controls"Language"!Game language was unchanged.""Game language changed to {1}!"Type {1}/{2}"What do you want to do?"Connect"Customize" What do you want to change?"Trainer Class"Win Message"Loss Message"Withdraw Item"Deposit Item"Toss Item"!Take out items from storage."Store items in the safe.")Throw away items stored in the safe."Do nothing."There are no items."There's no Mail here.",What do you want to do with {1}'s Mail?"	Read"Move to Bag"*The message will be lost. Is that OK?">The Mail was returned to the Bag with its message erased."The Bag is full."&\se[PC open]{1} booted up the PC."Item Storage"Mailbox"Turn Off"Pokémon Storage PC":\se[PC access]The Pokémon Storage System was opened."See ya!"6Organize the Pokémon in Boxes and in your party."1Move Pokémon stored in Boxes to your party."+Store Pokémon in your party in Boxes."!Return to the previous menu."Item Storage PC"%\se[PC access]Accessed {1}'s PC."View MasterDex"View Moves"View Items"View Item"View which information?"View which item?"Team Submitted by {1}".#{pokemon.name} Lv. #{pokemon.level.to_s}"No Ability"CONFIRM"Give to which Pokémon?"{1} (PP: ---)"{1} (PP: {2}/{3})"	ABLE"NOT ABLE"INELIGIBLE"NOT ENTERED"BANNED"
