 Snapshots"\Whether to automatically take screenshots of your Party Showcase after major victories."Prompt Level Moves"CWhether to let your Pokémon learn new moves when leveling up."Show Stat Changes"OWhether to show how your Pokémon's stats change on level up or evolution."Aid Kit Animation"QWhether to play an animation showing your party being healed by the Aid Kit."EXP-EZ Dispenser Animation"^Whether to play an animation showing the Pokemon being fed candy by the EXP-EZ Dispenser."Quick Evolution"HWhether to shorten the cutscene that plays when a Pokémon evolves."User Interface Options"Screen Size""How large the game screen is."S"M"L"XL"	Full"Dark Mode"FWhether or not user interface elements use a darker color scheme."Speech Frame")Which frame surrounds message boxes."Menu Frame"6Which frame surrounds other user interface menus."Text Entry"0Which method you want to use to enter text."Cursor"Keyboard"Bag Sorting"7How should items in your bag be sorted? Automatic."Hide Unseen Species"7Which species should the MasterDex avoid spoiling?"Legends"Name on Showcase"?Whether or not to put your player name on Party Showcases."Advanced Tutorials"AWhether to show popups explaining changes and new mechanics."Battle Options"Battle Effects"?How to treat move and effect animations. Fast is 2x speed."Standard"Battle Transitions"OWhether to speed up animations like starting battle or switching battlers."Damage Numbers"OWhether to display how much damage an attack did over the Pokémon's head."Effect. Messages"/Whether to state how effective a move was."Weather Messages"6Whether to show messages about weather mechanics."Status Messages"?Whether to show messages about status condition mechanics."Move Messages"GWhether to show messages when moves change base power or category."Avatar Messages"5Whether to show messages about avatar mechanics."Overworld Options"Default Movement"JWhether walking or running should be your player character's default."Walk